(222364, 12914, 2989, '<td valign="top">The slight gradient in the sky and the bright brown color of the building create some great colors for this shot.  It''s cropped perfectly and it''s one of my favorites of the week.  I''d buy it! 10! - xertion</td>', 'The slight gradient in the sky and the bright brown color of the building create some great colors for this shot.  It''s cropped perfectly and it''s one of my favorites of the week.  I''d buy it! 10! - xertion', '2003-02-24 09:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(222366, 12926, 772, '<td valign="top">Hi Ben :)  I think you chose a good orientation for this photo and I also think it makes a good stock shot... I think it could be enhanced a bit by toning it in a cool color range to support the ''dreaming'' theme... good work :) - setzler</td>', 'Hi Ben :)  I think you chose a good orientation for this photo and I also think it makes a good stock shot... I think it could be enhanced a bit by toning it in a cool color range to support the ''dreaming'' theme... good work :) - setzler', '2003-02-24 09:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(222370, 13045, 2989, '<td valign="top">The focusing is right on, and fortunately enough for you, your camera has a great zoom or you have some really nice lense attatchments.  The lighting is excellent.  I''m not sure if this is how you intended it, but it appears to be shining on him (as he faces east) in the morning, as he is about to crow.</td>', 'The focusing is right on, and fortunately enough for you, your camera has a great zoom or you have some really nice lense attatchments.  The lighting is excellent.  I''m not sure if this is how you intended it, but it appears to be shining on him (as he faces east) in the morning, as he is about to crow.', '2003-02-24 09:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
