(222372, 12840, 2989, '<td valign="top">The choice of subject is very interesting and the focusing adds a lot to the shot.  I do wish the lighting were better as the odd shadows take away from the picture.  10! - xertion</td>', 'The choice of subject is very interesting and the focusing adds a lot to the shot.  I do wish the lighting were better as the odd shadows take away from the picture.  10! - xertion', '2003-02-24 09:29:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(222374, 13060, 772, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting abstract.  I don''t know a lot about stock photos, but this one concerns me slightly.  Without the title, I don''t really know what I''m looking at, and in the world of stock photography, you have to be able to sell you image for use in various media.  I''m not sure what type of media would use an image like this :) - setzler</td>', 'This is an interesting abstract.  I don''t know a lot about stock photos, but this one concerns me slightly.  Without the title, I don''t really know what I''m looking at, and in the world of stock photography, you have to be able to sell you image for use in various media.  I''m not sure what type of media would use an image like this :) - setzler', '2003-02-24 09:29:38.000000', NULL, 1),
