(222620, 13084, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a good photo, but I''m not sure how well it would work for ''stock photography''.  Stock photos generally are not specific to brands and don''t contain company logos, trademarks, etc... - setzler</td>', 'This is a good photo, but I''m not sure how well it would work for ''stock photography''.  Stock photos generally are not specific to brands and don''t contain company logos, trademarks, etc... - setzler', '2003-02-24 13:19:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(222623, 12869, 772, '<td valign="top">I think this is a great advertisement photo and it''s very well executes also.  The brand name showing on the golf balls would likely create issues with it being used as stock photography.  - setzler</td>', 'I think this is a great advertisement photo and it''s very well executes also.  The brand name showing on the golf balls would likely create issues with it being used as stock photography.  - setzler', '2003-02-24 13:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(222625, 13098, 6100, '<td valign="top">Very nice high contrast image. The shadow in the upper right corner could be thought of as adding to (very subtle leading line) or subtracting from the image (draws the eye away from the main subject). Unfortunately, I think it draws the eye away. You''ve done a good job of keeping the shadows to a minimum. You''ve certainly met the challenge.</td>', 'Very nice high contrast image. The shadow in the upper right corner could be thought of as adding to (very subtle leading line) or subtracting from the image (draws the eye away from the main subject). Unfortunately, I think it draws the eye away. You''ve done a good job of keeping the shadows to a minimum. You''ve certainly met the challenge.', '2003-02-24 13:21:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(222628, 12840, 6100, '<td valign="top">I don''t think I ever tire of seeing old cameras -- especially bellows models. Since all of the writing on the camera goes the same way, I''d like to see the camera standing up rather than laying down. The viewfinder would be the correct way then, too. I would try to put the entire front lens in focus by giving just a slight bit more DOF. It''s a very nice image and could be used to illustrate many things in the stock photography world.</td>', 'I don''t think I ever tire of seeing old cameras -- especially bellows models. Since all of the writing on the camera goes the same way, I''d like to see the camera standing up rather than laying down. The viewfinder would be the correct way then, too. I would try to put the entire front lens in focus by giving just a slight bit more DOF. It''s a very nice image and could be used to illustrate many things in the stock photography world.', '2003-02-24 13:25:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(222630, 13071, 6100, '<td valign="top">Good use of the rule-of-thirds concept. I think the cones are just a little dark compared to the sky but I could see this used in a textbook or along with a magazine editorial piece.</td>', 'Good use of the rule-of-thirds concept. I think the cones are just a little dark compared to the sky but I could see this used in a textbook or along with a magazine editorial piece.', '2003-02-24 13:27:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(222637, 13018, 6100, '<td valign="top">I think this image would be better if it were sharper overall. There seems to be a dark spot along the right hand side and a few other spots (maybe your CCD needs cleaning). None the less, you''ve handled it quite well with the lighting and framing.</td>', 'I think this image would be better if it were sharper overall. There seems to be a dark spot along the right hand side and a few other spots (maybe your CCD needs cleaning). None the less, you''ve handled it quite well with the lighting and framing.', '2003-02-24 13:32:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(222641, 13005, 6100, '<td valign="top">If I were buying images like a picture editor does I might find it hard to use this one to illustrate "Military and Defence" as you suggest in your title. I would worry that the rifle is pointed toward the head of one of the soldiers (it might not be, it just could be taken that way) and that demonstrates carelessness ... not something I want in the military. The focus is on the mark and the background is not distracting from your main subjects.</td>', 'If I were buying images like a picture editor does I might find it hard to use this one to illustrate "Military and Defence" as you suggest in your title. I would worry that the rifle is pointed toward the head of one of the soldiers (it might not be, it just could be taken that way) and that demonstrates carelessness ... not something I want in the military. The focus is on the mark and the background is not distracting from your main subjects.', '2003-02-24 13:37:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(222644, 13101, 6100, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot but I don''t see much use in the "stock" world unless it''s used to illustrate this particular type of flower. In my opinion, for stock use, the cropping is too tight for an editor to work with easily. The colors are quite attractive, though and technically it is an excellent picture.</td>', 'Very nice shot but I don''t see much use in the "stock" world unless it''s used to illustrate this particular type of flower. In my opinion, for stock use, the cropping is too tight for an editor to work with easily. The colors are quite attractive, though and technically it is an excellent picture.', '2003-02-24 13:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(222647, 13054, 6100, '<td valign="top">Good composition. If I were a photo editor, I would want the foreground as sharp as the background.</td>', 'Good composition. If I were a photo editor, I would want the foreground as sharp as the background.', '2003-02-24 13:43:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(222649, 12976, 6100, '<td valign="top">It''s not too often that one sees a rainbow as long as this. I saw some recently when I was in Hawaii but I don''t think I had ever seen one before that. You''ve captured this one nicely.</td>', 'It''s not too often that one sees a rainbow as long as this. I saw some recently when I was in Hawaii but I don''t think I had ever seen one before that. You''ve captured this one nicely.', '2003-02-24 13:45:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(222655, 12971, 6100, '<td valign="top">Good composition. You''ve left enough space that a photo editor could make this a "portrait" or "landscape" crop and still have a very usable image. Sharp enough throughout to please a photo editor, too. Sometimes, though, they don''t want to see brand names. You''ve done a good job.</td>', 'Good composition. You''ve left enough space that a photo editor could make this a "portrait" or "landscape" crop and still have a very usable image. Sharp enough throughout to please a photo editor, too. Sometimes, though, they don''t want to see brand names. You''ve done a good job.', '2003-02-24 13:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(222666, 12882, 6100, '<td valign="top">These colors are fantastic without being garish. Nice design although I would have like a cropping to place the center a bit more to the left. Then the ribs of the umbrella would lead in to the center of the umbrella even more than they already do. I hope the spot in the upper right is on the umbrella and not in your camera.</td>', 'These colors are fantastic without being garish. Nice design although I would have like a cropping to place the center a bit more to the left. Then the ribs of the umbrella would lead in to the center of the umbrella even more than they already do. I hope the spot in the upper right is on the umbrella and not in your camera.', '2003-02-24 13:57:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(222668, 13120, 6100, '<td valign="top">Excellent picture and I could see this used in a variety of ways to illustrate many different things.</td>', 'Excellent picture and I could see this used in a variety of ways to illustrate many different things.', '2003-02-24 13:58:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(222671, 13082, 772, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot... very strong color :)  I think that mirroring this shot horizontally to put the blue in the upper left would make a stronger and more ''correct'' composition of the flag :) - setzler</td>', 'beautiful shot... very strong color :)  I think that mirroring this shot horizontally to put the blue in the upper left would make a stronger and more ''correct'' composition of the flag :) - setzler', '2003-02-24 14:00:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(222673, 13122, 772, '<td valign="top">This looks like a great photojournalism shot :) - setzler</td>', 'This looks like a great photojournalism shot :) - setzler', '2003-02-24 14:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(222674, 12928, 772, '<td valign="top">I believe that the yellow tint on the phone keys may hurt the overall impact of this image... maybe a little white balance adjustment in the camera would make this shot much stronger :) - setzler</td>', 'I believe that the yellow tint on the phone keys may hurt the overall impact of this image... maybe a little white balance adjustment in the camera would make this shot much stronger :) - setzler', '2003-02-24 14:02:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(222675, 12835, 772, '<td valign="top">Good use of shallow depth of field to isolate your fly from the fishing reel... nice work :)  - setzler</td>', 'Good use of shallow depth of field to isolate your fly from the fishing reel... nice work :)  - setzler', '2003-02-24 14:03:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(222676, 13125, 772, '<td valign="top">cute shot :)  I think that a darker sheet color would also help create some additional contrast between the child and the surroundings... nice shot :) - setzler</td>', 'cute shot :)  I think that a darker sheet color would also help create some additional contrast between the child and the surroundings... nice shot :) - setzler', '2003-02-24 14:04:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(222689, 13052, 4648, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful photo.  Should have cropped it a little closer on the right, as close as to the back feet.  Wonderful composition, great photo.</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful photo.  Should have cropped it a little closer on the right, as close as to the back feet.  Wonderful composition, great photo.', '2003-02-24 14:12:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(222696, 12969, 772, '<td valign="top">excellent job with the lighting... I believe that it may be possible to bring out the red on the face of this apple with some additional light coming into the frame from the lower left... - setzler</td>', 'excellent job with the lighting... I believe that it may be possible to bring out the red on the face of this apple with some additional light coming into the frame from the lower left... - setzler', '2003-02-24 14:13:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(222709, 12971, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a very nicely executed photo.  The lighting is great and this would make a great ad photo for Salomon.  I believe this photo would be rejected as a ''stock'' photo since the brand name of the boots is visible and would probalby be considered trademark infringement to use as stock photography... - setzler</td>', 'This is a very nicely executed photo.  The lighting is great and this would make a great ad photo for Salomon.  I believe this photo would be rejected as a ''stock'' photo since the brand name of the boots is visible and would probalby be considered trademark infringement to use as stock photography... - setzler', '2003-02-24 14:15:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(222734, 13059, 4648, '<td valign="top">OMG.  Looks like a postcard.  Absolutely georgeous.   If there is a complaint, it would be that I might like to see the shadows a little sharper and  more distinguished.  But doesn''t need to be for the photo.  It''s a ten in my book.</td>', 'OMG.  Looks like a postcard.  Absolutely georgeous.   If there is a complaint, it would be that I might like to see the shadows a little sharper and  more distinguished.  But doesn''t need to be for the photo.  It''s a ten in my book.', '2003-02-24 14:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(222751, 12880, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice shot, but the tonal range is very weak.  There is not enough contrast in the image to really make it stand out nicely.  Your elk blend in too much with the surroundings... - setzler</td>', 'This is a very nice shot, but the tonal range is very weak.  There is not enough contrast in the image to really make it stand out nicely.  Your elk blend in too much with the surroundings... - setzler', '2003-02-24 14:22:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(222763, 13082, 4648, '<td valign="top">One of the most beautiful photos of the flag I have ever seen.  The flag appears to be satin.  An awesome photo.  It''s a 10 for me.</td>', 'One of the most beautiful photos of the flag I have ever seen.  The flag appears to be satin.  An awesome photo.  It''s a 10 for me.', '2003-02-24 14:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(222780, 12840, 4648, '<td valign="top">Wish you had flipped this to the portrait position so the face of the camera could be read.  Also would have preferred who camer in focus on this shot.  Would be a 10 with these 2 changes.  The rest of the photo is good.</td>', 'Wish you had flipped this to the portrait position so the face of the camera could be read.  Also would have preferred who camer in focus on this shot.  Would be a 10 with these 2 changes.  The rest of the photo is good.', '2003-02-24 14:27:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(222807, 12942, 772, '<td valign="top">interesting shot :)  maybe a vertical shot showing the complete face of the train would also allow you to accent it''s length more in the image :) - setzler</td>', 'interesting shot :)  maybe a vertical shot showing the complete face of the train would also allow you to accent it''s length more in the image :) - setzler', '2003-02-24 14:33:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(222813, 13021, 772, '<td valign="top">This looks like it could be a good piece of artwork for a letterhead on paper.. - setzler</td>', 'This looks like it could be a good piece of artwork for a letterhead on paper.. - setzler', '2003-02-24 14:33:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(222860, 12972, 3575, '<td valign="top">Wow, what detail! It would be perfect if it''s left eye (my right) wasn''t in shadow but really it''s one of the best photos I''ve seen of a cat. The detail is wonderful. It''s so real that I feel like I need to sneeze! I think your crop is also perfect.</td>', 'Wow, what detail! It would be perfect if it''s left eye (my right) wasn''t in shadow but really it''s one of the best photos I''ve seen of a cat. The detail is wonderful. It''s so real that I feel like I need to sneeze! I think your crop is also perfect.', '2003-02-24 14:50:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(222862, 13000, 3575, '<td valign="top">Great idea and great job. I really like the purple background and the shadow makes the photo for me.</td>', 'Great idea and great job. I really like the purple background and the shadow makes the photo for me.', '2003-02-24 14:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(222874, 12909, 3575, '<td valign="top">You''ll have to have a property release if you want to sell this but that''s a different subject. Very well composed. I like how you took the photo from down the road and how my eyes follow the road all the way around. Very nice, pleasing photograph.</td>', 'You''ll have to have a property release if you want to sell this but that''s a different subject. Very well composed. I like how you took the photo from down the road and how my eyes follow the road all the way around. Very nice, pleasing photograph.', '2003-02-24 14:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(222878, 13120, 3575, '<td valign="top">Pretty child. I don''t care for the the way his/her face blends into the whit background though. I would like to see a sharper transition. Other than that I like the composition and the brilliant eye - must be a boy because girls aren''t blessed with eye lashes like this :)</td>', 'Pretty child. I don''t care for the the way his/her face blends into the whit background though. I would like to see a sharper transition. Other than that I like the composition and the brilliant eye - must be a boy because girls aren''t blessed with eye lashes like this :)', '2003-02-24 14:56:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(222887, 13059, 3575, '<td valign="top">You did a great job on this. I love the huge tree in the foreground that you could have kept out of the scene but it adds perspective to me It was taken late afternoon perhaps? The deep shadows also add to the overall appeal of the photograph. Beaufitully sharp detail and gorgeous brilliant blue sky.</td>', 'You did a great job on this. I love the huge tree in the foreground that you could have kept out of the scene but it adds perspective to me It was taken late afternoon perhaps? The deep shadows also add to the overall appeal of the photograph. Beaufitully sharp detail and gorgeous brilliant blue sky.', '2003-02-24 15:00:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(222888, 13059, 6405, '<td valign="top">Nice frame ,great contras and colors,perfect 10</td>', 'Nice frame ,great contras and colors,perfect 10', '2003-02-24 15:01:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(222889, 13099, 3575, '<td valign="top">I love the red! I know it was your artistic preference to have a shallow DOF but I think I would have liked the fork to be tack sharp. Nice composition</td>', 'I love the red! I know it was your artistic preference to have a shallow DOF but I think I would have liked the fork to be tack sharp. Nice composition', '2003-02-24 15:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(222890, 13087, 6405, '<td valign="top">Exaple how ugly concrete jungle can look beautiful, perfect 10 from me</td>', 'Exaple how ugly concrete jungle can look beautiful, perfect 10 from me', '2003-02-24 15:02:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(222892, 12862, 3575, '<td valign="top">I''ll buy it! I love this and I would think it would be very saleable. I wonder how you got the red shadow? Very, very nice.</td>', 'I''ll buy it! I love this and I would think it would be very saleable. I wonder how you got the red shadow? Very, very nice.', '2003-02-24 15:02:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(222893, 13052, 4159, '<td valign="top">This is an incredible capture.  Beautiful picture.  Good composition, lighting, the works.</td>', 'This is an incredible capture.  Beautiful picture.  Good composition, lighting, the works.', '2003-02-24 15:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(222894, 13045, 6405, '<td valign="top">I would like to see more space on the front of the bird, but technicals are great, 9 from me</td>', 'I would like to see more space on the front of the bird, but technicals are great, 9 from me', '2003-02-24 15:03:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(222895, 12969, 4159, '<td valign="top">Odd bluish spot detracts.  Eventually, too, it''s just an apple.</td>', 'Odd bluish spot detracts.  Eventually, too, it''s just an apple.', '2003-02-24 15:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(222896, 12985, 6405, '<td valign="top">colors and contrast is perfect 10 from me</td>', 'colors and contrast is perfect 10 from me', '2003-02-24 15:03:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(222897, 12978, 4159, '<td valign="top">Odd that you chose to cut off the petals the way you did, I think it was a bit much at the bottom.  Some parts are a little blurry, but all in all a good shot.</td>', 'Odd that you chose to cut off the petals the way you did, I think it was a bit much at the bottom.  Some parts are a little blurry, but all in all a good shot.', '2003-02-24 15:04:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(222898, 13093, 3575, '<td valign="top">Perfectly composed. I like the duo tone.</td>', 'Perfectly composed. I like the duo tone.', '2003-02-24 15:04:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(222899, 12953, 6405, '<td valign="top">nice contrast and sharp colors 9 from me</td>', 'nice contrast and sharp colors 9 from me', '2003-02-24 15:04:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(222902, 13041, 4159, '<td valign="top">Nice focus and colors, especially on the strawberry.  the dark above-upper-lip area is a bit distracting, almost appears that the subject is growing a mustache.  Edges of the fingers are indistinct.  Overall, though, nice work.</td>', 'Nice focus and colors, especially on the strawberry.  the dark above-upper-lip area is a bit distracting, almost appears that the subject is growing a mustache.  Edges of the fingers are indistinct.  Overall, though, nice work.', '2003-02-24 15:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(222904, 12926, 4159, '<td valign="top">The harsh lighting gives it more a nightmarish quality than I think you intended.</td>', 'The harsh lighting gives it more a nightmarish quality than I think you intended.', '2003-02-24 15:06:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(222905, 12849, 4159, '<td valign="top">Really cool color work here.  I''m not quite sure about the composition, but can make no suggestions.  Nice shot.</td>', 'Really cool color work here.  I''m not quite sure about the composition, but can make no suggestions.  Nice shot.', '2003-02-24 15:07:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(222909, 13062, 4159, '<td valign="top">Nice angle, but the colors are a bit yucky.  How would this look in B&amp;W?</td>', 'Nice angle, but the colors are a bit yucky.  How would this look in B&W?', '2003-02-24 15:08:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(222910, 13018, 4159, '<td valign="top">The spots in the white parts and the phone''s being dirty detract.  Nice composition, though.</td>', 'The spots in the white parts and the phone''s being dirty detract.  Nice composition, though.', '2003-02-24 15:09:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(222911, 12872, 4159, '<td valign="top">Seems to barely slant.  Nice colors.</td>', 'Seems to barely slant.  Nice colors.', '2003-02-24 15:10:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(222914, 12971, 4159, '<td valign="top">This would fit an advertising challenge, but not really a stock photography challenge, in my opinion.</td>', 'This would fit an advertising challenge, but not really a stock photography challenge, in my opinion.', '2003-02-24 15:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(222922, 13052, 1041, '<td valign="top">Challenge met.  Very cute shot, they grow up too fast.  I like how the kitten is stretched out and still not very long.,  The background goes with it nicely, the shadow from the tail is something that I''d expect you to tone down for real stock photography, but of course spot-editing isn''t legal for DPC.  :)</td>', 'Challenge met.  Very cute shot, they grow up too fast.  I like how the kitten is stretched out and still not very long.,  The background goes with it nicely, the shadow from the tail is something that I''d expect you to tone down for real stock photography, but of course spot-editing isn''t legal for DPC.  :)', '2003-02-24 15:18:12.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(222933, 12987, 1041, '<td valign="top">Challenge met, I could almost see this as a frame insert.  B&amp;w is often used for those, and it works well here.  You''ve achieved a nice tonal range, although just a tad more contrast would''ve been nice, too.  Two things to consider are (a) the pillow ... I think a more simple pattern or even a single color would''ve been nice and (b) have the girl smile and raise her head a little bit.  I shouldn''t give you advice, I don''t even attempt portrait photography (my one attempt in the b&amp;w portrait challenge was my worst score ever), but I''m telling you that, from a viewer''s point of view, these things would improve the photo.  She is a cutie, btw.  :)  Also, I wonder if you are getting comments about the shadow/light stripes on her hair ... personally, I think they add to the photo.</td>', 'Challenge met, I could almost see this as a frame insert.  B&w is often used for those, and it works well here.  You''ve achieved a nice tonal range, although just a tad more contrast would''ve been nice, too.  Two things to consider are (a) the pillow ... I think a more simple pattern or even a single color would''ve been nice and (b) have the girl smile and raise her head a little bit.  I shouldn''t give you advice, I don''t even attempt portrait photography (my one attempt in the b&w portrait challenge was my worst score ever), but I''m telling you that, from a viewer''s point of view, these things would improve the photo.  She is a cutie, btw.  :)  Also, I wonder if you are getting comments about the shadow/light stripes on her hair ... personally, I think they add to the photo.', '2003-02-24 15:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(222941, 12998, 1041, '<td valign="top">What a nice and colorful photo.  You''ve got good focus here and nice framing, too.  However, I don''t see this working as a stock photo for two reasons (a) the Jelly Bean name on the beans!!!  This makes this unusuable for generic stock photography (b) the highlights on the beans, I think to see this as a stock photo, the lighting needs to be a little more even.  These days, I always put my camera on a tripod, use a strong light source but hold a bed sheet inbetween the light and the source.  That allows sufficient light to take a long(ish) exposure but avoids the blown out highlights.</td>', 'What a nice and colorful photo.  You''ve got good focus here and nice framing, too.  However, I don''t see this working as a stock photo for two reasons (a) the Jelly Bean name on the beans!!!  This makes this unusuable for generic stock photography (b) the highlights on the beans, I think to see this as a stock photo, the lighting needs to be a little more even.  These days, I always put my camera on a tripod, use a strong light source but hold a bed sheet inbetween the light and the source.  That allows sufficient light to take a long(ish) exposure but avoids the blown out highlights.', '2003-02-24 15:26:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(222946, 12872, 1041, '<td valign="top">A very nice simple and clean image, I like that a lot.  You''ve done an incredible job on the glass, no reflections or blown-out highlights, wonderful.  The background behind the glass is very nice also, the surface the glass is standing on is very distracting in my opinion, it introduces a much darker color and a clear straight separation of background vs. surface in an otherwise curvy photo.  To my eye, it also looks just a tad rotated, but that may be me not holding my head straight today.  :)  I would suggest redoing this with a different surface (put the glass on a curved piece of cardboard that serves as background and surface?) and you have a winner in my mind.</td>', 'A very nice simple and clean image, I like that a lot.  You''ve done an incredible job on the glass, no reflections or blown-out highlights, wonderful.  The background behind the glass is very nice also, the surface the glass is standing on is very distracting in my opinion, it introduces a much darker color and a clear straight separation of background vs. surface in an otherwise curvy photo.  To my eye, it also looks just a tad rotated, but that may be me not holding my head straight today.  :)  I would suggest redoing this with a different surface (put the glass on a curved piece of cardboard that serves as background and surface?) and you have a winner in my mind.', '2003-02-24 15:31:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(222954, 13105, 3575, '<td valign="top">I was trying to think of a product that would use this type of imagery, I wonder what you imagined. Perfume, anti depressants, AIDS awareness, battered women. She has a bit of a furrowd brow and that evokes a troubled feeling. I would like a little more light in her right eye but I think you accomplished your goal. Very nicely done.</td>', 'I was trying to think of a product that would use this type of imagery, I wonder what you imagined. Perfume, anti depressants, AIDS awareness, battered women. She has a bit of a furrowd brow and that evokes a troubled feeling. I would like a little more light in her right eye but I think you accomplished your goal. Very nicely done.', '2003-02-24 15:36:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(222957, 12915, 327, '<td valign="top">Good job...little shadow here in the front..? Cloud. Still the shot works. Nice job!</td>', 'Good job...little shadow here in the front..? Cloud. Still the shot works. Nice job!', '2003-02-24 15:37:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(222958, 13123, 327, '<td valign="top">Not bad. Maybe more cropped off the top, but this works. Nice job.</td>', 'Not bad. Maybe more cropped off the top, but this works. Nice job.', '2003-02-24 15:38:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(222960, 13005, 3575, '<td valign="top">You usually don''t see the soldiers smiling - this could be a recruitment ad. Good exposure. It does bother me that the other two men have their backs turned.</td>', 'You usually don''t see the soldiers smiling - this could be a recruitment ad. Good exposure. It does bother me that the other two men have their backs turned.', '2003-02-24 15:38:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(222962, 12971, 327, '<td valign="top">Only little nit here would be the name brand showing....Salomon. Still the shot is soooooooooooooo good. Nice color, light, composition.</td>', 'Only little nit here would be the name brand showing....Salomon. Still the shot is soooooooooooooo good. Nice color, light, composition.', '2003-02-24 15:39:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(222964, 12927, 3575, '<td valign="top">It''s a good idea but it''s not very appealing to me. I think it''s the mush center and the popped out kernel that I don''t like. I think the lighting is very good and it is a very nice macro.</td>', 'It''s a good idea but it''s not very appealing to me. I think it''s the mush center and the popped out kernel that I don''t like. I think the lighting is very good and it is a very nice macro.', '2003-02-24 15:40:18.000000', NULL, 1),
