(223397, 13043, 772, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent stock photo... it''s not loud with color and it could be used to support a great number of themes.... great idea and excellent execution :) - setzler</td>', 'This is an excellent stock photo... it''s not loud with color and it could be used to support a great number of themes.... great idea and excellent execution :) - setzler', '2003-02-24 20:12:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(223398, 13112, 3575, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and, I usually don''t pay attention to the framing but it really works on this. I like the the red, white, and blue flag against the blue background with red and white borders. Nice detail on the flag.</td>', 'Nice composition and, I usually don''t pay attention to the framing but it really works on this. I like the the red, white, and blue flag against the blue background with red and white borders. Nice detail on the flag.', '2003-02-24 20:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(223400, 12972, 772, '<td valign="top">nice closeup shot... I suppose this shot could serve as stock photography wherever a cat is needed :) - setzler</td>', 'nice closeup shot... I suppose this shot could serve as stock photography wherever a cat is needed :) - setzler', '2003-02-24 20:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(223403, 12880, 3575, '<td valign="top">Very interesting photograph but quite dark. If you could bump up the ocntrast a little it would be better. Everything seems to just blend together. How did you get this close to the Elk?</td>', 'Very interesting photograph but quite dark. If you could bump up the ocntrast a little it would be better. Everything seems to just blend together. How did you get this close to the Elk?', '2003-02-24 20:16:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(223408, 12915, 6100, '<td valign="top">This is a nice image. The sloping lines of the building on the right make me think that the building is in disrepair while the vertical building line in the center is straight as it should be. It is a fairly bleak image, with the snow on the ground and the lack of any bright colors and may be somewhat hard to "sell" in the stock world but, then again, sometimes that is what an editor wants!</td>', 'This is a nice image. The sloping lines of the building on the right make me think that the building is in disrepair while the vertical building line in the center is straight as it should be. It is a fairly bleak image, with the snow on the ground and the lack of any bright colors and may be somewhat hard to "sell" in the stock world but, then again, sometimes that is what an editor wants!', '2003-02-24 20:17:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(223412, 12924, 6100, '<td valign="top">Crystal clear focus, good depth of field. For stock purposes, I would leave more room at the top of the photo (editors sometimes want room for the magazine masthead or they want to crop from horizontal to vertical and they need the room). The chain link fence is distracting but the image is powerful.</td>', 'Crystal clear focus, good depth of field. For stock purposes, I would leave more room at the top of the photo (editors sometimes want room for the magazine masthead or they want to crop from horizontal to vertical and they need the room). The chain link fence is distracting but the image is powerful.', '2003-02-24 20:19:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(223415, 12969, 6100, '<td valign="top">Nicely lit shot but the focus needs some improvement. The bottom of the apple has good focus but the top is slightly fuzzy. Stop down some and the image would be improved a lot.</td>', 'Nicely lit shot but the focus needs some improvement. The bottom of the apple has good focus but the top is slightly fuzzy. Stop down some and the image would be improved a lot.', '2003-02-24 20:21:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(223419, 12958, 6100, '<td valign="top">Nice mix of colors, very sharp focus, great exposure for both the lighter and darker objects.</td>', 'Nice mix of colors, very sharp focus, great exposure for both the lighter and darker objects.', '2003-02-24 20:22:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(223420, 12978, 3575, '<td valign="top">Beautiful - wonderful detail and lighting. I love the way you composed the shot with the flower face down. And, the lovely, refreshing water drops are a nice touch. I think that you would have been better off with a white border rather than the off-white but I don''t make down for borders, it''s just a suggestion.</td>', 'Beautiful - wonderful detail and lighting. I love the way you composed the shot with the flower face down. And, the lovely, refreshing water drops are a nice touch. I think that you would have been better off with a white border rather than the off-white but I don''t make down for borders, it''s just a suggestion.', '2003-02-24 20:24:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(223421, 12869, 3575, '<td valign="top">I love the blue glow, the center ball is perfectly in focus and that is ver good use of DOF.</td>', 'I love the blue glow, the center ball is perfectly in focus and that is ver good use of DOF.', '2003-02-24 20:25:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(223425, 13052, 3575, '<td valign="top">Oh My Sweet Goodness! Is this the most wonderful vision! Look at that little paw up in the air and the tail too. I would have liked just a little more light on the kitten on his/her upper right quadrant but it''s still a wonderful photo.</td>', 'Oh My Sweet Goodness! Is this the most wonderful vision! Look at that little paw up in the air and the tail too. I would have liked just a little more light on the kitten on his/her upper right quadrant but it''s still a wonderful photo.', '2003-02-24 20:28:19.000000', NULL, 1),
