(223439, 13033, 3575, '<td valign="top">Wow, I bet this looks amazing at full size. The concept is fabulous and the colors and lighting are amazing. I love how the light seems to burst out from the puzzle globe. I can''t tell it''s a world globe but it works even it wasn''t. I love your choice of background. This is a great art piece. My first 10 in this challenge. It''s HOT!!</td>', 'Wow, I bet this looks amazing at full size. The concept is fabulous and the colors and lighting are amazing. I love how the light seems to burst out from the puzzle globe. I can''t tell it''s a world globe but it works even it wasn''t. I love your choice of background. This is a great art piece. My first 10 in this challenge. It''s HOT!!', '2003-02-24 20:36:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(223442, 13093, 4159, '<td valign="top">The branches appear almost to be growing out of the schoolhouse.  This is a beautiful shot, you caught the perfect lighting and the composition is very effective.</td>', 'The branches appear almost to be growing out of the schoolhouse.  This is a beautiful shot, you caught the perfect lighting and the composition is very effective.', '2003-02-24 20:37:24.000000', NULL, 1),
