(223499, 12922, 3575, '<td valign="top">Wonderful building. Too much shadow in the front that takes away from the detail. I would like to see the whole width of the building too. Nonetheless, amazing architecture.</td>', 'Wonderful building. Too much shadow in the front that takes away from the detail. I would like to see the whole width of the building too. Nonetheless, amazing architecture.', '2003-02-24 20:57:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(223504, 12953, 3575, '<td valign="top">Nicely photographed - the lighting and eposure couldn''t be better. I think sharper focus on the face and hands would be better. The Hat is out of focus too. Prfect background, and excellently composed.</td>', 'Nicely photographed - the lighting and eposure couldn''t be better. I think sharper focus on the face and hands would be better. The Hat is out of focus too. Prfect background, and excellently composed.', '2003-02-24 20:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(223513, 13096, 3575, '<td valign="top">Oooh, Orchid! I almost called it pink but it''s definately orchid. I like the shadow play. I would have liked more detail in ghe beautiful flower though and I don''t understand what the flower and the lamp have to do with one another. Sorry for being dense.</td>', 'Oooh, Orchid! I almost called it pink but it''s definately orchid. I like the shadow play. I would have liked more detail in ghe beautiful flower though and I don''t understand what the flower and the lamp have to do with one another. Sorry for being dense.', '2003-02-24 21:02:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(223531, 12862, 772, '<td valign="top">nice work :)  I love the red ''punch'' in this photo... i think it also makes a great ''stock'' shot... - setzler</td>', 'nice work :)  I love the red ''punch'' in this photo... i think it also makes a great ''stock'' shot... - setzler', '2003-02-24 21:11:46.000000', NULL, 1),
