(223541, 12863, 772, '<td valign="top">veyr nice sunset... it''s hard to really tell, but it appears that the horizon is not level in this shot.  In a shot like this, i believe the horizon may need to be a little lower in the frame to remove some of the void.. - setzler</td>', 'veyr nice sunset... it''s hard to really tell, but it appears that the horizon is not level in this shot.  In a shot like this, i believe the horizon may need to be a little lower in the frame to remove some of the void.. - setzler', '2003-02-24 21:18:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(223546, 12854, 6100, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent macro shot of a telephone plug...just like might be used in an annual report, a magazine, a textbook, etc. Very wide possibilities for use as "stock" photography. I like the yellow background, the selective focus, the sharpness where it should be sharp and the leadin line drawing the eye to the subject. Very nice work!</td>', 'This is an excellent macro shot of a telephone plug...just like might be used in an annual report, a magazine, a textbook, etc. Very wide possibilities for use as "stock" photography. I like the yellow background, the selective focus, the sharpness where it should be sharp and the leadin line drawing the eye to the subject. Very nice work!', '2003-02-24 21:21:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(223548, 12972, 6325, '<td valign="top">Well executed. A little more face would have been better for me. 8</td>', 'Well executed. A little more face would have been better for me. 8', '2003-02-24 21:21:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(223549, 13071, 6325, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. More detail in the shadows of the pinecone.</td>', 'Nice composition. More detail in the shadows of the pinecone.', '2003-02-24 21:23:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(223553, 13052, 6100, '<td valign="top">This photo seems a little washed out. Cute kitten but the body shape -- or maybe it''s just the angle of the camera -- make it look almost like the kitten has a slightly deformed body. While you never know what will sell, I don''t see this as an image which would be sold over and over again from the portfolio of a stock photographer. The border helps the image but doesn''t redeem it.</td>', 'This photo seems a little washed out. Cute kitten but the body shape -- or maybe it''s just the angle of the camera -- make it look almost like the kitten has a slightly deformed body. While you never know what will sell, I don''t see this as an image which would be sold over and over again from the portfolio of a stock photographer. The border helps the image but doesn''t redeem it.', '2003-02-24 21:24:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(223555, 12980, 772, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting concept for stock photography.  The image itself doesn''t really ''say'' much but I suppose it could be supportive of some idea, which is what stock photography usually does... :) - setzler</td>', 'This is an interesting concept for stock photography.  The image itself doesn''t really ''say'' much but I suppose it could be supportive of some idea, which is what stock photography usually does... :) - setzler', '2003-02-24 21:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(223556, 13099, 772, '<td valign="top">I like the abstract nature of this shot.. the red is quite powerful.. maybe too powerful :) - setzler</td>', 'I like the abstract nature of this shot.. the red is quite powerful.. maybe too powerful :) - setzler', '2003-02-24 21:25:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(223557, 12978, 6325, '<td valign="top">Nice detail with the water drops. Good background execution.</td>', 'Nice detail with the water drops. Good background execution.', '2003-02-24 21:25:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(223558, 12926, 6100, '<td valign="top">Good focus on the subjects right eye but the image seems overexposed to me. The lack of focus on the left eye makes me believe that your model is, indeed, dreaming.</td>', 'Good focus on the subjects right eye but the image seems overexposed to me. The lack of focus on the left eye makes me believe that your model is, indeed, dreaming.', '2003-02-24 21:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(223559, 13068, 772, '<td valign="top">I think this is a strong concept for stock photography.  The only issue i see with this shot is that it would probalby be stronger if the ''paper'' was more pure white... good work :) - setzler</td>', 'I think this is a strong concept for stock photography.  The only issue i see with this shot is that it would probalby be stronger if the ''paper'' was more pure white... good work :) - setzler', '2003-02-24 21:26:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(223560, 13092, 6325, '<td valign="top">Less sky, more water, Nothing to concentrate on.</td>', 'Less sky, more water, Nothing to concentrate on.', '2003-02-24 21:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(223563, 12914, 6100, '<td valign="top">Good composition with the reflection. I wonder what the phot would look like when the water was perfectly still. Might be a nice image, too. You''ve gotten a good exposure and the focus seems very sharp. The image has a quality which makes it seem as if it''s a painting and that may keep it from selling well in the stock field.</td>', 'Good composition with the reflection. I wonder what the phot would look like when the water was perfectly still. Might be a nice image, too. You''ve gotten a good exposure and the focus seems very sharp. The image has a quality which makes it seem as if it''s a painting and that may keep it from selling well in the stock field.', '2003-02-24 21:29:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(223565, 13093, 6100, '<td valign="top">Nice framing with the tree. Your exposure is well balanced and, given the title, it seems to illustrate the one room schoolhouse. B&amp;W does well on this image.</td>', 'Nice framing with the tree. Your exposure is well balanced and, given the title, it seems to illustrate the one room schoolhouse. B&W does well on this image.', '2003-02-24 21:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(223567, 13043, 6100, '<td valign="top">I would think that this would sell over and over again for illustrations ... textbooks, annual reports (probably better in color for that purpose), possibly magazine articles. Don''t see this as a magazine cover image though because it isn''t vertical and there isn''t enough room to make it vertical while leaving room for a magazine masthead ... but that could be another photo in your stock library.</td>', 'I would think that this would sell over and over again for illustrations ... textbooks, annual reports (probably better in color for that purpose), possibly magazine articles. Don''t see this as a magazine cover image though because it isn''t vertical and there isn''t enough room to make it vertical while leaving room for a magazine masthead ... but that could be another photo in your stock library.', '2003-02-24 21:33:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(223568, 13123, 4159, '<td valign="top">I like the filtered light you''ve caught here.  I have a few compositional concerns.  The first you probably couldn''t correct, which are the blips in the water.  The second is that I''m not sure about that silhouette; it just seems out of place, although it works to an extent.  Nice shot, all in all.</td>', 'I like the filtered light you''ve caught here.  I have a few compositional concerns.  The first you probably couldn''t correct, which are the blips in the water.  The second is that I''m not sure about that silhouette; it just seems out of place, although it works to an extent.  Nice shot, all in all.', '2003-02-24 21:34:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(223570, 13018, 6325, '<td valign="top">I usually take the easy way out and don''t comment on submissions I rank low. But I guess that is not fair. I start with a shot as a 5 for average. If it''s better than average, I add points. On the other side I subtract for specific things. In this case one each for poor composition and cropping, indistinct focus, not on subject, and just a snap shot.</td>', 'I usually take the easy way out and don''t comment on submissions I rank low. But I guess that is not fair. I start with a shot as a 5 for average. If it''s better than average, I add points. On the other side I subtract for specific things. In this case one each for poor composition and cropping, indistinct focus, not on subject, and just a snap shot.', '2003-02-24 21:34:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(223571, 13061, 6100, '<td valign="top">I''ve probably seen too much of this lately, but it certainly illustrates how a storm can paralyze a city. Maybe it''s my monitor, but I think the snow is a little too white and devoid of detail.</td>', 'I''ve probably seen too much of this lately, but it certainly illustrates how a storm can paralyze a city. Maybe it''s my monitor, but I think the snow is a little too white and devoid of detail.', '2003-02-24 21:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(223572, 13093, 6228, '<td valign="top">Simple and clear.  Nice photo</td>', 'Simple and clear.  Nice photo', '2003-02-24 21:35:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(223573, 13043, 4159, '<td valign="top">This globe looks a little squished, which may be because of your crop.  I wish that either the globe was a bit brighter or the background a bit darker, as I think there needs to be more contrast there.  Good shot, though.</td>', 'This globe looks a little squished, which may be because of your crop.  I wish that either the globe was a bit brighter or the background a bit darker, as I think there needs to be more contrast there.  Good shot, though.', '2003-02-24 21:35:32.000000', NULL, 1),
