(223637, 13098, 2344, '<td valign="top">I dont care for the angle too much and the dark area in the top right corner is distracting.  Good ploy to hide the brand name though</td>', 'I dont care for the angle too much and the dark area in the top right corner is distracting.  Good ploy to hide the brand name though', '2003-02-24 22:53:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(223639, 13082, 2344, '<td valign="top">Stock Photography mainly catered to the us. Your colours are over saturated and it looks oversharpened (but I could be wrong).  Another flag picture is alright but there''s nothing spectacular to help it stand out</td>', 'Stock Photography mainly catered to the us. Your colours are over saturated and it looks oversharpened (but I could be wrong).  Another flag picture is alright but there''s nothing spectacular to help it stand out', '2003-02-24 22:55:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(223643, 12888, 2344, '<td valign="top">Those shadows are super distracting.  The bulb is so clear and fairly nicely lit and it''s a shame you have this big shadow in the middle of your picture.</td>', 'Those shadows are super distracting.  The bulb is so clear and fairly nicely lit and it''s a shame you have this big shadow in the middle of your picture.', '2003-02-24 22:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(223646, 12854, 2344, '<td valign="top">Now this is something i could see in a stock catalogue unlike a lot of the other pics in this challenge. You may have been able to adjust some lighting to help the end stand out a little more but the rest is great as is. 7</td>', 'Now this is something i could see in a stock catalogue unlike a lot of the other pics in this challenge. You may have been able to adjust some lighting to help the end stand out a little more but the rest is great as is. 7', '2003-02-24 22:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(223648, 13025, 2344, '<td valign="top">where did that flare come from? or is that crap on your lens? a neat idea, just a shame about the blue blobs</td>', 'where did that flare come from? or is that crap on your lens? a neat idea, just a shame about the blue blobs', '2003-02-24 22:59:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(223650, 13071, 2344, '<td valign="top">I like this one. One of my favourites. Universal appeal and well lit and just a pretty picture AND it fits the challenge. Good job! 9</td>', 'I like this one. One of my favourites. Universal appeal and well lit and just a pretty picture AND it fits the challenge. Good job! 9', '2003-02-24 23:01:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(223651, 13043, 2344, '<td valign="top">an interesting concept.. dont care for the crop though.. should have shown another completed edge. i.e. the rest of either the top, bottom or side.</td>', 'an interesting concept.. dont care for the crop though.. should have shown another completed edge. i.e. the rest of either the top, bottom or side.', '2003-02-24 23:02:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(223652, 13006, 2344, '<td valign="top">I think some of those dice would have looked great backlit... frontal on camera flash is not always very flattering light.</td>', 'I think some of those dice would have looked great backlit... frontal on camera flash is not always very flattering light.', '2003-02-24 23:03:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(223655, 13052, 2344, '<td valign="top">That''s cute! too bad you have those harsh shadows under the kitten though. I''m undecided as to whether or not I like it as a stock photo though...</td>', 'That''s cute! too bad you have those harsh shadows under the kitten though. I''m undecided as to whether or not I like it as a stock photo though...', '2003-02-24 23:04:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(223656, 13109, 2344, '<td valign="top">you way overdid the brightness/contrast/intensity and I think it would have been fine without overdoing it.</td>', 'you way overdid the brightness/contrast/intensity and I think it would have been fine without overdoing it.', '2003-02-24 23:06:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(223657, 12850, 2344, '<td valign="top">very nice landscape with universal appeal and a nice silhouetted wind thingy (not sure of the terminology). One of my favourites. good luck! 10</td>', 'very nice landscape with universal appeal and a nice silhouetted wind thingy (not sure of the terminology). One of my favourites. good luck! 10', '2003-02-24 23:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(223660, 12849, 2344, '<td valign="top">That looks like a page out of a horror novel.  Very neat illumination and an interesting looking tree</td>', 'That looks like a page out of a horror novel.  Very neat illumination and an interesting looking tree', '2003-02-24 23:08:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(223661, 12978, 2344, '<td valign="top">I dont really like the cropping in this picture.. you should have included the tip of the petal on the right OR the bottom... I just feel the picture is cramped into the tiny space you gave it.. let your pictures breathe and they will love you for it! (okay, so that was corny.. so what) 7</td>', 'I dont really like the cropping in this picture.. you should have included the tip of the petal on the right OR the bottom... I just feel the picture is cramped into the tiny space you gave it.. let your pictures breathe and they will love you for it! (okay, so that was corny.. so what) 7', '2003-02-24 23:10:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(223662, 12927, 6405, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast and colors,well focused, but don''t like that piece of coen skin hanging</td>', 'Nice contrast and colors,well focused, but don''t like that piece of coen skin hanging', '2003-02-24 23:11:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(223663, 13041, 2344, '<td valign="top">You overdid the sharpening in this image.  Not a very original idea, but nicely done anyway.7</td>', 'You overdid the sharpening in this image.  Not a very original idea, but nicely done anyway.7', '2003-02-24 23:12:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(223666, 12872, 2344, '<td valign="top">Very simple and very nice. 9</td>', 'Very simple and very nice. 9', '2003-02-24 23:13:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(223694, 12863, 6325, '<td valign="top">I like the counterpoint of the sun and the tree. Since the lower portion doesn''t do much, maybe you could edit out the lower portion including the headlights. ALso, the horizon is not level - or is that some clouds?</td>', 'I like the counterpoint of the sun and the tree. Since the lower portion doesn''t do much, maybe you could edit out the lower portion including the headlights. ALso, the horizon is not level - or is that some clouds?', '2003-02-25 00:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(223696, 13105, 6325, '<td valign="top">Concept is could. The half lighting works. But... it would need something more for my ad. Focus is blurred, not soft. Could you have gotten a sparkle in the eye with a little different ligthing?</td>', 'Concept is could. The half lighting works. But... it would need something more for my ad. Focus is blurred, not soft. Could you have gotten a sparkle in the eye with a little different ligthing?', '2003-02-25 00:29:57.000000', NULL, 1),
