(223881, 12882, 1829, '<td valign="top">Great vibrant colours.  Excellent composition.  Love the way you have captured the line structure of the umberalla.  A few hot spots, however an excellent image overall.  GL.</td>', 'Great vibrant colours.  Excellent composition.  Love the way you have captured the line structure of the umberalla.  A few hot spots, however an excellent image overall.  GL.', '2003-02-25 06:53:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(223882, 12850, 1829, '<td valign="top">A very well composed image.  Big bulging clouds (storm like) with a luscious green sloping hill.  The main subject, the windmill adds interest to the photo as well.  Again an excellent photo with composition, colour and a lovely country feel.  Great capture and GL.</td>', 'A very well composed image.  Big bulging clouds (storm like) with a luscious green sloping hill.  The main subject, the windmill adds interest to the photo as well.  Again an excellent photo with composition, colour and a lovely country feel.  Great capture and GL.', '2003-02-25 06:55:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(223883, 13052, 1829, '<td valign="top">Awe what a little cutie pie.  You can really see by looking at this kitty that he/she is really trying his best to ''take his first step''  Lighting, colour and subject is awesome.  Excellent job and a great emotional capture.  GL.</td>', 'Awe what a little cutie pie.  You can really see by looking at this kitty that he/she is really trying his best to ''take his first step''  Lighting, colour and subject is awesome.  Excellent job and a great emotional capture.  GL.', '2003-02-25 06:57:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(223884, 12988, 1829, '<td valign="top">The one thing that caught my eye with your image is the fact that it''s not overloaded with colour.  It''s plain and simple yet effective.  I love the colour and the contrast between the waves at the top verses the rectangle at the bottom.  Nice and pleasing to the eye.  Excellent composition as well.  Great job and very artistic.  GL.</td>', 'The one thing that caught my eye with your image is the fact that it''s not overloaded with colour.  It''s plain and simple yet effective.  I love the colour and the contrast between the waves at the top verses the rectangle at the bottom.  Nice and pleasing to the eye.  Excellent composition as well.  Great job and very artistic.  GL.', '2003-02-25 06:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(223886, 13005, 1829, '<td valign="top">Fantastic capture of real life photography.  I like this shot because of the way you have ''captured the moment'' feel.  Very natural looking and it''s not staged.  Excellent colour, lighting, composition and lighting techniques used here.  Excellent job and GL.</td>', 'Fantastic capture of real life photography.  I like this shot because of the way you have ''captured the moment'' feel.  Very natural looking and it''s not staged.  Excellent colour, lighting, composition and lighting techniques used here.  Excellent job and GL.', '2003-02-25 07:01:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(223887, 12915, 1829, '<td valign="top">Ok I must admit at first I gave you a 6 for this shot, but I came back again and again, because something lured me to your image.  Must have been the simplicity of it.  As I look at this image, it has been captured quite well.  The colour, composition and subject is brilliant and is definately a stock photo.  I apologise for my ignorance, however I''m going now bump it to a 9.  GL.</td>', 'Ok I must admit at first I gave you a 6 for this shot, but I came back again and again, because something lured me to your image.  Must have been the simplicity of it.  As I look at this image, it has been captured quite well.  The colour, composition and subject is brilliant and is definately a stock photo.  I apologise for my ignorance, however I''m going now bump it to a 9.  GL.', '2003-02-25 07:05:08.000000', NULL, 1),
