(223950, 13021, 6100, '<td valign="top">As a photo buyer, I wouldn''t want to see the text you''ve added. I know where I want to put text; you don''t have to tell me. The border doesn''t add anything and if I were laying out a magazine or annual report or textbook, I''d probably crop those out anyway. You''ve got a good concept here for a stock photo and the paper clips are quite sharp and well lit.</td>', 'As a photo buyer, I wouldn''t want to see the text you''ve added. I know where I want to put text; you don''t have to tell me. The border doesn''t add anything and if I were laying out a magazine or annual report or textbook, I''d probably crop those out anyway. You''ve got a good concept here for a stock photo and the paper clips are quite sharp and well lit.', '2003-02-25 08:57:22.000000', NULL, 1),
