(223954, 13105, 1041, '<td valign="top">Wow, talk about a title that explains things ... good thing this is a photography site :-P  Challenge met.  I''m torn about your picture.  I very much like the composition, the stark shadows, the frame works extremely well with it.  I wish the woman was just a little more sharply focused.  There are a couple of tiny (nitpicky) distraction behind her hair that you could easily clone out after the challenge and before sending this to an ad agency.  I think I''ll have to come back and look at this one a couple of times to determine my final score.  :)</td>', 'Wow, talk about a title that explains things ... good thing this is a photography site :-P  Challenge met.  I''m torn about your picture.  I very much like the composition, the stark shadows, the frame works extremely well with it.  I wish the woman was just a little more sharply focused.  There are a couple of tiny (nitpicky) distraction behind her hair that you could easily clone out after the challenge and before sending this to an ad agency.  I think I''ll have to come back and look at this one a couple of times to determine my final score.  :)', '2003-02-25 08:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
