(223973, 12969, 5728, '<td valign="top">One apple ready for the stock photo catalogue, good one. The challenge had been met for sure, the apple could be a tad sharper and lighter at the front. Did you eat it afterwards?</td>', 'One apple ready for the stock photo catalogue, good one. The challenge had been met for sure, the apple could be a tad sharper and lighter at the front. Did you eat it afterwards?', '2003-02-25 09:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
