(224046, 13038, 4510, '<td valign="top">I was in Amsterdam 26 years ago visiting relatives in winter. This shot looks as cold as I remember it to be. The light filtering down the lane really makes this shot. Great work. I''d write something in Dutch but I can''t spell it, and can only speak a bit. But I can understand a fair bit especially when my mums swearing at me.</td>', 'I was in Amsterdam 26 years ago visiting relatives in winter. This shot looks as cold as I remember it to be. The light filtering down the lane really makes this shot. Great work. I''d write something in Dutch but I can''t spell it, and can only speak a bit. But I can understand a fair bit especially when my mums swearing at me.', '2003-02-25 11:18:31.000000', NULL, 1),
