(224126, 12835, 6097, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot.  I love the detail that can be seen on the fly.  Very nice warm colors.  This is what I think to be the best stock photography shot of the challenge.  Excellent work!  Good Luck!  I hope this makes the top 3 if not 1st.</td>', 'Very nice shot.  I love the detail that can be seen on the fly.  Very nice warm colors.  This is what I think to be the best stock photography shot of the challenge.  Excellent work!  Good Luck!  I hope this makes the top 3 if not 1st.', '2003-02-25 12:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(224127, 12806, 6100, '<td valign="top">Nice shot with vibrant colors. The colors in the surrounding area are more muted and this offers a gentle contrast. I seem to see a bit of grain in the dark areas as if the exposure wasn''t exactly on the money. If I were a photo buyer, I''m not quite sure what this would illustrate unless it depicts the art of a particular culture (past or present). As a stock photographer, I don''t think this would be a top seller in my collection but it''s still a very nice picture.</td>', 'Nice shot with vibrant colors. The colors in the surrounding area are more muted and this offers a gentle contrast. I seem to see a bit of grain in the dark areas as if the exposure wasn''t exactly on the money. If I were a photo buyer, I''m not quite sure what this would illustrate unless it depicts the art of a particular culture (past or present). As a stock photographer, I don''t think this would be a top seller in my collection but it''s still a very nice picture.', '2003-02-25 12:56:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(224132, 12888, 6100, '<td valign="top">Good exposure and well composed picture. I like the shadows although they almost overpower the bulb. For use as a stock image, I would turn the bulb so that the writing is not visible. The writing might limit the general appeal to some photo buyers. I can think of several ways to set this up but I''d like to know how you did it. Very good.</td>', 'Good exposure and well composed picture. I like the shadows although they almost overpower the bulb. For use as a stock image, I would turn the bulb so that the writing is not visible. The writing might limit the general appeal to some photo buyers. I can think of several ways to set this up but I''d like to know how you did it. Very good.', '2003-02-25 13:01:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(224133, 13062, 6100, '<td valign="top">Terrific angle for this shot. The colors are vibrant and you''ve composed it (or cropped it) very nicely.</td>', 'Terrific angle for this shot. The colors are vibrant and you''ve composed it (or cropped it) very nicely.', '2003-02-25 13:02:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(224134, 13098, 6097, '<td valign="top">Really nice shot.  I really like how you used the intentional drastic off level horizon in this shot.  Good detail shown on the subject, especially with such a bright background.  Looks like a shot that would be used in a magazine or brochure to me.  Good luck!</td>', 'Really nice shot.  I really like how you used the intentional drastic off level horizon in this shot.  Good detail shown on the subject, especially with such a bright background.  Looks like a shot that would be used in a magazine or brochure to me.  Good luck!', '2003-02-25 13:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(224140, 12904, 6100, '<td valign="top">Good image for stock. Reminds me of a librarian or a lady contemplating a book (I guess the glasses part way down the nose do this!) but I''m sure it could be used to illustrate many things. Focus is good, exposure seems on the nose. Nice job!</td>', 'Good image for stock. Reminds me of a librarian or a lady contemplating a book (I guess the glasses part way down the nose do this!) but I''m sure it could be used to illustrate many things. Focus is good, exposure seems on the nose. Nice job!', '2003-02-25 13:05:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(224141, 12926, 6097, '<td valign="top">I like it, Ben.  I like the blown out section in the center.  Reminds me of something you would see in a magazine or brochure for a migraine medication.  LOL!  Good Luck!<br/> <br/>Bill (wackybill)</td>', 'I like it, Ben.  I like the blown out section in the center.  Reminds me of something you would see in a magazine or brochure for a migraine medication.  LOL!  Good Luck! Bill (wackybill)', '2003-02-25 13:05:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(224145, 12854, 6097, '<td valign="top">Good detail captured here.  Really nice macro shot.  I could see this being purchased to be used in an IT article of some sort.  I like the shallow DOF you used to make this feel almost as if the plug is coming out of the frame at you.  Good luck!</td>', 'Good detail captured here.  Really nice macro shot.  I could see this being purchased to be used in an IT article of some sort.  I like the shallow DOF you used to make this feel almost as if the plug is coming out of the frame at you.  Good luck!', '2003-02-25 13:07:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(224151, 12867, 6100, '<td valign="top">I like the composition here with the red stiching in the upper left and lower right corners. For inclusion in a stock portfolio, I would also have a similar shot without the logo in order to give the shot a broader market appeal. Exposure is good, the lighting over the contour of the ball helps to show that it''s a three dimensional object, and your focus is quite good.</td>', 'I like the composition here with the red stiching in the upper left and lower right corners. For inclusion in a stock portfolio, I would also have a similar shot without the logo in order to give the shot a broader market appeal. Exposure is good, the lighting over the contour of the ball helps to show that it''s a three dimensional object, and your focus is quite good.', '2003-02-25 13:10:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(224156, 12922, 6100, '<td valign="top">Very interesting image. I like the clouds which add appeal. If I were a stock photo buyer, I would like to see this done at different times of the day or maybe without the shadow in the front. I would also like to see the street level portion of this building rather than letting it "float".</td>', 'Very interesting image. I like the clouds which add appeal. If I were a stock photo buyer, I would like to see this done at different times of the day or maybe without the shadow in the front. I would also like to see the street level portion of this building rather than letting it "float".', '2003-02-25 13:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(224158, 13084, 6100, '<td valign="top">As a stock photo, your appeal is somewhat limited to Cracker Jacks unless you can find another way to sell it. I like the shot ... makes me want to run out and find some Cracker Jacks ... with good exposure and good focus and depth of field.</td>', 'As a stock photo, your appeal is somewhat limited to Cracker Jacks unless you can find another way to sell it. I like the shot ... makes me want to run out and find some Cracker Jacks ... with good exposure and good focus and depth of field.', '2003-02-25 13:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(224167, 12938, 6100, '<td valign="top">Although I like the shot --- composition is nice, exposure is good and focus is good --- I don''t see how this would be used in, for example, a magazine or an annual report, to illustrate something. While you reference "Plimsol Line" in your title, I don''t see this shot as being a ship.</td>', 'Although I like the shot --- composition is nice, exposure is good and focus is good --- I don''t see how this would be used in, for example, a magazine or an annual report, to illustrate something. While you reference "Plimsol Line" in your title, I don''t see this shot as being a ship.', '2003-02-25 13:22:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(224169, 12953, 6100, '<td valign="top">Good image of a doll and the lighting, focus, and exposure are all very good. In my opinion, you''ve cropped this too tight to be of much use to a photo buyer for a textbook, magazine, or annual report. In this case, I think the border is too wide.</td>', 'Good image of a doll and the lighting, focus, and exposure are all very good. In my opinion, you''ve cropped this too tight to be of much use to a photo buyer for a textbook, magazine, or annual report. In this case, I think the border is too wide.', '2003-02-25 13:25:13.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(224175, 12978, 6100, '<td valign="top">I like the way the green of the stem turns to the white of the flower here. I think the exposure is perfect but I have the feeling the the focus could be improved slightly. Not quite sure how I as a photo buyer would use this image unless I needed to illustrate this particular type of flower.</td>', 'I like the way the green of the stem turns to the white of the flower here. I think the exposure is perfect but I have the feeling the the focus could be improved slightly. Not quite sure how I as a photo buyer would use this image unless I needed to illustrate this particular type of flower.', '2003-02-25 13:27:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(224187, 12850, 6100, '<td valign="top">I can''t help but see this as a well ventilated windmill. The clouds are nice and you''ve applied the rule of thirds very well. I could see this as being used in a textbook.</td>', 'I can''t help but see this as a well ventilated windmill. The clouds are nice and you''ve applied the rule of thirds very well. I could see this as being used in a textbook.', '2003-02-25 13:38:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(224192, 13038, 6100, '<td valign="top">You need to keep the vertical lines straight --- the pole jumps out immediately. Otherwise, it''s a good B/W picture showing "Amsterdam on a late winter afternoon" (good title).</td>', 'You need to keep the vertical lines straight --- the pole jumps out immediately. Otherwise, it''s a good B/W picture showing "Amsterdam on a late winter afternoon" (good title).', '2003-02-25 13:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(224206, 13082, 3459, '<td valign="top">Good example of a stock image.  While the market would be mainly US, the quality and composition allows for some overlay.</td>', 'Good example of a stock image.  While the market would be mainly US, the quality and composition allows for some overlay.', '2003-02-25 14:01:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(224209, 12985, 3459, '<td valign="top">Excellent example of a stock image.  It has mood, quality, and is relatively not busy wich make it usefull for both editorial and billboard advertisement.  If it was cropped so that some of the branches in the upper right conner were cut off, would be a 10.</td>', 'Excellent example of a stock image.  It has mood, quality, and is relatively not busy wich make it usefull for both editorial and billboard advertisement.  If it was cropped so that some of the branches in the upper right conner were cut off, would be a 10.', '2003-02-25 14:03:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(224210, 13117, 3459, '<td valign="top">Great stock image, the sky or/and watter can be used for text,.The picture in its entirety can be a fill image in frames and public places.</td>', 'Great stock image, the sky or/and watter can be used for text,.The picture in its entirety can be a fill image in frames and public places.', '2003-02-25 14:05:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(224212, 13068, 3459, '<td valign="top">A perfect stock image, as it has space for text, good contrast.  The use of several colours makes usefull for diversity related uses, the straight line and sharp angles are great for business/service use, in some artsier places can be used as a frame fill image. Perfect a 10!</td>', 'A perfect stock image, as it has space for text, good contrast.  The use of several colours makes usefull for diversity related uses, the straight line and sharp angles are great for business/service use, in some artsier places can be used as a frame fill image. Perfect a 10!', '2003-02-25 14:07:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(224214, 12850, 3459, '<td valign="top">An excellent, excellent stock image.  Has room for additonal elements, moody, good contrast, and symbolic. A 10!</td>', 'An excellent, excellent stock image.  Has room for additonal elements, moody, good contrast, and symbolic. A 10!', '2003-02-25 14:08:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(224215, 13120, 3459, '<td valign="top">I think this is the best stock image in this challenge!!!<br/> <br/>Excellent use of negative space, great colour, very cliche (which is very good in stock imagery) yet original.<br/> <br/>An 11!<br/></td>', 'I think this is the best stock image in this challenge!!! Excellent use of negative space, great colour, very cliche (which is very good in stock imagery) yet original. An 11!', '2003-02-25 14:10:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(224216, 12926, 3459, '<td valign="top">A great stock image.  The vertical composition allows for easier editorial use, and the contrast ratio is great for an overlay.  Excellent job!</td>', 'A great stock image.  The vertical composition allows for easier editorial use, and the contrast ratio is great for an overlay.  Excellent job!', '2003-02-25 14:11:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(224219, 13086, 3459, '<td valign="top">This image, in my opinion, should be a second place in this challenge (this is a complement).  It is very well composed, has good negative space, mood, and is very general (and even cliche).  Exceptional work, congrats a 10!</td>', 'This image, in my opinion, should be a second place in this challenge (this is a complement).  It is very well composed, has good negative space, mood, and is very general (and even cliche).  Exceptional work, congrats a 10!', '2003-02-25 14:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(224222, 13033, 3459, '<td valign="top">This is a great stock image, has good negative space, is vertical (makes it better suited for editorial use), the contrast leveles and seamingly similar colours make for an easy use with text.</td>', 'This is a great stock image, has good negative space, is vertical (makes it better suited for editorial use), the contrast leveles and seamingly similar colours make for an easy use with text.', '2003-02-25 14:15:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(224223, 13000, 3459, '<td valign="top">Good stock image, vertical (good for editorial use, which is where most of the stock is used), good colour and contrast.  The only thing I would change, is remove the shadow; it takes way from negative space which is very valuable in stock.</td>', 'Good stock image, vertical (good for editorial use, which is where most of the stock is used), good colour and contrast.  The only thing I would change, is remove the shadow; it takes way from negative space which is very valuable in stock.', '2003-02-25 14:16:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(224225, 13087, 3459, '<td valign="top">Good stock image, good negative space.</td>', 'Good stock image, good negative space.', '2003-02-25 14:17:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(224226, 12854, 3459, '<td valign="top">A very good stock image, very generic with not bad negative space, and good colour.  It is vertical which is a big plus (easy use in editorials).</td>', 'A very good stock image, very generic with not bad negative space, and good colour.  It is vertical which is a big plus (easy use in editorials).', '2003-02-25 14:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(224227, 12888, 3459, '<td valign="top">Good stock image, I would opt for a bit more of negative space on top and make it vertical; nevertheless could sell as stock.</td>', 'Good stock image, I would opt for a bit more of negative space on top and make it vertical; nevertheless could sell as stock.', '2003-02-25 14:19:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(224228, 13068, 6097, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  I really like the bright colors.  Nice lines and I like the negative space.  Good Luck!</td>', 'Great shot.  I really like the bright colors.  Nice lines and I like the negative space.  Good Luck!', '2003-02-25 14:20:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(224229, 13098, 3459, '<td valign="top">Good stock image, good negative space, colour and toanl range.  It is squal which means can be made vertical (which is a big sale for editorial use).  The background is also of the kind that allows you to shape and mold the format.  A good one, congrats!</td>', 'Good stock image, good negative space, colour and toanl range.  It is squal which means can be made vertical (which is a big sale for editorial use).  The background is also of the kind that allows you to shape and mold the format.  A good one, congrats!', '2003-02-25 14:21:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(224242, 13052, 51, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture, well framed, nice coloring.</td>', 'Very nice picture, well framed, nice coloring.', '2003-02-25 14:40:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(224271, 12972, 1041, '<td valign="top">Challenge met.  Nice sharp and focused image.  Very beautiful cat, I especially like that little black dot on her/his nose.  There''s a little hair in the top right corner that''s a bit distracting, but I expect you would clone that out for real stock photography.  Personally, I think the crop is a bit tight, but I can still see this being used as a stock photo.  Good job :)</td>', 'Challenge met.  Nice sharp and focused image.  Very beautiful cat, I especially like that little black dot on her/his nose.  There''s a little hair in the top right corner that''s a bit distracting, but I expect you would clone that out for real stock photography.  Personally, I think the crop is a bit tight, but I can still see this being used as a stock photo.  Good job :)', '2003-02-25 15:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(224272, 13015, 1041, '<td valign="top">Challenge met, I can definitely see this being used as stock photography.  It is also a nice photo.  The clouds add a lot of interest to the photo (could almost qualify for leading lines this week :-P).  Overall, I think I would like to see this just a tinsy tad brighter to see just a little bit more detail, but w/out blowing out the sky.  Good entry :)</td>', 'Challenge met, I can definitely see this being used as stock photography.  It is also a nice photo.  The clouds add a lot of interest to the photo (could almost qualify for leading lines this week :-P).  Overall, I think I would like to see this just a tinsy tad brighter to see just a little bit more detail, but w/out blowing out the sky.  Good entry :)', '2003-02-25 15:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(224279, 13109, 5508, '<td valign="top">Great shot always wanted to smoke a pipe. 10</td>', 'Great shot always wanted to smoke a pipe. 10', '2003-02-25 15:39:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(224280, 12840, 5508, '<td valign="top">Great photo. 10</td>', 'Great photo. 10', '2003-02-25 15:40:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(224281, 13082, 5508, '<td valign="top">Wow. That''s all I can say. 10</td>', 'Wow. That''s all I can say. 10', '2003-02-25 15:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(224282, 12872, 5508, '<td valign="top">Very profesional. Great lighting. 10</td>', 'Very profesional. Great lighting. 10', '2003-02-25 15:40:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(224283, 12862, 5508, '<td valign="top">I could see this in a Stock Photography book, 10.</td>', 'I could see this in a Stock Photography book, 10.', '2003-02-25 15:41:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(224284, 13062, 5508, '<td valign="top">I could see this in a stock book. 10</td>', 'I could see this in a stock book. 10', '2003-02-25 15:41:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(224285, 12867, 5508, '<td valign="top">I could see this in a stock book. 10</td>', 'I could see this in a stock book. 10', '2003-02-25 15:42:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(224286, 13098, 5508, '<td valign="top">I could see this in a stock book. 10</td>', 'I could see this in a stock book. 10', '2003-02-25 15:42:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(224287, 13086, 5508, '<td valign="top">I could see this in a stock book. 10</td>', 'I could see this in a stock book. 10', '2003-02-25 15:42:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(224288, 13099, 5508, '<td valign="top">I could see this in a stock book. 10</td>', 'I could see this in a stock book. 10', '2003-02-25 15:42:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(224289, 12854, 5508, '<td valign="top">I could see this in a stock book. 10</td>', 'I could see this in a stock book. 10', '2003-02-25 15:42:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(224290, 13074, 5508, '<td valign="top">I could see this in a stock book. 9</td>', 'I could see this in a stock book. 9', '2003-02-25 15:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(224291, 12971, 5508, '<td valign="top">I could see this in a stock book. 9</td>', 'I could see this in a stock book. 9', '2003-02-25 15:43:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(224294, 12922, 2361, '<td valign="top">The shadow, unfortunately, takes away a great deal of the value for stock here in my judgement.  5 Jak</td>', 'The shadow, unfortunately, takes away a great deal of the value for stock here in my judgement.  5 Jak', '2003-02-25 15:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(224295, 12924, 2361, '<td valign="top">What a fabulous capture!  Well done.  9 Jak</td>', 'What a fabulous capture!  Well done.  9 Jak', '2003-02-25 15:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(224328, 13123, 5865, '<td valign="top">I love this photograph.  Obviously the rays of the sun have been caught beautifully and the lighting in the bottom third of the picture is very appealing.  I am not sure if it is a  little too tall.  My eyes seem to be drawn to the bottom 2/3rds of the shot and the above that seems a little bland.  However I really love it.</td>', 'I love this photograph.  Obviously the rays of the sun have been caught beautifully and the lighting in the bottom third of the picture is very appealing.  I am not sure if it is a  little too tall.  My eyes seem to be drawn to the bottom 2/3rds of the shot and the above that seems a little bland.  However I really love it.', '2003-02-25 16:30:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(224350, 12858, 4967, '<td valign="top">The picture techniclly isn\''t too bad... The lighting could have been imroved slightly, the flash, or whatever lighting you used here is quite obvious in the round green (skirt?)  The biggest problem here is that a stock company probably wouldn\''t buy this photo, and I\''m going to explain my reasonings.  This could not be used for any type of advertising, or even mass selling because the character in it is copyrighted, and you and the stock company buying it and selling it would get sued.  This is basically a picture of somebody elses creativity and work of art.  Unfortunately I do not see this as fitting the challenge.</td>', 'The picture techniclly isn\''t too bad... The lighting could have been imroved slightly, the flash, or whatever lighting you used here is quite obvious in the round green (skirt?)  The biggest problem here is that a stock company probably wouldn\''t buy this photo, and I\''m going to explain my reasonings.  This could not be used for any type of advertising, or even mass selling because the character in it is copyrighted, and you and the stock company buying it and selling it would get sued.  This is basically a picture of somebody elses creativity and work of art.  Unfortunately I do not see this as fitting the challenge.', '2003-02-25 17:05:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(224353, 13089, 4967, '<td valign="top">YAY!  I love docs... for a long time they were the only shoes I wear.  I like your dof on this photo, it''s a very interesting perspective and I think it might sell some copies.  The one thing that bothers me is the white inbetween the two shoes.  I think this is where my eye tends to go, and this takes away from the picture overall.  Still very interesting angle, and nicely done.</td>', 'YAY!  I love docs... for a long time they were the only shoes I wear.  I like your dof on this photo, it''s a very interesting perspective and I think it might sell some copies.  The one thing that bothers me is the white inbetween the two shoes.  I think this is where my eye tends to go, and this takes away from the picture overall.  Still very interesting angle, and nicely done.', '2003-02-25 17:12:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(224394, 12958, 6696, '<td valign="top">Nice - I think a white border would have framed it better</td>', 'Nice - I think a white border would have framed it better', '2003-02-25 19:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(224398, 12926, 6696, '<td valign="top">Stock for a funeral home?  It has an artistic feel, but the lighting is a little harsh.</td>', 'Stock for a funeral home?  It has an artistic feel, but the lighting is a little harsh.', '2003-02-25 19:29:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(224400, 13000, 6696, '<td valign="top">Good idea - I wish the lighting was more even.</td>', 'Good idea - I wish the lighting was more even.', '2003-02-25 19:31:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(224401, 13052, 6696, '<td valign="top">Nice, but the lighting is a bit harsh</td>', 'Nice, but the lighting is a bit harsh', '2003-02-25 19:33:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(224403, 13084, 6696, '<td valign="top">Nice shot - not quite sure if this is considered stock.</td>', 'Nice shot - not quite sure if this is considered stock.', '2003-02-25 19:36:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(224405, 12863, 6696, '<td valign="top">Wow - love it.</td>', 'Wow - love it.', '2003-02-25 19:38:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(224407, 13068, 6696, '<td valign="top">Simple and pure.  Nice.  Shadows are a bit hard.</td>', 'Simple and pure.  Nice.  Shadows are a bit hard.', '2003-02-25 19:40:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(224410, 13025, 6696, '<td valign="top">Meets challenge well.  Splothces in lower half are a little distracting</td>', 'Meets challenge well.  Splothces in lower half are a little distracting', '2003-02-25 19:42:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(224415, 12880, 6405, '<td valign="top">Very dark,no contrast</td>', 'Very dark,no contrast', '2003-02-25 20:00:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(224416, 13112, 6405, '<td valign="top">nice flag</td>', 'nice flag', '2003-02-25 20:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(224424, 13041, 1280, '<td valign="top">Very good closeup showing lots of detail.  Maybeeeeee too much...lol  There are some black specks on the model''s upper lip.  With this type of closeup the details need to be meticulous. Your model was well chosen for her pearly whites. and the red of the berry, and her lips contrast beautifully.<br/>Overall a good image.</td>', 'Very good closeup showing lots of detail.  Maybeeeeee too much...lol  There are some black specks on the model''s upper lip.  With this type of closeup the details need to be meticulous. Your model was well chosen for her pearly whites. and the red of the berry, and her lips contrast beautifully.Overall a good image.', '2003-02-25 20:13:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(224426, 13125, 1280, '<td valign="top">Lovely image with great focus on the eyes.</td>', 'Lovely image with great focus on the eyes.', '2003-02-25 20:14:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(224427, 13071, 6696, '<td valign="top">Wow - nice sharpness, dof, exposure, cropping.  Good job.</td>', 'Wow - nice sharpness, dof, exposure, cropping.  Good job.', '2003-02-25 20:15:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(224432, 13120, 1280, '<td valign="top">Good stock image!  Great clarity on the eye too.</td>', 'Good stock image!  Great clarity on the eye too.', '2003-02-25 20:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(224446, 12835, 6696, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see a closer crop, but it''s a nice shot.</td>', 'I''d like to see a closer crop, but it''s a nice shot.', '2003-02-25 20:56:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(224449, 13041, 4162, '<td valign="top">This is great! I can imagine this being used in various ways as stock. Great composition, and colours, slightly cliche but I think that this would sell.</td>', 'This is great! I can imagine this being used in various ways as stock. Great composition, and colours, slightly cliche but I think that this would sell.', '2003-02-25 21:01:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(224450, 13082, 4162, '<td valign="top">This is a perfect flag picture, lovely textures and very bold colours and focus.</td>', 'This is a perfect flag picture, lovely textures and very bold colours and focus.', '2003-02-25 21:03:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(224453, 13117, 4162, '<td valign="top">Perfect focus and colour saturation. A lovely simple composition, which I can imagine being used for various stock purposes.</td>', 'Perfect focus and colour saturation. A lovely simple composition, which I can imagine being used for various stock purposes.', '2003-02-25 21:06:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(224454, 12854, 4162, '<td valign="top">I love the yellow background, the use of DOF is great here, with the plug fading into the background. Perhaps DOF is a tiny bit shallow, the front of the plug could do with a bit more sharpness IMO, but excellent shot!</td>', 'I love the yellow background, the use of DOF is great here, with the plug fading into the background. Perhaps DOF is a tiny bit shallow, the front of the plug could do with a bit more sharpness IMO, but excellent shot!', '2003-02-25 21:08:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(224455, 12909, 6696, '<td valign="top">Wow - beautifully framed with tree limbs</td>', 'Wow - beautifully framed with tree limbs', '2003-02-25 21:11:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(224461, 12909, 1280, '<td valign="top">I like your composition, the way the branches hang in the foreground and frame the barn.  The dirt road leads in nicely.<br/>Over all it''s nice but could be a little sharper.  Focus is a little soft.</td>', 'I like your composition, the way the branches hang in the foreground and frame the barn.  The dirt road leads in nicely.Over all it''s nice but could be a little sharper.  Focus is a little soft.', '2003-02-25 21:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
