(224506, 13122, 2170, '<td valign="top">I would like to see this image so that the colors weren''t so washed out.  Otherwise, this is really a great image that I could definitely see multiple uses for.  If you have Photoshop, try playing with the Levels to make the color of the photo really pop from the white of the snow.</td>', 'I would like to see this image so that the colors weren''t so washed out.  Otherwise, this is really a great image that I could definitely see multiple uses for.  If you have Photoshop, try playing with the Levels to make the color of the photo really pop from the white of the snow.', '2003-02-25 22:19:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(224508, 13018, 2170, '<td valign="top">Perfect stock photo image.  My only comment is that the crop might be too tight for a stock photo (us wacky designers just love to do our own cropping), but I''m not holding that against you.  This is a very nice image and at a great angle.</td>', 'Perfect stock photo image.  My only comment is that the crop might be too tight for a stock photo (us wacky designers just love to do our own cropping), but I''m not holding that against you.  This is a very nice image and at a great angle.', '2003-02-25 22:20:40.000000', NULL, 1),
