(224512, 13025, 2170, '<td valign="top">Good idea.  Well, actually, a great idea.  The lens flares in the center of the image distract, unfortunately, and the colors should be more vibrant.  Perhaps also changing your angle just slightly to the right (to get rid of the taillight) would also help this out.  Great idea...very simple, and the kind of shot I can never find when I need it.</td>', 'Good idea.  Well, actually, a great idea.  The lens flares in the center of the image distract, unfortunately, and the colors should be more vibrant.  Perhaps also changing your angle just slightly to the right (to get rid of the taillight) would also help this out.  Great idea...very simple, and the kind of shot I can never find when I need it.', '2003-02-25 22:22:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(224513, 12915, 1280, '<td valign="top">Very stark, and effective.  It could be a little sharper.  Nice though.</td>', 'Very stark, and effective.  It could be a little sharper.  Nice though.', '2003-02-25 22:23:31.000000', NULL, 1),
