(224602, 12866, 4494, '<td valign="top">Too much tree on the left, it takes away from the subject.  Should have zoomed in a little more keeping on the smaller trees in the pic.</td>', 'Too much tree on the left, it takes away from the subject.  Should have zoomed in a little more keeping on the smaller trees in the pic.', '2003-02-25 23:54:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(224603, 13082, 4494, '<td valign="top">Only thing is the stars aren''t white. :(  Very nice however.</td>', 'Only thing is the stars aren''t white. :(  Very nice however.', '2003-02-25 23:55:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(224604, 12904, 4494, '<td valign="top">It''s in between sharp and blurry.  Should be one or the other I think.</td>', 'It''s in between sharp and blurry.  Should be one or the other I think.', '2003-02-25 23:57:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(224605, 13000, 4494, '<td valign="top">It looks like you were trying to put the light on the weak link, but it''s not strong enough... Should have BLASTED it with light.  Cool idea however, I like it.</td>', 'It looks like you were trying to put the light on the weak link, but it''s not strong enough... Should have BLASTED it with light.  Cool idea however, I like it.', '2003-02-25 23:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(224606, 12922, 4494, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the shadows on the building.</td>', 'I don''t like the shadows on the building.', '2003-02-25 23:59:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(224609, 12872, 3280, '<td valign="top">nice, good, clear, blue, good-lighting, well-composed</td>', 'nice, good, clear, blue, good-lighting, well-composed', '2003-02-26 00:00:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(224610, 13086, 4494, '<td valign="top">Pretty good but I think leveling the pic would give a stronger sense of him running.</td>', 'Pretty good but I think leveling the pic would give a stronger sense of him running.', '2003-02-26 00:01:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(224612, 12969, 4494, '<td valign="top">Uck it''s a brown apple!  Plus it''s tilted to the right about 3 degrees, it looks like there''s a reflection from your TV on the left side!!</td>', 'Uck it''s a brown apple!  Plus it''s tilted to the right about 3 degrees, it looks like there''s a reflection from your TV on the left side!!', '2003-02-26 00:03:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(224613, 12987, 4494, '<td valign="top">Wow that''s very nice.  The skin tones are awesome.   I can''t think of any improvements.</td>', 'Wow that''s very nice.  The skin tones are awesome.   I can''t think of any improvements.', '2003-02-26 00:05:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(224614, 12927, 4494, '<td valign="top">LOL, there''s a missing piece of corn!  Plus the cob (lower left) isn''t appealing to look at.  Lighting is nice however.</td>', 'LOL, there''s a missing piece of corn!  Plus the cob (lower left) isn''t appealing to look at.  Lighting is nice however.', '2003-02-26 00:06:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(224615, 12972, 4494, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  The place of the eyes and nose is great, plus the lighting is really good. 8.</td>', 'Nice shot.  The place of the eyes and nose is great, plus the lighting is really good. 8.', '2003-02-26 00:08:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(224616, 13074, 4494, '<td valign="top">Nice, but it needs a blast of light from the lower left maybe?  Not sure, maybe not.  Good one.</td>', 'Nice, but it needs a blast of light from the lower left maybe?  Not sure, maybe not.  Good one.', '2003-02-26 00:09:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(224618, 13099, 4494, '<td valign="top">What''s "El Tenedor" mean?</td>', 'What''s "El Tenedor" mean?', '2003-02-26 00:13:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(224619, 13090, 4494, '<td valign="top">Perfect lighting but it needs more blurred people in it.  That''d be really cool.</td>', 'Perfect lighting but it needs more blurred people in it.  That''d be really cool.', '2003-02-26 00:14:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(224620, 13052, 4494, '<td valign="top">Wow, that is a "baby".  Must have just "popped out". :)  Nice shot!</td>', 'Wow, that is a "baby".  Must have just "popped out". :)  Nice shot!', '2003-02-26 00:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(224621, 13033, 4494, '<td valign="top">Whooo pretty cool and meaning meaningfull pic.  Nice setup and lighting/background also.  8.</td>', 'Whooo pretty cool and meaning meaningfull pic.  Nice setup and lighting/background also.  8.', '2003-02-26 00:17:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(224622, 13122, 4494, '<td valign="top">God it must suck living in a city that gets this much snow.   I couldn''t take it. :)  Like to visit but...</td>', 'God it must suck living in a city that gets this much snow.   I couldn''t take it. :)  Like to visit but...', '2003-02-26 00:19:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(224623, 12854, 4494, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.</td>', 'Nice shot.', '2003-02-26 00:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(224625, 13113, 4494, '<td valign="top">The upper part shouldn''t be blurry in this, I don''t think.  Looks like you did it on purpose but I think it''d be better in focus.</td>', 'The upper part shouldn''t be blurry in this, I don''t think.  Looks like you did it on purpose but I think it''d be better in focus.', '2003-02-26 00:21:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(224626, 12880, 4494, '<td valign="top">Ack, it''s way to underexposed.  Should have used Levels and the little "eye-dropper" thing to tweak the white level (brighten it).</td>', 'Ack, it''s way to underexposed.  Should have used Levels and the little "eye-dropper" thing to tweak the white level (brighten it).', '2003-02-26 00:22:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(224630, 13062, 4494, '<td valign="top">Love the bright, vivid colors, and especially the water color. 8.  The only "flaw" is the blurry upper paddle fin.  No big deal tho.</td>', 'Love the bright, vivid colors, and especially the water color. 8.  The only "flaw" is the blurry upper paddle fin.  No big deal tho.', '2003-02-26 00:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(224631, 13041, 4494, '<td valign="top">A redder strawberry would be better to match the lipstick, but still pretty good.</td>', 'A redder strawberry would be better to match the lipstick, but still pretty good.', '2003-02-26 00:30:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(224632, 13084, 4494, '<td valign="top">Umm, I love Cracker Jacks.</td>', 'Umm, I love Cracker Jacks.', '2003-02-26 00:31:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(224633, 12849, 4494, '<td valign="top">Nice!</td>', 'Nice!', '2003-02-26 00:32:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(224635, 12835, 4494, '<td valign="top">Is that a fishing reel in the back?  If so, it should be more "obvious" to make the pic better.</td>', 'Is that a fishing reel in the back?  If so, it should be more "obvious" to make the pic better.', '2003-02-26 00:36:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(224637, 13006, 4267, '<td valign="top">ahh I love those dice... :o)  to improve the shot try an alternate light source and some manual adjustments to the shutter speed and or apature... if you have them.. the straight on flash doesnt work well for close ups</td>', 'ahh I love those dice... :o)  to improve the shot try an alternate light source and some manual adjustments to the shutter speed and or apature... if you have them.. the straight on flash doesnt work well for close ups', '2003-02-26 00:39:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(224670, 13087, 4569, '<td valign="top">Beatiful view.... where is it?<br/></td>', 'Beatiful view.... where is it?', '2003-02-26 05:06:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(224696, 13000, 2780, '<td valign="top">I really think this would be excellent as a stock photo. The diagonal composition is good, and I like the shadow. The simple background works really well too. 10</td>', 'I really think this would be excellent as a stock photo. The diagonal composition is good, and I like the shadow. The simple background works really well too. 10', '2003-02-26 08:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(224697, 12988, 2780, '<td valign="top">Nice and simple, good composition, would make a good stock photo too. 10</td>', 'Nice and simple, good composition, would make a good stock photo too. 10', '2003-02-26 08:22:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(224698, 13099, 2780, '<td valign="top">I like the black on red. The composition is quite good, but the fork leads the eyes to the end, which appears, unfortunatly, to be slightly out of focus.</td>', 'I like the black on red. The composition is quite good, but the fork leads the eyes to the end, which appears, unfortunatly, to be slightly out of focus.', '2003-02-26 08:23:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(224699, 13052, 2780, '<td valign="top">I really like this. The colour tones are very nice, and the expression on the kitten is excellent :)</td>', 'I really like this. The colour tones are very nice, and the expression on the kitten is excellent :)', '2003-02-26 08:23:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(224700, 12915, 2780, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition, and good negative space at the top. I can see this making a good stock photo.</td>', 'Very nice composition, and good negative space at the top. I can see this making a good stock photo.', '2003-02-26 08:24:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(224701, 12849, 2780, '<td valign="top">Very nice moody shot. I like the way the tree is solhouetted, and the colour tones look great.</td>', 'Very nice moody shot. I like the way the tree is solhouetted, and the colour tones look great.', '2003-02-26 08:25:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(224702, 12872, 2780, '<td valign="top">Great job lighting this! I know how hard it can be. I think the photo however suffers slightly from over-sharpening. I can see jaggies on the edge of the glass. This can also be helped by using Bicubic resampling instead of Bilinnear. Great blue tones too.</td>', 'Great job lighting this! I know how hard it can be. I think the photo however suffers slightly from over-sharpening. I can see jaggies on the edge of the glass. This can also be helped by using Bicubic resampling instead of Bilinnear. Great blue tones too.', '2003-02-26 08:26:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(224703, 12980, 2780, '<td valign="top">Great texture in the wall and nicely composed image. I like the colours too, looks very good.</td>', 'Great texture in the wall and nicely composed image. I like the colours too, looks very good.', '2003-02-26 08:27:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(224704, 12850, 2780, '<td valign="top">I like this, it has a good atmosphere about it, kind of deserted and desolate. Boosting the contrast a little would make the windmill in front more of a silhouette and the clouds more dramatic, which might improve the photo, but it depends what look you were going for.</td>', 'I like this, it has a good atmosphere about it, kind of deserted and desolate. Boosting the contrast a little would make the windmill in front more of a silhouette and the clouds more dramatic, which might improve the photo, but it depends what look you were going for.', '2003-02-26 08:28:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(224705, 13059, 2780, '<td valign="top">Very nicely composed, but I dont think it is a sharp as it could be.</td>', 'Very nicely composed, but I dont think it is a sharp as it could be.', '2003-02-26 08:29:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(224706, 12840, 2780, '<td valign="top">Very nice DOF here, and the white background makes it very useable in stock photography.</td>', 'Very nice DOF here, and the white background makes it very useable in stock photography.', '2003-02-26 08:29:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(224707, 13093, 2780, '<td valign="top">Good composition, and well framed by that branch of the tree. I like the use of black and white too... or is it sepia?</td>', 'Good composition, and well framed by that branch of the tree. I like the use of black and white too... or is it sepia?', '2003-02-26 08:30:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(224708, 13123, 2780, '<td valign="top">The sunrays look great coming out of the cloud. A very good atmospheric shot. The clouds are excellent, as is the composition of the photo.</td>', 'The sunrays look great coming out of the cloud. A very good atmospheric shot. The clouds are excellent, as is the composition of the photo.', '2003-02-26 08:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(224709, 12985, 2780, '<td valign="top">Excellent colours, really vivid. The sharpening looks perfect too.</td>', 'Excellent colours, really vivid. The sharpening looks perfect too.', '2003-02-26 08:31:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(224710, 13062, 2780, '<td valign="top">I like the unusual angle. I think the boat is cropped slightly too near to the edge of the frame at the bottom however.</td>', 'I like the unusual angle. I think the boat is cropped slightly too near to the edge of the frame at the bottom however.', '2003-02-26 08:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(224711, 13054, 2780, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, looks very good. I''m wondering if this might work better in sepia or black and white though...</td>', 'I like the composition, looks very good. I''m wondering if this might work better in sepia or black and white though...', '2003-02-26 08:33:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(224712, 13082, 2780, '<td valign="top">Really nice vivid colours, and the composition is good. I think that it would look better if the stars were their normal white though.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-03-03 02:38:38.</i></td>', 'Really nice vivid colours, and the composition is good. I think that it would look better if the stars were their normal white though.', '2003-02-26 08:35:10.000000', '2003-03-03 02:38:38.000000', 1),
(224713, 12928, 2780, '<td valign="top">I think this would make a very good stock photo. The composition and DOF are both very good.</td>', 'I think this would make a very good stock photo. The composition and DOF are both very good.', '2003-02-26 08:35:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(224714, 13041, 2780, '<td valign="top">I like this. Some parts seem out of focus slightly, and I think that even if this was done purposly, it would look better if it were all sharp. The plain bright white background would work very well for stock photography, adding more impact to the subject of the photo itself.</td>', 'I like this. Some parts seem out of focus slightly, and I think that even if this was done purposly, it would look better if it were all sharp. The plain bright white background would work very well for stock photography, adding more impact to the subject of the photo itself.', '2003-02-26 08:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(224715, 13098, 2780, '<td valign="top">Nice and sharp, with an original angle and good composition. The white background is great for stock photography as well, and the little bit of grey near the top right just adds a little interest too. Very good photo.</td>', 'Nice and sharp, with an original angle and good composition. The white background is great for stock photography as well, and the little bit of grey near the top right just adds a little interest too. Very good photo.', '2003-02-26 08:38:01.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(224736, 13082, 6651, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color, but should be mirrored (the "right" side of the flag)</td>', 'Beautiful color, but should be mirrored (the "right" side of the flag)', '2003-02-26 10:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(224766, 12985, 1826, '<td valign="top">Lovely light...</td>', 'Lovely light...', '2003-02-26 11:14:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(224768, 13045, 1826, '<td valign="top">Nice and sharp with great color and DOF. Nice work!</td>', 'Nice and sharp with great color and DOF. Nice work!', '2003-02-26 11:19:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(224771, 13117, 1826, '<td valign="top">Wow! What a sky! This has great depth, nice work.</td>', 'Wow! What a sky! This has great depth, nice work.', '2003-02-26 11:23:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(224775, 13018, 1041, '<td valign="top">I can see this concept being used for stock photography, so you''ve met the challenge.  It''s fun to see one of those phones, my parents had one, now it looks old and clunky to me.  I like the composition of your photo for stock photography, too.  Generally, I would have said it''s a little unbalanced, but in this case I feel there''s room available for someone to add text to the photo.  I do see some issues with the technical site of this photo.  Overall, the focus is soft, and there are highlights from the lighting.  That can be fixed by holding a couple of sheets of paper between the light-source and your subject.  I can see your reflection in the middle of the dial, I''m not sure what would''ve been the easiest way of removing that.  Lastly, your background is a little gray in the bottom right corner (I know just how hard it is to get a really white background so I appreciate your effort) and there are some dirtparticles (?) visible (right middle, inside of the loop made by the cord).</td>', 'I can see this concept being used for stock photography, so you''ve met the challenge.  It''s fun to see one of those phones, my parents had one, now it looks old and clunky to me.  I like the composition of your photo for stock photography, too.  Generally, I would have said it''s a little unbalanced, but in this case I feel there''s room available for someone to add text to the photo.  I do see some issues with the technical site of this photo.  Overall, the focus is soft, and there are highlights from the lighting.  That can be fixed by holding a couple of sheets of paper between the light-source and your subject.  I can see your reflection in the middle of the dial, I''m not sure what would''ve been the easiest way of removing that.  Lastly, your background is a little gray in the bottom right corner (I know just how hard it is to get a really white background so I appreciate your effort) and there are some dirtparticles (?) visible (right middle, inside of the loop made by the cord).', '2003-02-26 11:38:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(224776, 12858, 2553, '<td valign="top">I don''t care for photos of items such as this, and I can''t imagine where it might be used as "stock photography", however, that''s just me.  It IS a nice sharp,clear photo, with very good use of negative space to accentuate your subject, and I like the tight composition.</td>', 'I don''t care for photos of items such as this, and I can''t imagine where it might be used as "stock photography", however, that''s just me.  It IS a nice sharp,clear photo, with very good use of negative space to accentuate your subject, and I like the tight composition.', '2003-02-26 11:39:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(224789, 13054, 1041, '<td valign="top">This looks like a really cool place to take photos, bet you took many more than just this one :)  You''ve met the challenge with it, too.  I can see this being used in a travel-kind of article.  I really have no constructive criticism to offer, except maybe use a different border, the color of this one doesn''t really match anything of the photo.  I do like how you got your snow white with only very little blowout, and you kept the detail in the dark walls.  You made the photo look 3D by having the snow-covered rocks in the foreground.   I''ll be curious to see next week where this was taken.</td>', 'This looks like a really cool place to take photos, bet you took many more than just this one :)  You''ve met the challenge with it, too.  I can see this being used in a travel-kind of article.  I really have no constructive criticism to offer, except maybe use a different border, the color of this one doesn''t really match anything of the photo.  I do like how you got your snow white with only very little blowout, and you kept the detail in the dark walls.  You made the photo look 3D by having the snow-covered rocks in the foreground.   I''ll be curious to see next week where this was taken.', '2003-02-26 13:17:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(224790, 12988, 1041, '<td valign="top">Oh, this shot is incredible ... I love the soft colors, the curves at the top and then the tiny window in the thick wall, placed just right ... you might just have a winner here :)</td>', 'Oh, this shot is incredible ... I love the soft colors, the curves at the top and then the tiny window in the thick wall, placed just right ... you might just have a winner here :)', '2003-02-26 13:18:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(224880, 13084, 6806, '<td valign="top">The color and texture of this picture are very good</td>', 'The color and texture of this picture are very good', '2003-02-26 17:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(224882, 12915, 6806, '<td valign="top">I love old barns. This is great.</td>', 'I love old barns. This is great.', '2003-02-26 17:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(224937, 12862, 4482, '<td valign="top">My 10 of the week!! Perfect stock photo! Cropping is excellent</td>', 'My 10 of the week!! Perfect stock photo! Cropping is excellent', '2003-02-26 21:45:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(224940, 12971, 4482, '<td valign="top">My number 2 pic of the week! Meets the challenge perfectly. cropping I like.  9</td>', 'My number 2 pic of the week! Meets the challenge perfectly. cropping I like.  9', '2003-02-26 21:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(224943, 13082, 4482, '<td valign="top">I''m not a big fan of flag shots... and I got oversaturated quickly with US flags.  :-P <br/> But this is the BEST flag shot I''ve ever seen! The cropiing is perfect and the colors...... woooooooo the colors!! I would see this in a stock mag.</td>', 'I''m not a big fan of flag shots... and I got oversaturated quickly with US flags.  :-P  But this is the BEST flag shot I''ve ever seen! The cropiing is perfect and the colors...... woooooooo the colors!! I would see this in a stock mag.', '2003-02-26 21:48:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(224947, 12854, 4482, '<td valign="top">Hey! I had a shot like that!!  ;-)  This one fits the theme well. The negative space gives space for writing. Good job! 8</td>', 'Hey! I had a shot like that!!  ;-)  This one fits the theme well. The negative space gives space for writing. Good job! 8', '2003-02-26 21:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(225049, 13068, 1280, '<td valign="top">Nice job.  Simple, effective, concise, with room for text.</td>', 'Nice job.  Simple, effective, concise, with room for text.', '2003-02-26 23:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(225056, 13062, 2079, '<td valign="top">Congrats on my highest rated photo of the challenge. 10 - The color is brilliant. Just a tad of blur on the oar showing motion, but Im not sure the blur adds anything for me on this shot. The crop is crowding the bottom of the shot. In a perfect world I would probably have centered the boat in the frame, but I have no idea if the crop is trying to hide something undesirable behind the boat. All in all a great shot, I can see this showing up in many sports clothing magazines.</td>', 'Congrats on my highest rated photo of the challenge. 10 - The color is brilliant. Just a tad of blur on the oar showing motion, but Im not sure the blur adds anything for me on this shot. The crop is crowding the bottom of the shot. In a perfect world I would probably have centered the boat in the frame, but I have no idea if the crop is trying to hide something undesirable behind the boat. All in all a great shot, I can see this showing up in many sports clothing magazines.', '2003-02-26 23:18:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(225058, 13045, 2079, '<td valign="top">A great shot, excellent detail, color and clarity. I like the blur to the background, it keeps your eye on the subject.</td>', 'A great shot, excellent detail, color and clarity. I like the blur to the background, it keeps your eye on the subject.', '2003-02-26 23:24:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(225064, 13108, 7007, '<td valign="top">Orginal, great clarity and lighting.</td>', 'Orginal, great clarity and lighting.', '2003-02-26 23:41:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(225067, 13062, 3280, '<td valign="top">Great color and room for text.  I wish the lighting was a bit more even.</td>', 'Great color and room for text.  I wish the lighting was a bit more even.', '2003-02-26 23:47:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(225071, 12850, 3280, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot, one of this weeks best! Great color and light and contrast.  Would work nicely for stock as well.  WTG!</td>', 'Awesome shot, one of this weeks best! Great color and light and contrast.  Would work nicely for stock as well.  WTG!', '2003-02-26 23:55:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(225074, 13059, 3280, '<td valign="top">Beautiful blue sky and nice shot.  I wonder what it would look like just a bit to the left with a little less of the tree blocking the tower.</td>', 'Beautiful blue sky and nice shot.  I wonder what it would look like just a bit to the left with a little less of the tree blocking the tower.', '2003-02-26 23:56:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(225075, 13021, 3280, '<td valign="top">Nice job although I think the clips could be a bit sharper.</td>', 'Nice job although I think the clips could be a bit sharper.', '2003-02-26 23:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(225076, 13096, 3280, '<td valign="top">Seems very grainey.  A bit too pink for my tastes as well.</td>', 'Seems very grainey.  A bit too pink for my tastes as well.', '2003-02-26 23:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(225077, 12998, 3280, '<td valign="top">Nice colors. A dark black border seems like it would have really set it off.</td>', 'Nice colors. A dark black border seems like it would have really set it off.', '2003-02-26 23:59:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(225078, 12976, 3280, '<td valign="top">Beautiful rainbow. A tough contrast and you captured it well.  Too bad the mountains are covered in the back. You might crop it up just a touch from the bottom.<br/></td>', 'Beautiful rainbow. A tough contrast and you captured it well.  Too bad the mountains are covered in the back. You might crop it up just a touch from the bottom.', '2003-02-27 00:00:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(225084, 13033, 3280, '<td valign="top">Very creative. Background might be a bit too busy bit I like the colors.</td>', 'Very creative. Background might be a bit too busy bit I like the colors.', '2003-02-27 00:06:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(225100, 12958, 4267, '<td valign="top">Great textures and color... just needs the glare reduced or elliminated to be perfect</td>', 'Great textures and color... just needs the glare reduced or elliminated to be perfect', '2003-02-27 01:50:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(225101, 13098, 4267, '<td valign="top">plain white background works really well with the subject... but for me, I think the PC should be turned at least 30 to 45 degrees so we see the screen at least at an angle rather than a profile.. then again, there are few profile shots I like...</td>', 'plain white background works really well with the subject... but for me, I think the PC should be turned at least 30 to 45 degrees so we see the screen at least at an angle rather than a profile.. then again, there are few profile shots I like...', '2003-02-27 01:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(225102, 12998, 4267, '<td valign="top">great color, light, and clarity... might be better backed off a bit or at an angle so it looks like an endless field of beans.. a least worth taking a look at.</td>', 'great color, light, and clarity... might be better backed off a bit or at an angle so it looks like an endless field of beans.. a least worth taking a look at.', '2003-02-27 01:53:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(225104, 13062, 4267, '<td valign="top">interesting view. I like it at this angle</td>', 'interesting view. I like it at this angle', '2003-02-27 01:54:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(225106, 12880, 4267, '<td valign="top">mmmmm elk steak!</td>', 'mmmmm elk steak!', '2003-02-27 01:55:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(225107, 12987, 4267, '<td valign="top">for stock, children should be smiling... otherwise a really nice portraight</td>', 'for stock, children should be smiling... otherwise a really nice portraight', '2003-02-27 01:56:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(225109, 13025, 4267, '<td valign="top">wow I like the composition of the shot.. works really well, but there is something on the lens or near the lens giving a white haze that messes the shot up</td>', 'wow I like the composition of the shot.. works really well, but there is something on the lens or near the lens giving a white haze that messes the shot up', '2003-02-27 01:56:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(225110, 12915, 4267, '<td valign="top">with that washed sky try cropping some out or going sepia/bnw</td>', 'with that washed sky try cropping some out or going sepia/bnw', '2003-02-27 01:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(225111, 12849, 4267, '<td valign="top">I like the BnW here... try getting lower and looking up and filling the frame with all of the branches.. otherwise great shot!</td>', 'I like the BnW here... try getting lower and looking up and filling the frame with all of the branches.. otherwise great shot!', '2003-02-27 01:59:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(225112, 13082, 4267, '<td valign="top">super sweet color! love it!</td>', 'super sweet color! love it!', '2003-02-27 01:59:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(225129, 12958, 3540, '<td valign="top">Cool photo.  I''m sort of on the fence here whether or not this photo is a little underexposed or not, but I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt.  The reds are good but the blackberries and blueberries are a pinch dark.  Overall it''s pretty darn good though.  Nice shot!</td>', 'Cool photo.  I''m sort of on the fence here whether or not this photo is a little underexposed or not, but I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt.  The reds are good but the blackberries and blueberries are a pinch dark.  Overall it''s pretty darn good though.  Nice shot!', '2003-02-27 05:00:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(225130, 13087, 3540, '<td valign="top">Nice cityscape photo.  Great DOF on this shot.  Could''ve used a bit more exposure I think, or a little more sun.  I like the stuff right down on the water, but it could use a little more detail.  Overall a pretty nice pic though.</td>', 'Nice cityscape photo.  Great DOF on this shot.  Could''ve used a bit more exposure I think, or a little more sun.  I like the stuff right down on the water, but it could use a little more detail.  Overall a pretty nice pic though.', '2003-02-27 05:05:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(225131, 12940, 1829, '<td valign="top">Colours, composition and colour in your image is fantastic.   The tree is like a beautiful silhouette.  Just one tiny pick is that althought the light is giving off a brilliant radiance and colour, it''s a little harsh on the eyes.  Overall a great picture.</td>', 'Colours, composition and colour in your image is fantastic.   The tree is like a beautiful silhouette.  Just one tiny pick is that althought the light is giving off a brilliant radiance and colour, it''s a little harsh on the eyes.  Overall a great picture.', '2003-02-27 05:07:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(225132, 12998, 1829, '<td valign="top">Excellent image for a ''stock'' photo.   Excellent vibrant colours which fills the whole frame.  I like that the jelly bellies are all over the place and haven''t been deliberately ''set up''.  Excellent idea and great composition.  Well achieved.  GL</td>', 'Excellent image for a ''stock'' photo.   Excellent vibrant colours which fills the whole frame.  I like that the jelly bellies are all over the place and haven''t been deliberately ''set up''.  Excellent idea and great composition.  Well achieved.  GL', '2003-02-27 05:09:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(225133, 12978, 3540, '<td valign="top">I think the crop is too tight on this and/or the picture was taken from too close.  Losing focus at the bottom right part of the pic.</td>', 'I think the crop is too tight on this and/or the picture was taken from too close.  Losing focus at the bottom right part of the pic.', '2003-02-27 05:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(225134, 12909, 1829, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition and clarity.  Feels like I''m back on the farm..lol in my country.  I really like the olden feel about this image.  Excellent work and a great capture.  GL.</td>', 'Excellent composition and clarity.  Feels like I''m back on the farm..lol in my country.  I really like the olden feel about this image.  Excellent work and a great capture.  GL.', '2003-02-27 05:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(225135, 13061, 1829, '<td valign="top">The title certainly fits this image.  Oh I''d hate it if it were me stuck there like that.  You have certainly captured this shot well.  Composition and subject/s is very well achieved too.  GL.</td>', 'The title certainly fits this image.  Oh I''d hate it if it were me stuck there like that.  You have certainly captured this shot well.  Composition and subject/s is very well achieved too.  GL.', '2003-02-27 05:12:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(225153, 12872, 5728, '<td valign="top">You got one item for 11 different uses here, but I can''t give you 11 points for it for some reason :-). I think you did well with this shot, it is nice and sharp and in focus and I could think of many ways to  use it in campaigns or presentations. The colour is bang on too. Good one!</td>', 'You got one item for 11 different uses here, but I can''t give you 11 points for it for some reason :-). I think you did well with this shot, it is nice and sharp and in focus and I could think of many ways to  use it in campaigns or presentations. The colour is bang on too. Good one!', '2003-02-27 06:21:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(225154, 13000, 5728, '<td valign="top">Choice stock photo, it could be used for many occasions. It is exactly the kind of photo you would see in brochures and presentations.  The title fits well, and the fact you didn''t put a border on this image was a good decision. 8 from me.</td>', 'Choice stock photo, it could be used for many occasions. It is exactly the kind of photo you would see in brochures and presentations.  The title fits well, and the fact you didn''t put a border on this image was a good decision. 8 from me.', '2003-02-27 06:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(225161, 12927, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is an amazing macro shot. Everything fits here, the composition the lighting, the title and it meets the challenge fully. Congratulations!</td>', 'This is an amazing macro shot. Everything fits here, the composition the lighting, the title and it meets the challenge fully. Congratulations!', '2003-02-27 07:51:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(225162, 13082, 5728, '<td valign="top">Excellent! The colours are so vivid and sharp, kind of crispy in a way. The crop and lighting are wonderful. Its a stock photo for sure.</td>', 'Excellent! The colours are so vivid and sharp, kind of crispy in a way. The crop and lighting are wonderful. Its a stock photo for sure.', '2003-02-27 07:53:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(225165, 12888, 5728, '<td valign="top">Great stock photo, I surely would use this one. Amazing how you got that shadow looking like that. Without that shadow there this image wouldn''t be half as good as you have captured it here. That''s not the shadow of this light bulb is it. Good illusion. Well done!</td>', 'Great stock photo, I surely would use this one. Amazing how you got that shadow looking like that. Without that shadow there this image wouldn''t be half as good as you have captured it here. That''s not the shadow of this light bulb is it. Good illusion. Well done!', '2003-02-27 08:11:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(225167, 13105, 5728, '<td valign="top">Nice effect here. The left side is a little out of focus but that isn''t too bad because lots of stock photos are like that so you could have done that deliberately. I would have prefered to see more of the subject''s eye, it seems to be too much in shadow. How did you manage to get that border like that without spot editing?</td>', 'Nice effect here. The left side is a little out of focus but that isn''t too bad because lots of stock photos are like that so you could have done that deliberately. I would have prefered to see more of the subject''s eye, it seems to be too much in shadow. How did you manage to get that border like that without spot editing?', '2003-02-27 08:18:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(225169, 13025, 5728, '<td valign="top">The idea here is very good and if it hadn''t been for those two white circular blurs there and a little more saturation this photo would have been excellent.</td>', 'The idea here is very good and if it hadn''t been for those two white circular blurs there and a little more saturation this photo would have been excellent.', '2003-02-27 08:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(225170, 13021, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is an original idea! Maybe if you hadn''t put the writing in the middle and only had the two paperclips there it could have had much more impact. I feel the writing spoils this image but that is only my opinion. Good luck anyway.</td>', 'This is an original idea! Maybe if you hadn''t put the writing in the middle and only had the two paperclips there it could have had much more impact. I feel the writing spoils this image but that is only my opinion. Good luck anyway.', '2003-02-27 08:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(225172, 13038, 5728, '<td valign="top">Those people are wondering why you are taking their photos :-) I like this photo but I have the feeling that the colour version would have done it more justice. Or maybe you could have played around with the channel mixer a little to bring out more tones in the image, it is a tad too dark  the building walls. You couldn''t couldn''t have increased the brightness anymore because the sun is already a little blown out at the top of the tree. This is a typical problem with shooting into the sun.</td>', 'Those people are wondering why you are taking their photos :-) I like this photo but I have the feeling that the colour version would have done it more justice. Or maybe you could have played around with the channel mixer a little to bring out more tones in the image, it is a tad too dark  the building walls. You couldn''t couldn''t have increased the brightness anymore because the sun is already a little blown out at the top of the tree. This is a typical problem with shooting into the sun.', '2003-02-27 08:31:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(225173, 13015, 5728, '<td valign="top">Wild cloud formation there! I like the effect of night time on the left and still daylight on the right. Something about the boats on the right bothers me though, I would have prefered to have nothing on the right as it seems to break the transformation from dark to light. It would have been great to have the sun setting there instead.</td>', 'Wild cloud formation there! I like the effect of night time on the left and still daylight on the right. Something about the boats on the right bothers me though, I would have prefered to have nothing on the right as it seems to break the transformation from dark to light. It would have been great to have the sun setting there instead.', '2003-02-27 08:36:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(225174, 12938, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good double meaning here, I wonder how many people know what a plimsoll line really is? The composition is good but the focus is a little off. Stock photography? Okay, I guess any photo can be classed as stock photography, it''s just a question of being able to sell it or not. Good luck....</td>', 'Good double meaning here, I wonder how many people know what a plimsoll line really is? The composition is good but the focus is a little off. Stock photography? Okay, I guess any photo can be classed as stock photography, it''s just a question of being able to sell it or not. Good luck....', '2003-02-27 08:44:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(225184, 13123, 6536, '<td valign="top">Great stock photo. 9.</td>', 'Great stock photo. 9.', '2003-02-27 09:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(225185, 13087, 6536, '<td valign="top">Excellent stock photo. 10.</td>', 'Excellent stock photo. 10.', '2003-02-27 09:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(225186, 12840, 6536, '<td valign="top">Perfect stock photo. 10.</td>', 'Perfect stock photo. 10.', '2003-02-27 09:35:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(225188, 13041, 6536, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot. Perfect stock photo. 10.</td>', 'Excellent shot. Perfect stock photo. 10.', '2003-02-27 09:37:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(225190, 12872, 6536, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot. Perfect stock photo. 10.</td>', 'Excellent shot. Perfect stock photo. 10.', '2003-02-27 09:40:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(225191, 13033, 6536, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot. Perfect stock photo. 10.</td>', 'Excellent shot. Perfect stock photo. 10.', '2003-02-27 09:42:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(225194, 13000, 6536, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot. Great stock photo. 10.</td>', 'Excellent shot. Great stock photo. 10.', '2003-02-27 09:49:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(225271, 13033, 1202, '<td valign="top">IMO this is a great shot, which could be used in many ways.  I only wish I could do as well. 10</td>', 'IMO this is a great shot, which could be used in many ways.  I only wish I could do as well. 10', '2003-02-27 10:41:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(225274, 13108, 1202, '<td valign="top">I can picture this on the wall of many varied businesses or learning establishments, a great job. 9</td>', 'I can picture this on the wall of many varied businesses or learning establishments, a great job. 9', '2003-02-27 10:42:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(225277, 12866, 1202, '<td valign="top">This shows the seclusion of the building, but at the same time seems too busy for extended viewing.   Technically good.  7</td>', 'This shows the seclusion of the building, but at the same time seems too busy for extended viewing.   Technically good.  7', '2003-02-27 10:44:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(225279, 12867, 1202, '<td valign="top">With the "Little League" logo in the picture it narrows the field of prospective customers.   The nice close up of the baseball is winderfull and very saleable.  7</td>', 'With the "Little League" logo in the picture it narrows the field of prospective customers.   The nice close up of the baseball is winderfull and very saleable.  7', '2003-02-27 10:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(225281, 12942, 1202, '<td valign="top">I get the feeling that the train has jumped track.   A small portion of track should be showing under the engine to show that all is okay.   A good idea but needs improvement IMO.  5</td>', 'I get the feeling that the train has jumped track.   A small portion of track should be showing under the engine to show that all is okay.   A good idea but needs improvement IMO.  5', '2003-02-27 10:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(225284, 13038, 1202, '<td valign="top">I fel that this one is just too busy.   What is the main subject?  Is it the tree, the people, the houses, or the bicycles, or even the sun?   I heard a simple picture is the hardest to take.   5</td>', 'I fel that this one is just too busy.   What is the main subject?  Is it the tree, the people, the houses, or the bicycles, or even the sun?   I heard a simple picture is the hardest to take.   5', '2003-02-27 10:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(225285, 13110, 1202, '<td valign="top">This is a nice representation of a southwest evening, but I feel that the cactus is a little overbearing.   It needs to be there but not quite so strong, at least for me.   5</td>', 'This is a nice representation of a southwest evening, but I feel that the cactus is a little overbearing.   It needs to be there but not quite so strong, at least for me.   5', '2003-02-27 10:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(225286, 12938, 1202, '<td valign="top">The window, not being the subject, jumps out at me and its misalignment is bothersome.   I think the shoes against the building are great, maybe a tighter crop on the window to eliminate the strong horizontal line at the top would improve your idea.   All of this should be done by getting close enough to frame it as close to final as possible for more clarity.  5</td>', 'The window, not being the subject, jumps out at me and its misalignment is bothersome.   I think the shoes against the building are great, maybe a tighter crop on the window to eliminate the strong horizontal line at the top would improve your idea.   All of this should be done by getting close enough to frame it as close to final as possible for more clarity.  5', '2003-02-27 10:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(225287, 13024, 1202, '<td valign="top">Your picture probably has a small audience, but those who like it will like it very much.   I hope you understand this is meant as a compliment in every way.  7</td>', 'Your picture probably has a small audience, but those who like it will like it very much.   I hope you understand this is meant as a compliment in every way.  7', '2003-02-27 11:01:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(225288, 13045, 1202, '<td valign="top">Kentucky Fried Chicken probably wouldn''t buy this but other fanciers of the foul should love it.   It is a perfect portrait both technically and compositionally. ( Is that a word?)   10</td>', 'Kentucky Fried Chicken probably wouldn''t buy this but other fanciers of the foul should love it.   It is a perfect portrait both technically and compositionally. ( Is that a word?)   10', '2003-02-27 11:04:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(225290, 13052, 3599, '<td valign="top">What a great photo.  This reminds me of one of those photos I saw in the library when I was a kid for motivation or whatever.  It meets the challenge to me.  Good work and good luck.</td>', 'What a great photo.  This reminds me of one of those photos I saw in the library when I was a kid for motivation or whatever.  It meets the challenge to me.  Good work and good luck.', '2003-02-27 11:05:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(225291, 12934, 1202, '<td valign="top">I can see this on the wall of every martial arts studio in the country.   You have caught the intensity of the training, and put it against a black wall, the color they are going for.  9</td>', 'I can see this on the wall of every martial arts studio in the country.   You have caught the intensity of the training, and put it against a black wall, the color they are going for.  9', '2003-02-27 11:07:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(225292, 13109, 1202, '<td valign="top">An interesting shot but I don''t feel that it would attract many people that would actually buy it.   There is so much controversy against the smoking industry, and you have captured the end of the pipe that causes all of the related problems......Let''s see do I want it on my wall?</td>', 'An interesting shot but I don''t feel that it would attract many people that would actually buy it.   There is so much controversy against the smoking industry, and you have captured the end of the pipe that causes all of the related problems......Let''s see do I want it on my wall?', '2003-02-27 11:11:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(225293, 12953, 1202, '<td valign="top">A technically great picture, however I feel that it would need the help of additional photos, or a series to actually sell.   I can picture various or similar pictures placed in a nursery or child care facility.   7</td>', 'A technically great picture, however I feel that it would need the help of additional photos, or a series to actually sell.   I can picture various or similar pictures placed in a nursery or child care facility.   7', '2003-02-27 11:14:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(225299, 12872, 1202, '<td valign="top">Are you trying to say it is just another Blankety-Blank glass?  It looks a little over processed and kind of grainy to me.  If it had been very sharp I could go higher but now only a 4.   In a situation like this one you have complete control of the outcome, so it should be much better.</td>', 'Are you trying to say it is just another Blankety-Blank glass?  It looks a little over processed and kind of grainy to me.  If it had been very sharp I could go higher but now only a 4.   In a situation like this one you have complete control of the outcome, so it should be much better.', '2003-02-27 11:20:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(225300, 13052, 1202, '<td valign="top">This is a great subject, but it looks like you tried to save it with the use of sepia.   Probably a little underexposed and this is as good as you could get it.   I''ll give you a 5 for all of the effort.</td>', 'This is a great subject, but it looks like you tried to save it with the use of sepia.   Probably a little underexposed and this is as good as you could get it.   I''ll give you a 5 for all of the effort.', '2003-02-27 11:22:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(225301, 13082, 1202, '<td valign="top">You have a technically great picture, but I think you need to flip it horizontally.   I do not think you could sell many pictures of the backside of the US flag.  5</td>', 'You have a technically great picture, but I think you need to flip it horizontally.   I do not think you could sell many pictures of the backside of the US flag.  5', '2003-02-27 11:24:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(225302, 12914, 1202, '<td valign="top">I miss the horizon in your picture.  I don''t know exactly what you could have done to include it but I feel it needs to be there to give your wonderful subject some much needed depth.  5</td>', 'I miss the horizon in your picture.  I don''t know exactly what you could have done to include it but I feel it needs to be there to give your wonderful subject some much needed depth.  5', '2003-02-27 11:27:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(225304, 13125, 1202, '<td valign="top">Great leading lines to the youngster''s face.  It looks a little soft on focus and I feel that with the obviously clean sheets and child that a sharp clean focus is a must.  5</td>', 'Great leading lines to the youngster''s face.  It looks a little soft on focus and I feel that with the obviously clean sheets and child that a sharp clean focus is a must.  5', '2003-02-27 11:29:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(225305, 12924, 4536, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. I think a more natural background would have been better.</td>', 'Nice shot. I think a more natural background would have been better.', '2003-02-27 11:30:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(225306, 13123, 1202, '<td valign="top">You have captured a moment in natur.   I feel that it has come across as somewhat too gloomy to hang on every wall in the country.   If it were a little brighter it would be much more appealing to me.  6</td>', 'You have captured a moment in natur.   I feel that it has come across as somewhat too gloomy to hang on every wall in the country.   If it were a little brighter it would be much more appealing to me.  6', '2003-02-27 11:32:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(225307, 13092, 4536, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and subject. The horizon ia a tad tilted and I wish the sky was not so washed out.</td>', 'Nice composition and subject. The horizon ia a tad tilted and I wish the sky was not so washed out.', '2003-02-27 11:33:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(225308, 13089, 1202, '<td valign="top">Oh Yes! This has impact. 10</td>', 'Oh Yes! This has impact. 10', '2003-02-27 11:34:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(225309, 12888, 1202, '<td valign="top">I wish this were my entry!   Super job and yet so simple. 10</td>', 'I wish this were my entry!   Super job and yet so simple. 10', '2003-02-27 11:35:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(225310, 13061, 4536, '<td valign="top">Wow, that''s a lot of snow. Needs a bit more contrast, the whites aren''t quite white and the blacks aren''t quite black.</td>', 'Wow, that''s a lot of snow. Needs a bit more contrast, the whites aren''t quite white and the blacks aren''t quite black.', '2003-02-27 11:35:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(225313, 12872, 4536, '<td valign="top">Good job, like the lighting. The jagged compression lines are distracting, also the stem of the glass is not quite straight. Still could surely see this as a stock shot. Great title too!</td>', 'Good job, like the lighting. The jagged compression lines are distracting, also the stem of the glass is not quite straight. Still could surely see this as a stock shot. Great title too!', '2003-02-27 11:42:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(225315, 12858, 1202, '<td valign="top">You have chose a difficult subject.   The fact that it is small and that it is made of hard, highly reflective plastic, your difficulty factor climbs at an alarming rate.   Next time try to use indirect natural light or diffuse your flash by placing some tissue in front of it.  Remember you are in control of the situation and you must be patient enough to be completely satisfied with the outcome.   Were you?   5</td>', 'You have chose a difficult subject.   The fact that it is small and that it is made of hard, highly reflective plastic, your difficulty factor climbs at an alarming rate.   Next time try to use indirect natural light or diffuse your flash by placing some tissue in front of it.  Remember you are in control of the situation and you must be patient enough to be completely satisfied with the outcome.   Were you?   5', '2003-02-27 11:44:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(225318, 12987, 1202, '<td valign="top">You have a wonderful subject, and it looks as though she wants you to get a great picture also.   I think it is a little flat and could have the contrast bumped up a bit, but the worst problem is your light.   The blaring light from the window shades is very distracting, you might have hung a white sheet over the to diffuse the light to give you a much better result.   6</td>', 'You have a wonderful subject, and it looks as though she wants you to get a great picture also.   I think it is a little flat and could have the contrast bumped up a bit, but the worst problem is your light.   The blaring light from the window shades is very distracting, you might have hung a white sheet over the to diffuse the light to give you a much better result.   6', '2003-02-27 11:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(225320, 12924, 1202, '<td valign="top">The overly bright background has made it difficult for proper exposure of the front side of your hawk.  If it was possible I think you should have taken more shots with varied exposure values to get the feathers to come to life.  I also think a tighter crop would have improved an otherwise great shot.</td>', 'The overly bright background has made it difficult for proper exposure of the front side of your hawk.  If it was possible I think you should have taken more shots with varied exposure values to get the feathers to come to life.  I also think a tighter crop would have improved an otherwise great shot.', '2003-02-27 11:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(225321, 12972, 1202, '<td valign="top">Superb close up!   I think it might be a little too bold for most walls, but there are many great places for it.   Technically perfect.   10</td>', 'Superb close up!   I think it might be a little too bold for most walls, but there are many great places for it.   Technically perfect.   10', '2003-02-27 11:55:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(225323, 13122, 1202, '<td valign="top">IMO this is more photo-journalism than stock.   I look at it and think wow they had a lot of snow!, but I don''t reach in my pocket to get the cash so I can take it to my office or living room.   6</td>', 'IMO this is more photo-journalism than stock.   I look at it and think wow they had a lot of snow!, but I don''t reach in my pocket to get the cash so I can take it to my office or living room.   6', '2003-02-27 11:58:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(225326, 12849, 1202, '<td valign="top">IMO this is a great picture to have included in a gallery of your work, but it is not a stand alone kind of shot that I would buy to put on display.   6</td>', 'IMO this is a great picture to have included in a gallery of your work, but it is not a stand alone kind of shot that I would buy to put on display.   6', '2003-02-27 12:01:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(225327, 13025, 4536, '<td valign="top">I can relate:). There is some noise, Neat Image would help clean this up. Also seems a bit grey, increasing the contrast would improve this shot. Nice composition.</td>', 'I can relate:). There is some noise, Neat Image would help clean this up. Also seems a bit grey, increasing the contrast would improve this shot. Nice composition.', '2003-02-27 12:03:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(225334, 13108, 1041, '<td valign="top">I can see this being used in an article with text overlayed on the black background, so the challenge is definitely met.  I like the nice even black background and the warm colors of your globe.  Focus is good, too, although I could see this cropped a little more at the bottom and left, because rather than Texas, I''m more drawn to the yellow corner with the large writing (part of which denotes cities in Texas, I know).  That''s where the eye usually wanders in a photo, the lighter places.  Overall, a good submission.  :)</td>', 'I can see this being used in an article with text overlayed on the black background, so the challenge is definitely met.  I like the nice even black background and the warm colors of your globe.  Focus is good, too, although I could see this cropped a little more at the bottom and left, because rather than Texas, I''m more drawn to the yellow corner with the large writing (part of which denotes cities in Texas, I know).  That''s where the eye usually wanders in a photo, the lighter places.  Overall, a good submission.  :)', '2003-02-27 12:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(225349, 12978, 811, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition of this.  The stem leads into the picture, adn the detail you have captured is wonderful.</td>', 'I really like the composition of this.  The stem leads into the picture, adn the detail you have captured is wonderful.', '2003-02-27 13:31:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(225351, 13098, 811, '<td valign="top">Great work.  Setting it on an angle like that really makes it better than if it were horizontal, i think.</td>', 'Great work.  Setting it on an angle like that really makes it better than if it were horizontal, i think.', '2003-02-27 13:33:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(225352, 13059, 811, '<td valign="top">I really like the contrasts between the blue sky adn white castle here . Good work.</td>', 'I really like the contrasts between the blue sky adn white castle here . Good work.', '2003-02-27 13:34:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(225353, 12987, 811, '<td valign="top">A wonderful shot, and she has such a pleasant expression on her face.  I like the pattern of the light (sun?) on her hair.</td>', 'A wonderful shot, and she has such a pleasant expression on her face.  I like the pattern of the light (sun?) on her hair.', '2003-02-27 13:35:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(225357, 13052, 2553, '<td valign="top">I just love this shot!  I would like to have seen light fill in some of the shadows, especially on the little kitty, but overall the photo really appeals to me.</td>', 'I just love this shot!  I would like to have seen light fill in some of the shadows, especially on the little kitty, but overall the photo really appeals to me.', '2003-02-27 13:50:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(225360, 13087, 2553, '<td valign="top">Stunning shot.  Incredibly sharp and clear, and the repetition of patterns is just remarkable.  Your lighting was great that day as well!  Beautiful work!</td>', 'Stunning shot.  Incredibly sharp and clear, and the repetition of patterns is just remarkable.  Your lighting was great that day as well!  Beautiful work!', '2003-02-27 13:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(225361, 12849, 2553, '<td valign="top">One of my absolute favorites!  I love trees so much, and this shot has such a lovely moody feel to it.</td>', 'One of my absolute favorites!  I love trees so much, and this shot has such a lovely moody feel to it.', '2003-02-27 13:53:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(225362, 12882, 2553, '<td valign="top">The colors of your shot are what really did it for me!  Beautifully composed, and the lighting is wonderful.  Terrific!  One of my few 10''s.</td>', 'The colors of your shot are what really did it for me!  Beautifully composed, and the lighting is wonderful.  Terrific!  One of my few 10''s.', '2003-02-27 13:54:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(225363, 12863, 2553, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful!  Wish I was able to see just a tiny bit more of the tree, but overall, definitely one of my favorites.</td>', 'Very beautiful!  Wish I was able to see just a tiny bit more of the tree, but overall, definitely one of my favorites.', '2003-02-27 13:55:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(225365, 12987, 2553, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Absolutely wonderful!  Love the lighting, the composition, and the general simplicity of the shot.  Nice work.</td>', 'Wow!  Absolutely wonderful!  Love the lighting, the composition, and the general simplicity of the shot.  Nice work.', '2003-02-27 13:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(225366, 13082, 2553, '<td valign="top">Stunning shot of the flag.  I really love it.  You see lots of photos of flags these days, but this composition is one of the best I''ve seen.  Nice clear, sharply focused shot, with great color.</td>', 'Stunning shot of the flag.  I really love it.  You see lots of photos of flags these days, but this composition is one of the best I''ve seen.  Nice clear, sharply focused shot, with great color.', '2003-02-27 13:58:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(225367, 13093, 2553, '<td valign="top">I love the the composition in general, but especially the way the church is framed by the branch of the tree.  Love the black and white.  Would love to have seen a little more light on the church building, but even as it is, it''s a wonderful shot.</td>', 'I love the the composition in general, but especially the way the church is framed by the branch of the tree.  Love the black and white.  Would love to have seen a little more light on the church building, but even as it is, it''s a wonderful shot.', '2003-02-27 14:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(225370, 13071, 2553, '<td valign="top">Really like the border!  I would like to have seen a little more light on the pine cones, but that doesn''t bother me a whole lot.   Very nice shot!</td>', 'Really like the border!  I would like to have seen a little more light on the pine cones, but that doesn''t bother me a whole lot.   Very nice shot!', '2003-02-27 14:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(225372, 12988, 2553, '<td valign="top">Very intriguing shot !  Love the soft color, and the composition.</td>', 'Very intriguing shot !  Love the soft color, and the composition.', '2003-02-27 14:03:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(225374, 13105, 2553, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, I can definitely see this being used for some type of ad.  Love the border- how did you do it????</td>', 'Interesting shot, I can definitely see this being used for some type of ad.  Love the border- how did you do it????', '2003-02-27 14:05:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(225378, 13043, 2553, '<td valign="top">I like the sepia tone.  The harsh shadow on the lower left side of the globe kind of distracts me a little.  Not crazy about the composition, though I honestly couldn''t say how I might have done it differently - it just feels..."odd", to me.</td>', 'I like the sepia tone.  The harsh shadow on the lower left side of the globe kind of distracts me a little.  Not crazy about the composition, though I honestly couldn''t say how I might have done it differently - it just feels..."odd", to me.', '2003-02-27 14:08:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(225379, 12927, 2553, '<td valign="top">OK, how did you get THIS close, and get THAT good of DOF??  I HAVE to know!  Very nice shot, the color is great, and I like the composition.</td>', 'OK, how did you get THIS close, and get THAT good of DOF??  I HAVE to know!  Very nice shot, the color is great, and I like the composition.', '2003-02-27 14:09:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(225380, 13033, 2553, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool shot, I love the colors.  Like the composition as well.</td>', 'Pretty cool shot, I love the colors.  Like the composition as well.', '2003-02-27 14:10:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(225385, 12880, 2553, '<td valign="top">The shot seems a little cluttered to me, with the "logs" in the foreground, and the fourth elk in the background - yeah, I know, nothing much you can do about it on dpc, it''s just my observation!  The shot also seems dark to me-(my monitor is calibrated), I would like to see it brightened up some.</td>', 'The shot seems a little cluttered to me, with the "logs" in the foreground, and the fourth elk in the background - yeah, I know, nothing much you can do about it on dpc, it''s just my observation!  The shot also seems dark to me-(my monitor is calibrated), I would like to see it brightened up some.', '2003-02-27 14:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(225387, 12863, 4536, '<td valign="top">This is very nice. I think a lower angle would have improved the composition a bit, showing a silhouette of the tree more and getting rid of the wasted space at the bottom.</td>', 'This is very nice. I think a lower angle would have improved the composition a bit, showing a silhouette of the tree more and getting rid of the wasted space at the bottom.', '2003-02-27 14:14:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(225466, 13015, 6696, '<td valign="top">I realy like the color balance in this shot.  The pink/white sky balances out the darker portions well.  Well done.</td>', 'I realy like the color balance in this shot.  The pink/white sky balances out the darker portions well.  Well done.', '2003-02-27 15:00:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(225468, 13054, 6696, '<td valign="top">Wow - an absolutely enchanting capture.</td>', 'Wow - an absolutely enchanting capture.', '2003-02-27 15:01:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(225470, 13110, 6696, '<td valign="top">Very stunning.  I love the way the cactus frames the sun.</td>', 'Very stunning.  I love the way the cactus frames the sun.', '2003-02-27 15:02:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(225471, 12914, 6696, '<td valign="top">What great subject matter.  The views from that porch must be stunning.</td>', 'What great subject matter.  The views from that porch must be stunning.', '2003-02-27 15:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(225472, 13117, 6696, '<td valign="top">The clouds in this picture appear to "pop" off the sky.  The blue-green water is also nice.  Good job.</td>', 'The clouds in this picture appear to "pop" off the sky.  The blue-green water is also nice.  Good job.', '2003-02-27 15:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(225474, 13082, 6696, '<td valign="top">Nice crisp and clean look.  Too bad the stars don''t appear white.</td>', 'Nice crisp and clean look.  Too bad the stars don''t appear white.', '2003-02-27 15:09:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(225475, 12854, 6696, '<td valign="top">I''m not so sure about the yellow background, but the shot is really attractive.  Definately stock.</td>', 'I''m not so sure about the yellow background, but the shot is really attractive.  Definately stock.', '2003-02-27 15:11:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(225480, 12940, 1202, '<td valign="top">As unusual as the burst of light is I feel it dosn''t help the picture.   The light bouncing around in the lens also degrades your well composed exposed sunset.   Of course this is all just my opinion and you may have an entirely different point of view.  6</td>', 'As unusual as the burst of light is I feel it dosn''t help the picture.   The light bouncing around in the lens also degrades your well composed exposed sunset.   Of course this is all just my opinion and you may have an entirely different point of view.  6', '2003-02-27 15:25:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(225483, 13071, 1202, '<td valign="top">IMO your picture is quite busy and the main subject is under exposed.   I would like to see more detail of the cones and not have the sky blaring at the viewer.   A difficult task to correct but maybe you could have achieved about the same effect by taking the picture with the sun behind you instead of the subject.  5</td>', 'IMO your picture is quite busy and the main subject is under exposed.   I would like to see more detail of the cones and not have the sky blaring at the viewer.   A difficult task to correct but maybe you could have achieved about the same effect by taking the picture with the sun behind you instead of the subject.  5', '2003-02-27 15:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(225492, 12976, 1041, '<td valign="top">Wow, that rainbow looks pretty low.  Are you rather high up or was it really that low?  It''s a very dark photo for a rainbow shot, but, who knows, for the right article or something this might be just what they need.  I can''t make up my mind if the horizon (grass) is a little tilted or not, so if it is, it''s just a tiny bit.  Other than that, technically a nice photo.</td>', 'Wow, that rainbow looks pretty low.  Are you rather high up or was it really that low?  It''s a very dark photo for a rainbow shot, but, who knows, for the right article or something this might be just what they need.  I can''t make up my mind if the horizon (grass) is a little tilted or not, so if it is, it''s just a tiny bit.  Other than that, technically a nice photo.', '2003-02-27 15:36:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(225553, 13105, 1202, '<td valign="top">This picture sure could be used in an add but it kind of needs thtext of the add tommake it say anything.   It is kind of empty on its own merits.  With your border I expect the soft focus is intentional.   I think sharper image would be nice too.  6</td>', 'This picture sure could be used in an add but it kind of needs thtext of the add tommake it say anything.   It is kind of empty on its own merits.  With your border I expect the soft focus is intentional.   I think sharper image would be nice too.  6', '2003-02-27 17:33:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(225557, 12958, 1202, '<td valign="top">nice close up but it seems as though a lot of detail is lost in the shadows.   Only the single raspberry goes WOW for me and it can''t cerry the complete picture.  The remainder does not help it out of course this inly IMO.  7</td>', 'nice close up but it seems as though a lot of detail is lost in the shadows.   Only the single raspberry goes WOW for me and it can''t cerry the complete picture.  The remainder does not help it out of course this inly IMO.  7', '2003-02-27 17:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(225562, 12854, 1202, '<td valign="top">Nice macro, and I like the complimentary background.  I think it would have been better if the cord trailed out of the upper right corner, as it seems to reverse my line of sight, and for no reason.   7</td>', 'Nice macro, and I like the complimentary background.  I think it would have been better if the cord trailed out of the upper right corner, as it seems to reverse my line of sight, and for no reason.   7', '2003-02-27 17:38:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(225564, 12971, 1202, '<td valign="top">Difinately a clean shot, that would be appealoing to many audiences.   I can''t find anything to suggest for imorovement.   One of my rare 10''s.</td>', 'Difinately a clean shot, that would be appealoing to many audiences.   I can''t find anything to suggest for imorovement.   One of my rare 10''s.', '2003-02-27 17:40:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(225567, 12880, 1202, '<td valign="top">You have a nice close up of these elk but it lacks contrast and detail in the elks head.   Would the horse drawn item have helped your picture if it had been included?   It looks as though you might have been able to reposition for a more interesting shot.   5</td>', 'You have a nice close up of these elk but it lacks contrast and detail in the elks head.   Would the horse drawn item have helped your picture if it had been included?   It looks as though you might have been able to reposition for a more interesting shot.   5', '2003-02-27 17:43:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(225569, 13061, 1202, '<td valign="top">I feel this picture falls under the photo journalism end of things more than something that you could get the whole country to buy.   just my opinion!  5</td>', 'I feel this picture falls under the photo journalism end of things more than something that you could get the whole country to buy.   just my opinion!  5', '2003-02-27 17:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(225576, 13021, 6855, '<td valign="top">This is definitely stock photography, but it doesn''t look like alot of thought or planning went into it. I''m not being negative, it just seems a little too simple.  Just a thought, still a good photo.</td>', 'This is definitely stock photography, but it doesn''t look like alot of thought or planning went into it. I''m not being negative, it just seems a little too simple.  Just a thought, still a good photo.', '2003-02-27 18:00:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(225577, 13052, 6855, '<td valign="top">Very sweet and I love the lighting!</td>', 'Very sweet and I love the lighting!', '2003-02-27 18:00:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(225580, 13084, 6855, '<td valign="top">Very original and a great shot...reminds me of the "good ol days".. I loved it.</td>', 'Very original and a great shot...reminds me of the "good ol days".. I loved it.', '2003-02-27 18:01:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(225581, 13005, 6855, '<td valign="top">VERY cool picture and so patriotic right now.  Seems just a little candid, but I like it still the same.</td>', 'VERY cool picture and so patriotic right now.  Seems just a little candid, but I like it still the same.', '2003-02-27 18:02:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(225583, 12850, 6855, '<td valign="top">I really love this whoe shot - it has a lot of "feeling" yet leaves plenty of room for text or advertising.  One of my favorites - excellent job!</td>', 'I really love this whoe shot - it has a lot of "feeling" yet leaves plenty of room for text or advertising.  One of my favorites - excellent job!', '2003-02-27 18:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(225585, 12927, 6855, '<td valign="top">This is a really fascinating shot!  The center of the corn doesn''t look too tasty, I might have stuck with just the kernals, but it is a very cool shot with excellent lighting still!</td>', 'This is a really fascinating shot!  The center of the corn doesn''t look too tasty, I might have stuck with just the kernals, but it is a very cool shot with excellent lighting still!', '2003-02-27 18:05:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(225587, 13099, 6855, '<td valign="top">I love the red!  This looks like a menu cover through and through. Great shot!</td>', 'I love the red!  This looks like a menu cover through and through. Great shot!', '2003-02-27 18:05:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(225626, 13096, 1202, '<td valign="top">You have a very interesting and colorful picture.   I feel that it is marketable in the designer.architectural world.  Well done.  8</td>', 'You have a very interesting and colorful picture.   I feel that it is marketable in the designer.architectural world.  Well done.  8', '2003-02-27 18:59:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(225630, 13092, 1202, '<td valign="top">You were obviously in a great place to get this photo.   IMO it leaves me without getting any bang for my buck.   I suggest that you try from a better vantage point so you can include some close subject material or try to include some shapes that will lead you into the picture.    6</td>', 'You were obviously in a great place to get this photo.   IMO it leaves me without getting any bang for my buck.   I suggest that you try from a better vantage point so you can include some close subject material or try to include some shapes that will lead you into the picture.    6', '2003-02-27 19:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(225636, 13098, 1202, '<td valign="top">You have a nice idea like for an ad or similar purpose.   You have left some shadows that tell me it should be setting on a horizontal surface and not canted.   What is the dark area in the upper right corner?   IMO these things should be cleared up if you intend to sell.  6</td>', 'You have a nice idea like for an ad or similar purpose.   You have left some shadows that tell me it should be setting on a horizontal surface and not canted.   What is the dark area in the upper right corner?   IMO these things should be cleared up if you intend to sell.  6', '2003-02-27 19:07:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(225639, 12869, 1202, '<td valign="top">You have obviously put a lot of effort into this picture.   It is a set up shot so you were in control of the results.   I ask some questions, why are the balls placed as they are? Why did you make the DOF so shallow?   What does the blue light add to your picture?  Do you like the flash back on the left and the right balls?   If you intended for these things to be a part of the picture, you did a great job, if not, just think about them next time.  5</td>', 'You have obviously put a lot of effort into this picture.   It is a set up shot so you were in control of the results.   I ask some questions, why are the balls placed as they are? Why did you make the DOF so shallow?   What does the blue light add to your picture?  Do you like the flash back on the left and the right balls?   If you intended for these things to be a part of the picture, you did a great job, if not, just think about them next time.  5', '2003-02-27 19:13:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(225640, 13015, 1202, '<td valign="top">I would be ready to buy this one if it were not so damp and cold.   That is what it is saying to me, maybe if you had waited a few seconds more the sun would have warmed it up a bit, and added more color to the clouds.   At least that would make your picture for me.   7</td>', 'I would be ready to buy this one if it were not so damp and cold.   That is what it is saying to me, maybe if you had waited a few seconds more the sun would have warmed it up a bit, and added more color to the clouds.   At least that would make your picture for me.   7', '2003-02-27 19:16:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(225642, 13086, 1202, '<td valign="top">The tilt you gave the picture adds to the interest, but the lines in the foreground subtract from it.   I guess it is hard to win sometimes...6</td>', 'The tilt you gave the picture adds to the interest, but the lines in the foreground subtract from it.   I guess it is hard to win sometimes...6', '2003-02-27 19:18:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(225644, 12835, 1202, '<td valign="top">Is that a fly reel in the background?  IMO it does not add anything to your picture, it is too blurred to be recognizable and too prominent to go un-noticed.  IMO you might have used a simple black background or similar type.   A technically perfect fly though.   8</td>', 'Is that a fly reel in the background?  IMO it does not add anything to your picture, it is too blurred to be recognizable and too prominent to go un-noticed.  IMO you might have used a simple black background or similar type.   A technically perfect fly though.   8', '2003-02-27 19:21:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(225645, 12904, 1202, '<td valign="top">This is a nice pose and a picture filled with interest.   I wonder, what is she thinking/reding, or what.   Questions are good.   You are very near to underexposed IMO but it doesn''t hurt the effect of your shot.   I think I would have cropped it to get rid of the thingy in her hair at the top of your frame.   7</td>', 'This is a nice pose and a picture filled with interest.   I wonder, what is she thinking/reding, or what.   Questions are good.   You are very near to underexposed IMO but it doesn''t hurt the effect of your shot.   I think I would have cropped it to get rid of the thingy in her hair at the top of your frame.   7', '2003-02-27 19:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(225647, 12915, 1202, '<td valign="top">I can tell you are not trying to promote your neighborhood with this picture.   It is a great shot but it portrays a bleak, cold environment.I know that not all pictures are happy but ask yourself, how many cold or sad pictures would I hang in the living room?   Do this over when there is a bright orange sinrise/set behind the old barn.   6</td>', 'I can tell you are not trying to promote your neighborhood with this picture.   It is a great shot but it portrays a bleak, cold environment.I know that not all pictures are happy but ask yourself, how many cold or sad pictures would I hang in the living room?   Do this over when there is a bright orange sinrise/set behind the old barn.   6', '2003-02-27 19:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(225649, 12928, 1202, '<td valign="top">This is a great macro of the 5,3 and 7 buttons.   I guess you already knew that.   I don''t know the significance of the number, but to those that do I hope you sell a million or so prints.   5</td>', 'This is a great macro of the 5,3 and 7 buttons.   I guess you already knew that.   I don''t know the significance of the number, but to those that do I hope you sell a million or so prints.   5', '2003-02-27 19:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(225650, 13117, 1202, '<td valign="top">A wonderful sky and marina. I feel that it could have been much better if you could have placed a boat or other nautical item in the foreground and had the rest of the picture beyond it.   This would add character and interest to the overall picture.   Did you use a polarizing filter on this?   If so great resullts in the sky.   7</td>', 'A wonderful sky and marina. I feel that it could have been much better if you could have placed a boat or other nautical item in the foreground and had the rest of the picture beyond it.   This would add character and interest to the overall picture.   Did you use a polarizing filter on this?   If so great resullts in the sky.   7', '2003-02-27 19:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(225651, 13041, 1202, '<td valign="top">Dead on ficus and exposure.   Lighting is super.   Yep its good. 9</td>', 'Dead on ficus and exposure.   Lighting is super.   Yep its good. 9', '2003-02-27 19:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(225667, 13123, 806, '<td valign="top">Isn''t that beautiful! Well done!</td>', 'Isn''t that beautiful! Well done!', '2003-02-27 20:52:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(225673, 12849, 806, '<td valign="top">this is fantastic! the hues of bluish grey help the mood of inpending storm, with the limbs of the tree is such contrast against the sky, yet reminiscent of nerves. Very cool!</td>', 'this is fantastic! the hues of bluish grey help the mood of inpending storm, with the limbs of the tree is such contrast against the sky, yet reminiscent of nerves. Very cool!', '2003-02-27 20:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(225674, 13010, 806, '<td valign="top">great angle.. great time of day for lighting, great framing... awesome title.</td>', 'great angle.. great time of day for lighting, great framing... awesome title.', '2003-02-27 21:02:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(225678, 12914, 3575, '<td valign="top">This is a gorgeous photo. I love the detail and the lighting. My vavorite part is the little sun porch, can you imagine sitting out there? It doesn''t look very stable. I think it''s cropped just a little close on the right but nevertheless, it''s a very nice photo.</td>', 'This is a gorgeous photo. I love the detail and the lighting. My vavorite part is the little sun porch, can you imagine sitting out there? It doesn''t look very stable. I think it''s cropped just a little close on the right but nevertheless, it''s a very nice photo.', '2003-02-27 21:08:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(225700, 13096, 4162, '<td valign="top">I really like the simplicity of this, lovely contrast in shapes and great use of shadows.  Great shot!</td>', 'I really like the simplicity of this, lovely contrast in shapes and great use of shadows.  Great shot!', '2003-02-27 21:44:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(225704, 12972, 4162, '<td valign="top">Wow! Focus is spot on, very sharp. detail in the eyes is fantastic. Great shot!</td>', 'Wow! Focus is spot on, very sharp. detail in the eyes is fantastic. Great shot!', '2003-02-27 21:50:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(225752, 12862, 6855, '<td valign="top">Very unique. I would LOVE to know how you did this when the challenge is over!</td>', 'Very unique. I would LOVE to know how you did this when the challenge is over!', '2003-02-27 22:38:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(225772, 13105, 3540, '<td valign="top">Please don''t take this the wrong way, but she looks like she has one big eyebrow that goes from one pupil to the other.  Its too soft, plus the hair is in focus.</td>', 'Please don''t take this the wrong way, but she looks like she has one big eyebrow that goes from one pupil to the other.  Its too soft, plus the hair is in focus.', '2003-02-27 23:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(225913, 12835, 1826, '<td valign="top">The inclusion of the reel in the backround adds some authenticity. Nice work.</td>', 'The inclusion of the reel in the backround adds some authenticity. Nice work.', '2003-02-28 10:02:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(225919, 13005, 1202, '<td valign="top">I think of action photos when I think of the military.  If you were to try to sell, something of significant interest must be in the picture.   Does your picture show an item of high interest?   4</td>', 'I think of action photos when I think of the military.  If you were to try to sell, something of significant interest must be in the picture.   Does your picture show an item of high interest?   4', '2003-02-28 10:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(225920, 12909, 1202, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful old barn that reminds me of the movie "Witness"   However the barn by itself does not keep my interest.  I suppose it could be shown with a group of other interesting barns on the wall of an office, but as a stand alone picture it is weak.  5</td>', 'This is a wonderful old barn that reminds me of the movie "Witness"   However the barn by itself does not keep my interest.  I suppose it could be shown with a group of other interesting barns on the wall of an office, but as a stand alone picture it is weak.  5', '2003-02-28 10:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(225921, 12922, 1202, '<td valign="top">An interesting picture with tourism written all over it.   The heavy shadows block out the detail of the front of the old building.   I think you should try a different angle or time of day to carture the real beauty and interest of this great subject.   6</td>', 'An interesting picture with tourism written all over it.   The heavy shadows block out the detail of the front of the old building.   I think you should try a different angle or time of day to carture the real beauty and interest of this great subject.   6', '2003-02-28 10:29:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(225922, 13082, 4207, '<td valign="top">Fantastic composition and incredible colors. I''d be very intrested in the processing you used to enhance this image.</td>', 'Fantastic composition and incredible colors. I''d be very intrested in the processing you used to enhance this image.', '2003-02-28 10:30:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(225924, 12998, 1202, '<td valign="top">A nice colorful macro but it is just another picture of a bunch of jelly beans.   IMO the interest factor is a little on the low side here, it is a set up shot and remember you are in command, so let your imagination flow and try to do something that will make it stand out from like pictures.   The washed out spots could be corrected by using indirect  or diffused lighting.   Try some tissue in front of your flash so the true color will come out.   6</td>', 'A nice colorful macro but it is just another picture of a bunch of jelly beans.   IMO the interest factor is a little on the low side here, it is a set up shot and remember you are in command, so let your imagination flow and try to do something that will make it stand out from like pictures.   The washed out spots could be corrected by using indirect  or diffused lighting.   Try some tissue in front of your flash so the true color will come out.   6', '2003-02-28 10:34:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(225927, 12980, 1202, '<td valign="top">I have looked at this one three times and still have a hard time making the rather plain shutters interesting enough.   Possibly if part of the architecture were included in the picture the viewer could see what the photographer saw when the picture was taken.   As it is it does not POP for me.   4</td>', 'I have looked at this one three times and still have a hard time making the rather plain shutters interesting enough.   Possibly if part of the architecture were included in the picture the viewer could see what the photographer saw when the picture was taken.   As it is it does not POP for me.   4', '2003-02-28 10:37:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(225928, 13099, 1202, '<td valign="top">you have an interesting photo here.   I feel thet the diagonal line of the tines lead me out of the picture with the placement of the fork.   It may have a place somewhere, like in a restaurant or inn.   6</td>', 'you have an interesting photo here.   I feel thet the diagonal line of the tines lead me out of the picture with the placement of the fork.   It may have a place somewhere, like in a restaurant or inn.   6', '2003-02-28 10:41:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(225931, 12812, 1202, '<td valign="top">This artistic photo is enhanced by the white line in your frame.  I feel that the background is a little overbearing, and I don''t like the shadow.   Not a bad job though.   5</td>', 'This artistic photo is enhanced by the white line in your frame.  I feel that the background is a little overbearing, and I don''t like the shadow.   Not a bad job though.   5', '2003-02-28 10:44:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(225934, 13093, 1202, '<td valign="top">Every one has got to love an old school house.   As I look at this picture the shadows and the dark side of the house distract from the picture.   It looks to me that the porch which is the best part of the picture could have been used to make a much stronger shot.   Maybe you could have incorporated the shadows of the porch on the front wall and the architecture of the porch into a very interestin piece of work.   6</td>', 'Every one has got to love an old school house.   As I look at this picture the shadows and the dark side of the house distract from the picture.   It looks to me that the porch which is the best part of the picture could have been used to make a much stronger shot.   Maybe you could have incorporated the shadows of the porch on the front wall and the architecture of the porch into a very interestin piece of work.   6', '2003-02-28 10:50:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(225935, 12863, 1202, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot, I think I like it more without the blown out sun.   The wonderful old oak tree needs to be the main topic.   I say that because of the near perfect simitry of the tree''s bare limbs against the orange sky.   The sun draws me away from the tree and then burns me.   7</td>', 'This is a great shot, I think I like it more without the blown out sun.   The wonderful old oak tree needs to be the main topic.   I say that because of the near perfect simitry of the tree''s bare limbs against the orange sky.   The sun draws me away from the tree and then burns me.   7', '2003-02-28 10:55:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(225937, 13054, 1202, '<td valign="top">You got a lot going on here, maybe too much.   It is a wonderful setting, I hope you have a bunch of different angles of it.   Good technically.   6</td>', 'You got a lot going on here, maybe too much.   It is a wonderful setting, I hope you have a bunch of different angles of it.   Good technically.   6', '2003-02-28 10:57:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(225939, 13000, 1202, '<td valign="top">I like the bright spots on this one, it helps show the stark presents of the chain.   It looks to me that your focus is a little soft for the effect you were trying to get.   7</td>', 'I like the bright spots on this one, it helps show the stark presents of the chain.   It looks to me that your focus is a little soft for the effect you were trying to get.   7', '2003-02-28 11:03:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(225941, 12978, 1202, '<td valign="top">Great shot of a popular subject.   Both in the flower and the water drops.   I like the close crop and the complimentary frame.   A shot like this has to be sharp and the colors true, and you are dead on.   10</td>', 'Great shot of a popular subject.   Both in the flower and the water drops.   I like the close crop and the complimentary frame.   A shot like this has to be sharp and the colors true, and you are dead on.   10', '2003-02-28 11:06:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(225944, 13018, 1202, '<td valign="top">They still got phones like that?   An interesting shot but I keep asking myself, where would a person display a shot like yours?   Who would buy it?  I feel the market would be small but if a chain store wanted it you could make a bundle.   5</td>', 'They still got phones like that?   An interesting shot but I keep asking myself, where would a person display a shot like yours?   Who would buy it?  I feel the market would be small but if a chain store wanted it you could make a bundle.   5', '2003-02-28 11:10:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(225948, 13112, 1202, '<td valign="top">I love our flag too, but IMO there needs to be more in your picture.   It just sticks out from the pole and has little interest.   Maybe if you had positioned yourself to get some depth or perspective in the shot it would have made it stronger.   4</td>', 'I love our flag too, but IMO there needs to be more in your picture.   It just sticks out from the pole and has little interest.   Maybe if you had positioned yourself to get some depth or perspective in the shot it would have made it stronger.   4', '2003-02-28 11:18:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(225953, 13021, 1202, '<td valign="top">Office Max here we come.   I see that your shot must have been directed to the advertisement sector, and I am sure there would be some industry that might be interested.   It is however kind of stark and low on the interest factor.  5</td>', 'Office Max here we come.   I see that your shot must have been directed to the advertisement sector, and I am sure there would be some industry that might be interested.   It is however kind of stark and low on the interest factor.  5', '2003-02-28 11:21:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(225955, 12976, 1202, '<td valign="top">You gotta chatch a rainbow when you can, and this you did.   IMO it is too bad mother nature was so stingy with color in the sky.   The storm clouds give your picture a gloomy feel and I think to sell it would need more POP.   The partial buildings on the left don''t help either.   5</td>', 'You gotta chatch a rainbow when you can, and this you did.   IMO it is too bad mother nature was so stingy with color in the sky.   The storm clouds give your picture a gloomy feel and I think to sell it would need more POP.   The partial buildings on the left don''t help either.   5', '2003-02-28 11:25:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(225967, 13068, 1202, '<td valign="top">Good use of diagonal lines and colorss.   a simple but effective picture, the only thing that bothers me are the heavy shadows beyond the pens.   8</td>', 'Good use of diagonal lines and colorss.   a simple but effective picture, the only thing that bothers me are the heavy shadows beyond the pens.   8', '2003-02-28 12:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(225969, 13062, 1202, '<td valign="top">Yours is a picture of great interest.   I like the colors and perfect focus.   The overhead composition really works here, excellent.  10</td>', 'Yours is a picture of great interest.   I like the colors and perfect focus.   The overhead composition really works here, excellent.  10', '2003-02-28 12:17:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(226036, 13096, 1280, '<td valign="top">I like this unusual image VERY much.  The coloring is rich and vibrant, the orchid is beautiful, and the lamp and shadow go so well.  Very, very nice. 10!</td>', 'I like this unusual image VERY much.  The coloring is rich and vibrant, the orchid is beautiful, and the lamp and shadow go so well.  Very, very nice. 10!', '2003-02-28 15:35:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(226038, 12850, 1280, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and wonderful clouds!</td>', 'Nice composition and wonderful clouds!', '2003-02-28 15:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(226040, 12872, 5223, '<td valign="top">Well done I love the light</td>', 'Well done I love the light', '2003-02-28 15:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(226049, 13099, 1280, '<td valign="top">I like it.  Simple, strong, good diagonals, bold color.</td>', 'I like it.  Simple, strong, good diagonals, bold color.', '2003-02-28 16:00:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(226059, 12922, 1280, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see this without the shadow in the front.</td>', 'I''d like to see this without the shadow in the front.', '2003-02-28 16:11:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(226104, 13052, 1005, '<td valign="top">Ahhh, very cute!  Interesting ears and tail.  Seems a little too young to be weened, did you get the "parents" permission for this photo (child protection laws...joke!)  The spotlight on the background might be a little too strong, but the foreground is very, very nice.  Good detail.  8 Swash</td>', 'Ahhh, very cute!  Interesting ears and tail.  Seems a little too young to be weened, did you get the "parents" permission for this photo (child protection laws...joke!)  The spotlight on the background might be a little too strong, but the foreground is very, very nice.  Good detail.  8 Swash', '2003-02-28 19:12:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(226110, 13108, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very well taken shot.  Extremely clear.  Color seems about right.  Framing works very well for me.  Nice use of negative space.  Not certain about the number of applications for this stock, but I won''t quibble.  9 Swash</td>', 'Very well taken shot.  Extremely clear.  Color seems about right.  Framing works very well for me.  Nice use of negative space.  Not certain about the number of applications for this stock, but I won''t quibble.  9 Swash', '2003-02-28 19:21:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(226113, 12880, 1005, '<td valign="top">I think cropping the trailer houses might have been a good idea that Ansel would have approved of.  The wagon wheel and water trough also say to me, this isn''t quite as wild of a scene.  Other than those items, this is a pretty nice photo.  My personal bias (no score effect, really!) but to me, wildlife pics need to be color.  <br/>6 Swash</td>', 'I think cropping the trailer houses might have been a good idea that Ansel would have approved of.  The wagon wheel and water trough also say to me, this isn''t quite as wild of a scene.  Other than those items, this is a pretty nice photo.  My personal bias (no score effect, really!) but to me, wildlife pics need to be color.  6 Swash', '2003-02-28 19:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(226115, 12924, 1005, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Great detail on this bird!  I love bird shots, so you know you''re gonna get at least one good score!!  My nit is the fence - I know that wildlife shots don''t always "present themselves" in a perfect setting, but the fence takes a couple of notches away from the wildlife feel of this photo.  Great color!!  Focus is perfect!  9 Swash</td>', 'Wow!  Great detail on this bird!  I love bird shots, so you know you''re gonna get at least one good score!!  My nit is the fence - I know that wildlife shots don''t always "present themselves" in a perfect setting, but the fence takes a couple of notches away from the wildlife feel of this photo.  Great color!!  Focus is perfect!  9 Swash', '2003-02-28 19:30:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(226119, 12835, 1005, '<td valign="top">Neat shot, great detail!  Love your choice of backgrounds (I had to think about it a minute and you\''ll probably \"lose\" non-fly fishers, but I like it!)  Could you have used a smaller piece of cork?  9 Swash   Changed my mind, it''s a 10!</td>', 'Neat shot, great detail!  Love your choice of backgrounds (I had to think about it a minute and you\''ll probably \"lose\" non-fly fishers, but I like it!)  Could you have used a smaller piece of cork?  9 Swash   Changed my mind, it''s a 10!', '2003-02-28 19:39:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(226120, 13082, 1005, '<td valign="top">Wow, powerful and patriotic image.  Very good color, but I do wish the stars looked more white (I\''ve tried this, so I know my wish is either impossible or nearly impossible, so no score effect)  9 Swash  -  Changed my mind, it''s a 10!</td>', 'Wow, powerful and patriotic image.  Very good color, but I do wish the stars looked more white (I\''ve tried this, so I know my wish is either impossible or nearly impossible, so no score effect)  9 Swash  -  Changed my mind, it''s a 10!', '2003-02-28 19:39:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(226124, 12914, 1005, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo!  Great color and clarity.  The details of the building really show through.  Small suggestion - crop a tiny bit off the left as unneeded tree coming out of "nowhere", etc.  9 Swash</td>', 'I really like this photo!  Great color and clarity.  The details of the building really show through.  Small suggestion - crop a tiny bit off the left as unneeded tree coming out of "nowhere", etc.  9 Swash', '2003-02-28 19:45:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(226125, 13084, 5728, '<td valign="top">Nice colours here, you got me feeling hungry now. Originally a 5 but bumped up to an 8 for reasons of hunger :-)</td>', 'Nice colours here, you got me feeling hungry now. Originally a 5 but bumped up to an 8 for reasons of hunger :-)', '2003-02-28 19:47:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(226127, 13087, 1005, '<td valign="top">Wonderful near sunset photo of Seattle!  Isn''t the walkway a stronger, brighter red?  (Could be a faulty memory!)  9 Swash</td>', 'Wonderful near sunset photo of Seattle!  Isn''t the walkway a stronger, brighter red?  (Could be a faulty memory!)  9 Swash', '2003-02-28 19:49:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(226128, 12978, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very pretty, the water droplets are a great touch!  Cropping seems to me to be too much, I''m left wanting to see the edges of the flower.  Focus seem really good.  Color is nice.  8 Swash</td>', 'Very pretty, the water droplets are a great touch!  Cropping seems to me to be too much, I''m left wanting to see the edges of the flower.  Focus seem really good.  Color is nice.  8 Swash', '2003-02-28 19:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(226129, 12985, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  I am drawn to "snag shots".  Very good color and focus.  Framing - I don''t know everything, but limbs coming into the frame from other than the bottom leave me wanting.  (Don''t worry, it''s more of a nit than anything.)  8 Swash</td>', 'Very nice!  I am drawn to "snag shots".  Very good color and focus.  Framing - I don''t know everything, but limbs coming into the frame from other than the bottom leave me wanting.  (Don''t worry, it''s more of a nit than anything.)  8 Swash', '2003-02-28 19:53:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(226166, 13045, 472, '<td valign="top">excellent</td>', 'excellent', '2003-02-28 20:36:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(226167, 13108, 472, '<td valign="top">very cool</td>', 'very cool', '2003-02-28 20:36:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(226297, 13090, 1826, '<td valign="top">The ghostly figures are very cool. :)</td>', 'The ghostly figures are very cool. :)', '2003-03-01 07:39:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(226298, 13068, 1826, '<td valign="top">What can I say? Perfectly done! 10</td>', 'What can I say? Perfectly done! 10', '2003-03-01 07:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(226301, 12849, 1826, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, with great mood.</td>', 'Beautiful, with great mood.', '2003-03-01 07:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(226302, 12971, 1826, '<td valign="top">Nice and sharp.</td>', 'Nice and sharp.', '2003-03-01 07:52:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(226305, 13120, 1826, '<td valign="top">This would be just perfect for stock!</td>', 'This would be just perfect for stock!', '2003-03-01 08:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(226306, 12824, 3540, '<td valign="top">Unusual photo.  I''m not sure what this has to do with stock photography really.  I don''t like the way the right hand is cut off either.  The reflection above the hands is pretty cool looking tho.  Good luck!</td>', 'Unusual photo.  I''m not sure what this has to do with stock photography really.  I don''t like the way the right hand is cut off either.  The reflection above the hands is pretty cool looking tho.  Good luck!', '2003-03-01 08:30:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(226309, 13043, 3540, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and color tone choice.  Not so sure I would''ve cropped this quite so tightly unless I was trying to illustrate one specific region.</td>', 'Nice lighting and color tone choice.  Not so sure I would''ve cropped this quite so tightly unless I was trying to illustrate one specific region.', '2003-03-01 08:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(226310, 13045, 3084, '<td valign="top">Great image, vivid and strong</td>', 'Great image, vivid and strong', '2003-03-01 08:33:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(226311, 12915, 3084, '<td valign="top">Wonderful hues and gentle colours</td>', 'Wonderful hues and gentle colours', '2003-03-01 08:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(226312, 13098, 3540, '<td valign="top">Good advertising photo here.  I think the creative angle works well as well as the framing of the subject.   I might''ve turned the laptop just a fuzz so the keyboard was at a better angle for we viewers to see tho.  Nice pic</td>', 'Good advertising photo here.  I think the creative angle works well as well as the framing of the subject.   I might''ve turned the laptop just a fuzz so the keyboard was at a better angle for we viewers to see tho.  Nice pic', '2003-03-01 08:35:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(226313, 13117, 3540, '<td valign="top">Cool sky.  Cool background.  The boats really lack the crispness that I feel is essential in this type of shot.  It is a good concept, just a point of clarity really.</td>', 'Cool sky.  Cool background.  The boats really lack the crispness that I feel is essential in this type of shot.  It is a good concept, just a point of clarity really.', '2003-03-01 08:37:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(226314, 13061, 3540, '<td valign="top">Oh boy, snow!!  We''ve had our share.  Looks like a photojournalism type pic.  I think honestly its a little too dark tho.  Snow is indeed white and as bad as we tend to want to tone it down so the dpc voters dont cry "washed out", its still white and I believe it should be represented that way.</td>', 'Oh boy, snow!!  We''ve had our share.  Looks like a photojournalism type pic.  I think honestly its a little too dark tho.  Snow is indeed white and as bad as we tend to want to tone it down so the dpc voters dont cry "washed out", its still white and I believe it should be represented that way.', '2003-03-01 08:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(226315, 12927, 3540, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo.  I had to look at the page again...I almost did a In-depth critique on this for the Yellow challenge!!   Good macro photo.  I think the light is good, the focus is good and the color is great.  I''m not wild about the way the cob looks though.  Maybe if that was better lit, it would be better, but as it is, it looks pretty unsightly.   I think you should''ve done more of the water droplets on the kernals.  There is a small one on top and I think it looks pretty good.</td>', 'Interesting photo.  I had to look at the page again...I almost did a In-depth critique on this for the Yellow challenge!!   Good macro photo.  I think the light is good, the focus is good and the color is great.  I''m not wild about the way the cob looks though.  Maybe if that was better lit, it would be better, but as it is, it looks pretty unsightly.   I think you should''ve done more of the water droplets on the kernals.  There is a small one on top and I think it looks pretty good.', '2003-03-01 08:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(226317, 13074, 3540, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure how this would apply to stock photography too much, but I''ll pretend it does anyway.  The tight crop is not conducive to this angle IMO.  I think the picture would work better from a slightly less direct angle.  You could still keep the macro approach to it to some degree and still make it successful I think.  I would''ve cleaned off the tops of them too to free them from stains and such</td>', 'I''m not sure how this would apply to stock photography too much, but I''ll pretend it does anyway.  The tight crop is not conducive to this angle IMO.  I think the picture would work better from a slightly less direct angle.  You could still keep the macro approach to it to some degree and still make it successful I think.  I would''ve cleaned off the tops of them too to free them from stains and such', '2003-03-01 08:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(226318, 12922, 3540, '<td valign="top">The shadows are killing me on this photo. Very interesting building and one that is picture worthy.  The photo needs to be a little crisper too.</td>', 'The shadows are killing me on this photo. Very interesting building and one that is picture worthy.  The photo needs to be a little crisper too.', '2003-03-01 08:52:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(226320, 12869, 3540, '<td valign="top">The blue flares are not helping anything on this picture.  I think this one has a lot of potential, but the extremely shallow DOF is not conducive to this type of picture.  It would be a killer advertisement picture, if you could''ve pulled it off just a little better</td>', 'The blue flares are not helping anything on this picture.  I think this one has a lot of potential, but the extremely shallow DOF is not conducive to this type of picture.  It would be a killer advertisement picture, if you could''ve pulled it off just a little better', '2003-03-01 08:57:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(226321, 12835, 3540, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent photo of the subject.  The background looks more like a car rim instead of a fly-reel.  I think maybe a fish mount or something would''ve been more conducive to the picture.</td>', 'This is an excellent photo of the subject.  The background looks more like a car rim instead of a fly-reel.  I think maybe a fish mount or something would''ve been more conducive to the picture.', '2003-03-01 09:01:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(226322, 12823, 3540, '<td valign="top">Great photo.  Love the lights.  A pinch underexposed I think, but great angle and a really, really nice shot- 9<br/></td>', 'Great photo.  Love the lights.  A pinch underexposed I think, but great angle and a really, really nice shot- 9', '2003-03-01 09:05:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(226323, 12969, 3540, '<td valign="top">The blue thing on the side is way distracting to this pic.  Its a bit underexposed as well.  Overall not a bad shot</td>', 'The blue thing on the side is way distracting to this pic.  Its a bit underexposed as well.  Overall not a bad shot', '2003-03-01 09:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(226324, 12863, 3540, '<td valign="top">This looks a lot like one of my entries.  If you get a minute go to my profile and see.  awesome colors, but I think a little more exposure for the tree and the background would''ve improved it.</td>', 'This looks a lot like one of my entries.  If you get a minute go to my profile and see.  awesome colors, but I think a little more exposure for the tree and the background would''ve improved it.', '2003-03-01 09:11:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(226325, 13045, 3540, '<td valign="top">Good subject, DOF, lighting.  great job - 9</td>', 'Good subject, DOF, lighting.  great job - 9', '2003-03-01 09:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(226326, 12904, 3540, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure how this meets the challenge.  Regardless, the photo needs to be much clearer and crisper.  The focus just isn''t there.  I''d have lost the glasses too.</td>', 'I''m not sure how this meets the challenge.  Regardless, the photo needs to be much clearer and crisper.  The focus just isn''t there.  I''d have lost the glasses too.', '2003-03-01 09:20:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(226467, 13052, 2716, '<td valign="top">Love it!  That looks like a brand new addition to your family.  The subject is utlra cute and I like the tones of the picture (sepia?).   Jacko.   10</td>', 'Love it!  That looks like a brand new addition to your family.  The subject is utlra cute and I like the tones of the picture (sepia?).   Jacko.   10', '2003-03-01 20:15:09.000000', NULL, 1),
