(226469, 13105, 4411, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot. Nevermind an advert, it would look great in a magazine supporting an article.<br/>The softness of the face and minimal colours work really well. Needs a bit of spot editing to get the final product but otherwise great work. Well done.</td>', 'I like this a lot. Nevermind an advert, it would look great in a magazine supporting an article.The softness of the face and minimal colours work really well. Needs a bit of spot editing to get the final product but otherwise great work. Well done.', '2003-03-01 20:48:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(226478, 12938, 1031, '<td valign="top">Looks more like the "insole" line to me.</td>', 'Looks more like the "insole" line to me.', '2003-03-01 21:40:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(226481, 13108, 1031, '<td valign="top">You''d think they''d include the Capital.</td>', 'You''d think they''d include the Capital.', '2003-03-01 21:48:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(226484, 13043, 3280, '<td valign="top">Pretty good shot, the glare in the center of the globe is a bit of a distraction.  It may have worked better even if it was off-center.</td>', 'Pretty good shot, the glare in the center of the globe is a bit of a distraction.  It may have worked better even if it was off-center.', '2003-03-01 22:17:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(226485, 13123, 3280, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, might have been cropped a little more at the top. I think the brightness takes away from your sun rays which is the focal point.</td>', 'Nice shot, might have been cropped a little more at the top. I think the brightness takes away from your sun rays which is the focal point.', '2003-03-01 22:23:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(226486, 13045, 3280, '<td valign="top">Great shot, one of my favorite.  The colors are awesome.  It appears that it might be just a little over-sharpened but that could just be the roosters comb too. I love the title!</td>', 'Great shot, one of my favorite.  The colors are awesome.  It appears that it might be just a little over-sharpened but that could just be the roosters comb too. I love the title!', '2003-03-01 22:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(226487, 12806, 3280, '<td valign="top">Nice colors but seems to be a little bit too busy.</td>', 'Nice colors but seems to be a little bit too busy.', '2003-03-01 22:25:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(226488, 13061, 3280, '<td valign="top">Good shot that would work for stock. Seem a little soft on focus though.</td>', 'Good shot that would work for stock. Seem a little soft on focus though.', '2003-03-01 22:26:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(226489, 12953, 3280, '<td valign="top">Very nice, great colors and focus. Would work well for stock too.  Good job!</td>', 'Very nice, great colors and focus. Would work well for stock too.  Good job!', '2003-03-01 22:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(226490, 13120, 3280, '<td valign="top">Good shot, just a little too much light.  It seems too blown out.  I like the open area for text though.</td>', 'Good shot, just a little too much light.  It seems too blown out.  I like the open area for text though.', '2003-03-01 22:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(226491, 13108, 3280, '<td valign="top">I like this and think it works for the challenge.  It seems a little too orange though.</td>', 'I like this and think it works for the challenge.  It seems a little too orange though.', '2003-03-01 22:29:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(226492, 13086, 3280, '<td valign="top">Pretty good shot.  I''m not sure what the angle adds to this though.  It may have been better with the guy running on a level surface.</td>', 'Pretty good shot.  I''m not sure what the angle adds to this though.  It may have been better with the guy running on a level surface.', '2003-03-01 22:31:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(226493, 12914, 3280, '<td valign="top">Neat house and a good shot.  It may be cropped a little tight on the right side.</td>', 'Neat house and a good shot.  It may be cropped a little tight on the right side.', '2003-03-01 22:32:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(226494, 12866, 3280, '<td valign="top">It feels like everything is leaning to the left.</td>', 'It feels like everything is leaning to the left.', '2003-03-01 22:33:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(226496, 12882, 3280, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, I think this may have been improved by making it a bit more off center.</td>', 'Nice colors, I think this may have been improved by making it a bit more off center.', '2003-03-01 22:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(226497, 13025, 3280, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot.  The colors and composition are great.  It does seem a little too grainey though.</td>', 'I like this a lot.  The colors and composition are great.  It does seem a little too grainey though.', '2003-03-01 22:34:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(226499, 13098, 3280, '<td valign="top">I like this but feel that the angle might take away from the shot.  The colors and white background are great though.</td>', 'I like this but feel that the angle might take away from the shot.  The colors and white background are great though.', '2003-03-01 22:35:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(226500, 12985, 3280, '<td valign="top">Wow, super colors and lighting on the tree.  I wish that it wasn''t cropped off though.  It would have been nice to see it end against that blue sky.</td>', 'Wow, super colors and lighting on the tree.  I wish that it wasn''t cropped off though.  It would have been nice to see it end against that blue sky.', '2003-03-01 22:36:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(226501, 12924, 3280, '<td valign="top">Good job, great focus and contrast with the white and dark areas.</td>', 'Good job, great focus and contrast with the white and dark areas.', '2003-03-01 22:37:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(226502, 12988, 3280, '<td valign="top">This is great.  How on earth did you get that much focus on the branches in the square?</td>', 'This is great.  How on earth did you get that much focus on the branches in the square?', '2003-03-01 22:38:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(226503, 13099, 3280, '<td valign="top">Good composition, but maybe a litte too much red.</td>', 'Good composition, but maybe a litte too much red.', '2003-03-01 22:38:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(226504, 12862, 3280, '<td valign="top">Good shot and the colors are right on.  I think it is just a little too centered though.   Perhaps if you cropped it a little tighter on the bottom.</td>', 'Good shot and the colors are right on.  I think it is just a little too centered though.   Perhaps if you cropped it a little tighter on the bottom.', '2003-03-01 22:39:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(226505, 12835, 3280, '<td valign="top">This would be such an awesome photo with a better background.  The reel in the back is too centered and too busy, it really takes away from the fly.</td>', 'This would be such an awesome photo with a better background.  The reel in the back is too centered and too busy, it really takes away from the fly.', '2003-03-01 22:41:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(226571, 13125, 1037, '<td valign="top">Nice soft lighting, and the use of the sheets is interesting, but there''s something wrong with the composition here in my opinion. It just seems strange to me.</td>', 'Nice soft lighting, and the use of the sheets is interesting, but there''s something wrong with the composition here in my opinion. It just seems strange to me.', '2003-03-02 09:14:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(226573, 13105, 1037, '<td valign="top">Hehe, the title is a bit over the top... I''m not sure you took this challenge seriously. However, I absolutely LOVE this photo! It''s so dramatic and cool, full of movement, personality and atmosphere, the kind of wild creativity we don''t get much here. I''m giving it 10 and putting it in my favourites as soon as the challenge is over.</td>', 'Hehe, the title is a bit over the top... I''m not sure you took this challenge seriously. However, I absolutely LOVE this photo! It''s so dramatic and cool, full of movement, personality and atmosphere, the kind of wild creativity we don''t get much here. I''m giving it 10 and putting it in my favourites as soon as the challenge is over.', '2003-03-02 09:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(226575, 13082, 1037, '<td valign="top">This is a technically perfect photo of an American flag, with colours that will probably make a lot of people say "WOW! those colours POP!". But photos like this leave me cold... not because of the subject matter, more because of the crisp "perfect" look. I could render this in a 3D program and not be able to tell the difference.</td>', 'This is a technically perfect photo of an American flag, with colours that will probably make a lot of people say "WOW! those colours POP!". But photos like this leave me cold... not because of the subject matter, more because of the crisp "perfect" look. I could render this in a 3D program and not be able to tell the difference.', '2003-03-02 09:19:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(226576, 12924, 1037, '<td valign="top">Pretty. I like the detail in the feathers and the way you caught the hawk''s head in profile. The pleasantly blurry snowy background is well done. Nice framing.</td>', 'Pretty. I like the detail in the feathers and the way you caught the hawk''s head in profile. The pleasantly blurry snowy background is well done. Nice framing.', '2003-03-02 09:21:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(226577, 13109, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very, very cool. I love the shallow DOF, the rakish composition, and the vivid colours. The teeny scratches on that pipe stem are neat. 10!</td>', 'Very, very cool. I love the shallow DOF, the rakish composition, and the vivid colours. The teeny scratches on that pipe stem are neat. 10!', '2003-03-02 09:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(226579, 12942, 1037, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle, and evocative of a certain mood I feel when I''m waiting on a train platform, especially in winter. However, overall the photo lacks strong interest. It''s subtle and muted.</td>', 'Interesting angle, and evocative of a certain mood I feel when I''m waiting on a train platform, especially in winter. However, overall the photo lacks strong interest. It''s subtle and muted.', '2003-03-02 09:24:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(226581, 13052, 1037, '<td valign="top">As much as I love kittens, I''ve always thought newborns looked like mutants! You did well to take what seems like a really formal, studio style photo of this guy, but there are some problems with it. I like the soft focus look, I think that''s fine, but the tonal depth is a bit flat, the composiiton doesn''t seem tight, and it seems a little bit underexposed to me. The huge shadow over the kitten''s front paw (the one on the side near the camera) has an odd effect.</td>', 'As much as I love kittens, I''ve always thought newborns looked like mutants! You did well to take what seems like a really formal, studio style photo of this guy, but there are some problems with it. I like the soft focus look, I think that''s fine, but the tonal depth is a bit flat, the composiiton doesn''t seem tight, and it seems a little bit underexposed to me. The huge shadow over the kitten''s front paw (the one on the side near the camera) has an odd effect.', '2003-03-02 09:29:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(226583, 13123, 1037, '<td valign="top">Classic sky shot, very well composed and exposed.</td>', 'Classic sky shot, very well composed and exposed.', '2003-03-02 09:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(226585, 13096, 1037, '<td valign="top">OUCH! The overwhelming pinkness of this photo hurts my eyes!<br/> <br/>The idea here is interesting... the composition around these two objects and their shadows is pretty creative, but that colour... it''s just too much!</td>', 'OUCH! The overwhelming pinkness of this photo hurts my eyes! The idea here is interesting... the composition around these two objects and their shadows is pretty creative, but that colour... it''s just too much!', '2003-03-02 09:33:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(226586, 13092, 1037, '<td valign="top">The light is a little strong, making the sky overexposed to the point of being white. However, I kind of like the harsh, black shadows on the rocks because it emphasises their cragginess. The sheen of the water on the sand is good too.</td>', 'The light is a little strong, making the sky overexposed to the point of being white. However, I kind of like the harsh, black shadows on the rocks because it emphasises their cragginess. The sheen of the water on the sand is good too.', '2003-03-02 09:37:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(226588, 13084, 1037, '<td valign="top">Not a very appealing photo. The light is very strong, and it''s too tightly cropped. I would like to see it with a wider aperture (if you can control that) because it would give the photo more depth.</td>', 'Not a very appealing photo. The light is very strong, and it''s too tightly cropped. I would like to see it with a wider aperture (if you can control that) because it would give the photo more depth.', '2003-03-02 09:39:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(226589, 12988, 1037, '<td valign="top">Neat. I''m not sure it qualifies for "stock photography", but as a free study photo it is cool and unusual. Nice colours, and I enjoy the sense of mystery created by all that negative space.</td>', 'Neat. I''m not sure it qualifies for "stock photography", but as a free study photo it is cool and unusual. Nice colours, and I enjoy the sense of mystery created by all that negative space.', '2003-03-02 09:41:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(226590, 13089, 1037, '<td valign="top">Crazy shoes. Cool shallow DOF and framing. I like the colours and textures here. The subject matter doesn''t grab me, but your technique is full of flair :).</td>', 'Crazy shoes. Cool shallow DOF and framing. I like the colours and textures here. The subject matter doesn''t grab me, but your technique is full of flair :).', '2003-03-02 09:42:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(226591, 13074, 1037, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, probably quite good for stock photography (I''m a bit unsure though). The texturing on the lids really appeals to me. The framing seems a little awkward, but I really enjoy the softness of the glass way back there outside the depth of field.</td>', 'Interesting idea, probably quite good for stock photography (I''m a bit unsure though). The texturing on the lids really appeals to me. The framing seems a little awkward, but I really enjoy the softness of the glass way back there outside the depth of field.', '2003-03-02 09:44:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(226592, 13098, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very professional, and great for stock photography as I understand it (plenty of space for text).</td>', 'Very professional, and great for stock photography as I understand it (plenty of space for text).', '2003-03-02 09:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(226593, 13093, 1037, '<td valign="top">Lovely. Those trees are amazing in black and white. The perspective on the building is very fetching. I''m not sure about it being good for stock photography, but as a free study photo it''s gorgeous.</td>', 'Lovely. Those trees are amazing in black and white. The perspective on the building is very fetching. I''m not sure about it being good for stock photography, but as a free study photo it''s gorgeous.', '2003-03-02 09:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(226594, 13045, 1037, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait of a rooster. The combs stand out so brightly. The background is perfectly blurred. Not amazingly appealing, but technically very good.</td>', 'Nice portrait of a rooster. The combs stand out so brightly. The background is perfectly blurred. Not amazingly appealing, but technically very good.', '2003-03-02 09:48:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(226595, 13024, 1037, '<td valign="top">Neat. I think this would be great for stock photography. I can imagine it illustrating an article or a pamphlet on religion. I like the angle you took this photo at, and  I think black and white works well in making it appropriately bland to be a backdrop to other material without losing its interest.</td>', 'Neat. I think this would be great for stock photography. I can imagine it illustrating an article or a pamphlet on religion. I like the angle you took this photo at, and  I think black and white works well in making it appropriately bland to be a backdrop to other material without losing its interest.', '2003-03-02 09:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(226597, 13071, 1037, '<td valign="top">Cool... a technically good nature photo that would work well as a stock photo to be mixed with other material. Pleasant but not distracting.</td>', 'Cool... a technically good nature photo that would work well as a stock photo to be mixed with other material. Pleasant but not distracting.', '2003-03-02 09:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(226598, 13021, 1037, '<td valign="top">Funny :). You did well at making a photo look like tacky clip art :P.</td>', 'Funny :). You did well at making a photo look like tacky clip art :P.', '2003-03-02 09:53:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(226599, 13099, 1037, '<td valign="top">Neat. I like the way the shallow DOF makes the tips of the fork prongs blurry, bringing my eyes back up to the top of the fork. Nice colours.</td>', 'Neat. I like the way the shallow DOF makes the tips of the fork prongs blurry, bringing my eyes back up to the top of the fork. Nice colours.', '2003-03-02 09:55:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(226600, 13112, 1037, '<td valign="top">I preferred the flags that were submitted in the perspective challenge to this kind of straight ahead view. It''s very flat. I like a photo to have depth (just a personal bias).</td>', 'I preferred the flags that were submitted in the perspective challenge to this kind of straight ahead view. It''s very flat. I like a photo to have depth (just a personal bias).', '2003-03-02 09:57:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(226601, 13122, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic photojournalistic image. I''m not sure that it''s subdued enough for stock photography. If i imagine it accompanied by other material and text, I can see that I would be more interested in the buried cars than anything shown alongside them.</td>', 'Very dramatic photojournalistic image. I''m not sure that it''s subdued enough for stock photography. If i imagine it accompanied by other material and text, I can see that I would be more interested in the buried cars than anything shown alongside them.', '2003-03-02 09:59:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(226602, 12985, 1037, '<td valign="top">Neat! I like this a lot. The composition is very effective, and the colours are bold. I don''t mind the slight amount of grain.<br/> <br/>I''m not sure if it''s good for stock photography, but as a free study photo it''s very nice.</td>', 'Neat! I like this a lot. The composition is very effective, and the colours are bold. I don''t mind the slight amount of grain. I''m not sure if it''s good for stock photography, but as a free study photo it''s very nice.', '2003-03-02 10:01:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(226605, 13101, 1037, '<td valign="top">This image is quite busy and difficult to take in at once. It doesn''t seem appropriate for stock photography at all.</td>', 'This image is quite busy and difficult to take in at once. It doesn''t seem appropriate for stock photography at all.', '2003-03-02 10:03:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(226606, 12823, 1037, '<td valign="top">I think this works for stock photography. There''s a kind of dirty green colour cast to the sky though. I like night shots to be more bluish or purple, since those are colours we naturally associate with night, unless the photo suggests a specific kind of mood (red for a dangerous or threatening image, for example).</td>', 'I think this works for stock photography. There''s a kind of dirty green colour cast to the sky though. I like night shots to be more bluish or purple, since those are colours we naturally associate with night, unless the photo suggests a specific kind of mood (red for a dangerous or threatening image, for example).', '2003-03-02 10:05:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(226607, 12909, 1037, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective and really gorgeous colours. That path would work well for the "Leading Lines" challenge :). I think this would work as a stock photo.</td>', 'Nice perspective and really gorgeous colours. That path would work well for the "Leading Lines" challenge :). I think this would work as a stock photo.', '2003-03-02 10:07:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(226608, 13033, 1037, '<td valign="top">Wow! Cool idea, with lots of potential uses alongside articles about anything from puzzles to global terrorism :). Great idea, and lovely colours.</td>', 'Wow! Cool idea, with lots of potential uses alongside articles about anything from puzzles to global terrorism :). Great idea, and lovely colours.', '2003-03-02 10:08:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(226609, 12867, 1037, '<td valign="top">Definitely an image that could be used for stock photography, in my opinion. The composition is very good and I like the textures here.</td>', 'Definitely an image that could be used for stock photography, in my opinion. The composition is very good and I like the textures here.', '2003-03-02 10:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(226610, 13108, 1037, '<td valign="top">Colourful... but kind of a dull idea. I can see it having stock photography applications, but only in a very literal sense, for material that is specifically about Texas.</td>', 'Colourful... but kind of a dull idea. I can see it having stock photography applications, but only in a very literal sense, for material that is specifically about Texas.', '2003-03-02 10:11:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(226611, 13041, 1037, '<td valign="top">There''s just something weird and off-putting about this photo. Her mouth is a strange shape. The crop just seems too tight for me to make sense of the shapes... I can see what everything is, but nothing seems quite right.<br/> <br/>Someone else who looked at this over my shoulder suggested that if the lips were covering the teeth, the photo would work better, and  agree. The teeth are a distraction.</td>', 'There''s just something weird and off-putting about this photo. Her mouth is a strange shape. The crop just seems too tight for me to make sense of the shapes... I can see what everything is, but nothing seems quite right. Someone else who looked at this over my shoulder suggested that if the lips were covering the teeth, the photo would work better, and  agree. The teeth are a distraction.', '2003-03-02 10:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(226612, 12812, 1037, '<td valign="top">Annniiiiiiiida... I love what you did with our "live" pendant, but from looking at a lot of the other photos in the challenge so far, I can see that this seems more like an advertisement than a stock photo :/.</td>', 'Annniiiiiiiida... I love what you did with our "live" pendant, but from looking at a lot of the other photos in the challenge so far, I can see that this seems more like an advertisement than a stock photo :/.', '2003-03-02 10:15:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(226613, 12840, 1037, '<td valign="top">I love it! Great shallow DOF and the lighting is heavenly. I can see this having lots of uses in stock photography.</td>', 'I love it! Great shallow DOF and the lighting is heavenly. I can see this having lots of uses in stock photography.', '2003-03-02 10:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(226614, 13005, 1037, '<td valign="top">Such young boys.... Somehow I feel uneasy seeing a smiling face juxtaposed against army fatigues. It feels like it''s either advertising the military, or it''s a propaganda image. I guess that''s fine for stock photography though.</td>', 'Such young boys.... Somehow I feel uneasy seeing a smiling face juxtaposed against army fatigues. It feels like it''s either advertising the military, or it''s a propaganda image. I guess that''s fine for stock photography though.', '2003-03-02 10:18:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(226616, 13010, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very pixelated. I think you either have a low end camera, or used the wrong scaling method on this photo. The composition is fairly straightforward... I really like the colours here though. I think it could work as a stock photo if it was better executed.</td>', 'Very pixelated. I think you either have a low end camera, or used the wrong scaling method on this photo. The composition is fairly straightforward... I really like the colours here though. I think it could work as a stock photo if it was better executed.', '2003-03-02 10:20:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(226617, 13000, 1037, '<td valign="top">Illustrates a concept quite well, and would be useful in a lot of stock photography applications. However, the lighting doesn''t quite seem right to me. It''s too dark, and the spot on the background seems dirty, in a way.</td>', 'Illustrates a concept quite well, and would be useful in a lot of stock photography applications. However, the lighting doesn''t quite seem right to me. It''s too dark, and the spot on the background seems dirty, in a way.', '2003-03-02 10:22:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(226618, 13043, 1037, '<td valign="top">The composition of this seems awkward, and there isn''t enough contrast. Everything seems washed out and dull, so it''s hard to make out the details of the map on the globe.</td>', 'The composition of this seems awkward, and there isn''t enough contrast. Everything seems washed out and dull, so it''s hard to make out the details of the map on the globe.', '2003-03-02 10:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(226619, 12987, 1037, '<td valign="top">Maybe I''m weird, but there''s something scary about this girl! She seems like one of those  telepathic children in that old British sci-fi movie... I think it''s because the lighting is dramatic and eerie, her pose seems too stiff, and you used black and white.</td>', 'Maybe I''m weird, but there''s something scary about this girl! She seems like one of those  telepathic children in that old British sci-fi movie... I think it''s because the lighting is dramatic and eerie, her pose seems too stiff, and you used black and white.', '2003-03-02 10:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(226620, 13090, 5865, '<td valign="top">The colours in those flowers make for an amazing photograph.  It must have been difficult getting a good exposure as the lights in the ceiliing of the flower stall seem very bright.  The camera did well.  What would have made it for me is if there was someone in the front of the shot who was stationary - no movement at all while all of the others were shooting by, but I guess it''s  not that important.  Beautifully colourful shot.</td>', 'The colours in those flowers make for an amazing photograph.  It must have been difficult getting a good exposure as the lights in the ceiliing of the flower stall seem very bright.  The camera did well.  What would have made it for me is if there was someone in the front of the shot who was stationary - no movement at all while all of the others were shooting by, but I guess it''s  not that important.  Beautifully colourful shot.', '2003-03-02 10:29:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(226621, 13087, 1037, '<td valign="top">Where is this? It looks a bit like Boston, but I can''t be sure.<br/> <br/>Interesting red cast to everything... seems like a late afternoon/sunset image, but facing away from the sun. I think it would work well as a stock photo.</td>', 'Where is this? It looks a bit like Boston, but I can''t be sure. Interesting red cast to everything... seems like a late afternoon/sunset image, but facing away from the sun. I think it would work well as a stock photo.', '2003-03-02 10:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(226622, 12938, 1037, '<td valign="top">I can''t imagine this working with respect to stock photography at all. It''s an interesting, quirky image in it''s own right though. A bit soft and grainy, and could do with more contrast, but those shoes are intriguing. Gives me the feeling of a family holiday home on the beach, or something.</td>', 'I can''t imagine this working with respect to stock photography at all. It''s an interesting, quirky image in it''s own right though. A bit soft and grainy, and could do with more contrast, but those shoes are intriguing. Gives me the feeling of a family holiday home on the beach, or something.', '2003-03-02 10:37:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(226623, 13018, 1037, '<td valign="top">Cool! I miss those old phones. This would work very well as a stock photo, in my opinion, and it has a lot of kitsch charm.</td>', 'Cool! I miss those old phones. This would work very well as a stock photo, in my opinion, and it has a lot of kitsch charm.', '2003-03-02 10:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(226624, 12926, 1037, '<td valign="top">Cool. I think it would work as a stock photo. I really like the framing, and the overexposed look is appealing to me.</td>', 'Cool. I think it would work as a stock photo. I really like the framing, and the overexposed look is appealing to me.', '2003-03-02 10:43:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(226625, 12972, 1037, '<td valign="top">The lighting here seems very harsh, and the cropping is so tight it makes the image flat. Not a very appealing photo.</td>', 'The lighting here seems very harsh, and the cropping is so tight it makes the image flat. Not a very appealing photo.', '2003-03-02 10:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(226626, 12928, 1037, '<td valign="top">Bland but with strong technique. It would work for stock photography I think. However, there seems to be an icky yellow colour cast that doesn''t appeal to me.</td>', 'Bland but with strong technique. It would work for stock photography I think. However, there seems to be an icky yellow colour cast that doesn''t appeal to me.', '2003-03-02 10:46:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(226627, 12858, 1037, '<td valign="top">The lighting is a little dim, and not diffuse enough. I love the way you captured his pose and expression, but the photo overall isn''t very well executed.</td>', 'The lighting is a little dim, and not diffuse enough. I love the way you captured his pose and expression, but the photo overall isn''t very well executed.', '2003-03-02 10:48:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(226628, 12978, 1037, '<td valign="top">Nice flower photo, but I really don''t understand the idea of spraying flowers with water for photos. I find it distracting.</td>', 'Nice flower photo, but I really don''t understand the idea of spraying flowers with water for photos. I find it distracting.', '2003-03-02 10:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(226629, 12862, 1037, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of Salvador Dali''s couch. Very nice... I think it''s fine for a stock photo. The lighting and background are spot on, and the colours are gorgeous. 10 from me.</td>', 'Reminds me of Salvador Dali''s couch. Very nice... I think it''s fine for a stock photo. The lighting and background are spot on, and the colours are gorgeous. 10 from me.', '2003-03-02 10:50:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(226630, 12863, 1037, '<td valign="top">Neat colours. I think the sun is very overpowering for a stock photo. As a free study image, it''s lovely. I like the way the tree is silhouetted, although a lot of the foreground objects are a bit too dark to be made out, and thus confusing.</td>', 'Neat colours. I think the sun is very overpowering for a stock photo. As a free study image, it''s lovely. I like the way the tree is silhouetted, although a lot of the foreground objects are a bit too dark to be made out, and thus confusing.', '2003-03-02 10:52:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(226631, 12904, 1037, '<td valign="top">This girl looks kind of old fashioned or maybe a bit churchy. It gives the image an odd feeling for me. The lighting even makes it seem like she''s reading a book by candle light.</td>', 'This girl looks kind of old fashioned or maybe a bit churchy. It gives the image an odd feeling for me. The lighting even makes it seem like she''s reading a book by candle light.', '2003-03-02 10:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(226632, 12866, 1037, '<td valign="top">This is a very busy photo, and it seems to be tilted. I love the Asian style architecture, but it would be nice if some of the background elements could have been framed out.</td>', 'This is a very busy photo, and it seems to be tilted. I love the Asian style architecture, but it would be nice if some of the background elements could have been framed out.', '2003-03-02 10:56:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(226633, 12869, 1037, '<td valign="top">More of an advertising image. You''re not supposed to have a brand name in a stock photo.<br/> <br/>I like the bluish lighting and the dramatic shadows.</td>', 'More of an advertising image. You''re not supposed to have a brand name in a stock photo. I like the bluish lighting and the dramatic shadows.', '2003-03-02 10:58:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(226634, 12969, 1037, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting, but a dull image. It might work OK for stock photography, but I''m not sure.</td>', 'Nice lighting, but a dull image. It might work OK for stock photography, but I''m not sure.', '2003-03-02 11:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(226635, 12927, 1037, '<td valign="top">I don''t find this photo very appealing. My eyes are drawn to the core of the cob which looks kind of soggy and slimy! The composition is nice though.</td>', 'I don''t find this photo very appealing. My eyes are drawn to the core of the cob which looks kind of soggy and slimy! The composition is nice though.', '2003-03-02 11:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(226636, 12958, 1037, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous colours. Enough disorder to be a nice, abstract background for other graphic elements, but non-uniform enough not to be boring.</td>', 'Gorgeous colours. Enough disorder to be a nice, abstract background for other graphic elements, but non-uniform enough not to be boring.', '2003-03-02 11:05:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(226637, 13015, 1037, '<td valign="top">Nice atmospherid shot. I really like the composition of this, with all elements leading towards the vanishing point.</td>', 'Nice atmospherid shot. I really like the composition of this, with all elements leading towards the vanishing point.', '2003-03-02 11:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(226638, 12915, 1037, '<td valign="top">Interesting subdued, pastel colours. I think this would work OK as a stock photo, but it maybe seems a little bit too washed out. Lovely textures though, and the composition is effective.</td>', 'Interesting subdued, pastel colours. I think this would work OK as a stock photo, but it maybe seems a little bit too washed out. Lovely textures though, and the composition is effective.', '2003-03-02 11:08:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(226639, 13062, 1037, '<td valign="top">Neat camera angle. I love the composition of this. Somehow the water seems like a very icky shade of green, and perhaps it''s a little underexposed judging by the brightness of the colours despite low tonal depth. However, on the whole I like this photo.</td>', 'Neat camera angle. I love the composition of this. Somehow the water seems like a very icky shade of green, and perhaps it''s a little underexposed judging by the brightness of the colours despite low tonal depth. However, on the whole I like this photo.', '2003-03-02 11:11:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(226640, 13086, 1037, '<td valign="top">I absolutely LOVE this photo. I can''t say anything against it. I think it is a great stock photo that would fit with other material on any number of themes. 10 from me.</td>', 'I absolutely LOVE this photo. I can''t say anything against it. I think it is a great stock photo that would fit with other material on any number of themes. 10 from me.', '2003-03-02 11:13:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(226641, 13038, 1037, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo. It''s very moody and conveys a strong sense of place. It works for me on the level of art... I would love to have a big print of this on my wall... but as a stock photo I''m not sure it works. Still, I love it too much not to give it a 10!</td>', 'I really like this photo. It''s very moody and conveys a strong sense of place. It works for me on the level of art... I would love to have a big print of this on my wall... but as a stock photo I''m not sure it works. Still, I love it too much not to give it a 10!', '2003-03-02 11:15:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(226642, 12980, 1037, '<td valign="top">Would have been nice in the "Windows and Doors" challenge :). Great textures and nice composition. A little bit flat though.</td>', 'Would have been nice in the "Windows and Doors" challenge :). Great textures and nice composition. A little bit flat though.', '2003-03-02 11:17:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(226643, 13060, 1037, '<td valign="top">Interesting, colourful abstract shot, but I''m not sure if it''s a stock photo.</td>', 'Interesting, colourful abstract shot, but I''m not sure if it''s a stock photo.', '2003-03-02 11:19:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(226645, 13110, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very nice sky and great silhouettes. The composition is very strong. It may be a little too vivid for use as a stock photo.</td>', 'Very nice sky and great silhouettes. The composition is very strong. It may be a little too vivid for use as a stock photo.', '2003-03-02 11:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(226646, 12953, 1037, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure that this would work as a stock photo. It seems too obviously to be a study of a doll, and wouldn''t support other material, like titles or insets. The background is too dark and the doll is very strange.</td>', 'I''m not sure that this would work as a stock photo. It seems too obviously to be a study of a doll, and wouldn''t support other material, like titles or insets. The background is too dark and the doll is very strange.', '2003-03-02 11:23:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(226647, 13054, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very busy. I don''t think this would work as a stock photo at all. As a free study, it is a little too busy to be appealing to me.</td>', 'Very busy. I don''t think this would work as a stock photo at all. As a free study, it is a little too busy to be appealing to me.', '2003-03-02 11:24:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(226649, 12888, 368, '<td valign="top">a very simple idea ... i like it .. enough room for text ... something dealing with new ideas :)</td>', 'a very simple idea ... i like it .. enough room for text ... something dealing with new ideas :)', '2003-03-02 11:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(226650, 13061, 6870, '<td valign="top">I like how the lines you''ve inferred lead the eye around. You certainly have an interesting and useable subject. You might try fiddling wi th more contrast to get more darks. A starker images might be a more appropriate choice here.</td>', 'I like how the lines you''ve inferred lead the eye around. You certainly have an interesting and useable subject. You might try fiddling wi th more contrast to get more darks. A starker images might be a more appropriate choice here.', '2003-03-02 11:26:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(226651, 12872, 368, '<td valign="top">nice and simple .. it is elegant .... not quite sure on the composition of center of the page ... but it is executed very well</td>', 'nice and simple .. it is elegant .... not quite sure on the composition of center of the page ... but it is executed very well', '2003-03-02 11:26:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(226652, 13071, 6870, '<td valign="top">I like how you''ve used shadow to create focus on your subject: the pine cones. The theme of the challenge is wide enough to include this photo, and I really enjoy the varied textures created through blur and sharpness.</td>', 'I like how you''ve used shadow to create focus on your subject: the pine cones. The theme of the challenge is wide enough to include this photo, and I really enjoy the varied textures created through blur and sharpness.', '2003-03-02 11:28:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(226654, 13061, 1037, '<td valign="top">An interesting photojournalistic image, although it''s very washed out. It needs the contrast to be boosted a bit, or the levels tweaking.<br/> <br/>I don''t think it works as a stock photo though.</td>', 'An interesting photojournalistic image, although it''s very washed out. It needs the contrast to be boosted a bit, or the levels tweaking. I don''t think it works as a stock photo though.', '2003-03-02 11:32:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(226655, 13090, 1037, '<td valign="top">Wow, cool! I love the motion blur here. Reminds me a bit of the photo I took ages ago of markets, which is still my lowest rating photo ever :P. I''m sure a lot of people hate this one too, but I like it and I can imagine it working well as a stock photo.</td>', 'Wow, cool! I love the motion blur here. Reminds me a bit of the photo I took ages ago of markets, which is still my lowest rating photo ever :P. I''m sure a lot of people hate this one too, but I like it and I can imagine it working well as a stock photo.', '2003-03-02 11:33:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(226657, 12971, 1037, '<td valign="top">I think this would work as a stock photo, except for the fact that it features a brand name. That makes it useless for anything except an advertisement for that brand!</td>', 'I think this would work as a stock photo, except for the fact that it features a brand name. That makes it useless for anything except an advertisement for that brand!', '2003-03-02 11:35:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(226658, 12850, 1037, '<td valign="top">Nice rural scene with a great sky. I think it works as a stock photo.</td>', 'Nice rural scene with a great sky. I think it works as a stock photo.', '2003-03-02 11:36:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(226659, 12835, 1037, '<td valign="top">A very specific image, but I''m sure someone would need it at some point for an article or something. Nice shot. I like the background.</td>', 'A very specific image, but I''m sure someone would need it at some point for an article or something. Nice shot. I like the background.', '2003-03-02 11:37:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(226662, 12880, 1037, '<td valign="top">It''s a bit cheeky to put Ansell Adams'' name in your title. I''m sure you''ve had a lot of comments on it. Just being a black and white wilderness photo doesn''t make it Adamsesque.<br/> <br/>There isn''t much tonal depth in this image, making it seem overall grey and murky. The composition is OK. It seems like you either have a low end camera or you compressed this too much, because it seems pixelated.</td>', 'It''s a bit cheeky to put Ansell Adams'' name in your title. I''m sure you''ve had a lot of comments on it. Just being a black and white wilderness photo doesn''t make it Adamsesque. There isn''t much tonal depth in this image, making it seem overall grey and murky. The composition is OK. It seems like you either have a low end camera or you compressed this too much, because it seems pixelated.', '2003-03-02 11:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(226664, 12854, 1037, '<td valign="top">I think this is an excellent stock photo that would have a lot of applications. The only problem I see is the yellow background. Most stock photography of this nature that I see uses blue or neutral backgrounds because they are less likely to clash with the colour scheme of the other material the photo will be used to support. Yellow seems like a risk to me.</td>', 'I think this is an excellent stock photo that would have a lot of applications. The only problem I see is the yellow background. Most stock photography of this nature that I see uses blue or neutral backgrounds because they are less likely to clash with the colour scheme of the other material the photo will be used to support. Yellow seems like a risk to me.', '2003-03-02 11:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(226666, 13059, 1037, '<td valign="top">Well photographed, although the photo seems a bit bland to me. I think it could have uses as a stock photo, but a more generic building would be a safer bet.</td>', 'Well photographed, although the photo seems a bit bland to me. I think it could have uses as a stock photo, but a more generic building would be a safer bet.', '2003-03-02 11:45:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(226669, 13006, 1037, '<td valign="top">You''re such a role playing geek!! :P.<br/> <br/>I''m not sure that this would have a lot of uses as a stock photo, unless it was for a magazine specifically on the topic of role playing. The lighting seems too harsh and not diffuse enough, and the assortment of dice is too disordered to create a focal point for the composition.</td>', 'You''re such a role playing geek!! :P. I''m not sure that this would have a lot of uses as a stock photo, unless it was for a magazine specifically on the topic of role playing. The lighting seems too harsh and not diffuse enough, and the assortment of dice is too disordered to create a focal point for the composition.', '2003-03-02 11:47:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(226670, 13025, 1037, '<td valign="top">Good as a photojournalistic image, however the colours are very washed out. The contrast needs to be increased.</td>', 'Good as a photojournalistic image, however the colours are very washed out. The contrast needs to be increased.', '2003-03-02 11:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(226672, 12824, 1037, '<td valign="top">Creative composition. I''m not sure it works as a stock photo. The colours are very washed out. I think it could do with some work on post processing.</td>', 'Creative composition. I''m not sure it works as a stock photo. The colours are very washed out. I think it could do with some work on post processing.', '2003-03-02 11:52:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(226673, 12940, 1037, '<td valign="top">I like the strong light and lens flare in this. The tree silhouettes are nice. I think it''s a bit too stark for a stock photo though.</td>', 'I like the strong light and lens flare in this. The tree silhouettes are nice. I think it''s a bit too stark for a stock photo though.', '2003-03-02 11:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(226675, 12882, 1037, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure this would work as a stock photo. The composition is very central and the strong lines lead your eyes right up to the crisscrossed pattern in the centre. This would distract from any other material the photo was used to support.</td>', 'I''m not sure this would work as a stock photo. The composition is very central and the strong lines lead your eyes right up to the crisscrossed pattern in the centre. This would distract from any other material the photo was used to support.', '2003-03-02 11:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(226676, 12914, 1037, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colours and textures. I love the composition. It''s just a very, very cool photo. I''m not sure if it qualifies well as stock though, because it''s such an unusual structure.</td>', 'Beautiful colours and textures. I love the composition. It''s just a very, very cool photo. I''m not sure if it qualifies well as stock though, because it''s such an unusual structure.', '2003-03-02 11:56:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(226678, 13068, 1037, '<td valign="top">This seems very similar to a photo that''s been submitted here before... but I guess it''s a common idea. I can see it working well as a stock photo.</td>', 'This seems very similar to a photo that''s been submitted here before... but I guess it''s a common idea. I can see it working well as a stock photo.', '2003-03-02 11:57:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(226680, 12976, 1037, '<td valign="top">Nice rainbow. the photo seems a bit gloomy and washed out though. Some more tonal depth would be good, by raising the contrast.</td>', 'Nice rainbow. the photo seems a bit gloomy and washed out though. Some more tonal depth would be good, by raising the contrast.', '2003-03-02 11:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(226681, 13117, 1037, '<td valign="top">Great sky, and lovely composition around the boats and wharf. I think this could work as a stock photo.</td>', 'Great sky, and lovely composition around the boats and wharf. I think this could work as a stock photo.', '2003-03-02 11:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(226683, 12922, 1037, '<td valign="top">Great for a touristy brochure or something. This is a very interesting building, very nicely photographed.</td>', 'Great for a touristy brochure or something. This is a very interesting building, very nicely photographed.', '2003-03-02 12:01:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(226684, 12806, 1037, '<td valign="top">Strange idea. Very colourful, but the composition is too central without a good reason for it. The objects at the centre are underwhelming compared to the plate, in my opinion. I don''t think it would work in many applications as a stock photo.</td>', 'Strange idea. Very colourful, but the composition is too central without a good reason for it. The objects at the centre are underwhelming compared to the plate, in my opinion. I don''t think it would work in many applications as a stock photo.', '2003-03-02 12:02:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(226685, 13120, 1037, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of the unborn child at the end of "2001: A Space Odyssey". It''s very lovely, and I can see this working well as a stock photo, but the colours are a little washed out. Also, the border seems uneven.</td>', 'Reminds me of the unborn child at the end of "2001: A Space Odyssey". It''s very lovely, and I can see this working well as a stock photo, but the colours are a little washed out. Also, the border seems uneven.', '2003-03-02 12:04:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(226689, 12849, 1037, '<td valign="top">Amazing! I''ve seen a lot of tree silhouettes and stormy skies on this site, but this photo is exceptional! I have to give it 10.</td>', 'Amazing! I''ve seen a lot of tree silhouettes and stormy skies on this site, but this photo is exceptional! I have to give it 10.', '2003-03-02 12:05:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(226690, 13113, 1037, '<td valign="top">I think this focusses too much on a specific brand name. It couldn''t be used for many stock photo applications. The composition is good and you obviously worked hard on the lighting. Nice DOF.</td>', 'I think this focusses too much on a specific brand name. It couldn''t be used for many stock photo applications. The composition is good and you obviously worked hard on the lighting. Nice DOF.', '2003-03-02 12:07:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(226691, 12934, 1037, '<td valign="top">Seems ot use the flash... so the lighting is very harsh and the background dark, but still shows ugly shadows. The subject is good for a stock photo, but I don''t think it''s good enough technically.</td>', 'Seems ot use the flash... so the lighting is very harsh and the background dark, but still shows ugly shadows. The subject is good for a stock photo, but I don''t think it''s good enough technically.', '2003-03-02 12:08:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(226693, 12998, 1037, '<td valign="top">Shows a specific brand name, so it couldn''t be used as a stock photo unless it was advertising that brand. The colours are nice and vivid though.</td>', 'Shows a specific brand name, so it couldn''t be used as a stock photo unless it was advertising that brand. The colours are nice and vivid though.', '2003-03-02 12:08:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(226694, 12888, 1037, '<td valign="top">Neat shadow! I like this photo, although it seems a little confusing. I think it could work as a stock photo.</td>', 'Neat shadow! I like this photo, although it seems a little confusing. I think it could work as a stock photo.', '2003-03-02 12:09:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(226696, 12872, 1037, '<td valign="top">That title is extreme! But the photo is very beautiful. It would definitely work as a stock photo. The colours are just gorgeous. Seems a little bit jaggy along some edges though. I''m giving it 10 nonetheless.</td>', 'That title is extreme! But the photo is very beautiful. It would definitely work as a stock photo. The colours are just gorgeous. Seems a little bit jaggy along some edges though. I''m giving it 10 nonetheless.', '2003-03-02 12:11:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(226704, 12850, 368, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot ... and still leaves room for text ... or i can see this as a computer program background</td>', 'beautiful shot ... and still leaves room for text ... or i can see this as a computer program background', '2003-03-02 12:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(226723, 12849, 5475, '<td valign="top">What a great, moody image!  I like that this is not completely black and white (I think I see some blue tones in the clouds).  Nice shape, nice clouds.  The only thing I can think of to make this better would be to get rid of the trees in the background.  This one tree shot against the sky without the trees in the background would be very powerful (IMHO).  Nicely done and good luck in the challenge!  8 JD Anderson</td>', 'What a great, moody image!  I like that this is not completely black and white (I think I see some blue tones in the clouds).  Nice shape, nice clouds.  The only thing I can think of to make this better would be to get rid of the trees in the background.  This one tree shot against the sky without the trees in the background would be very powerful (IMHO).  Nicely done and good luck in the challenge!  8 JD Anderson', '2003-03-02 14:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(226726, 13000, 5475, '<td valign="top">The angle of your shot causes the broken link in the shadow to be low in the shot, wiht the actual link being high in the shot.  In my opinion, that''s what makes this shot great!  I think this is a great concept and your composition and angle are perfect.  The background is a little bit mottled and murky.  A tiny bit more light on the lower part of the chain would have been nice.   8   Nice shot and good luck in the challenge,<br/>JD ANderson</td>', 'The angle of your shot causes the broken link in the shadow to be low in the shot, wiht the actual link being high in the shot.  In my opinion, that''s what makes this shot great!  I think this is a great concept and your composition and angle are perfect.  The background is a little bit mottled and murky.  A tiny bit more light on the lower part of the chain would have been nice.   8   Nice shot and good luck in the challenge,JD ANderson', '2003-03-02 14:30:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(226731, 12938, 1019, '<td valign="top">Good idea beautifully composed and photographed--good balance in the composition</td>', 'Good idea beautifully composed and photographed--good balance in the composition', '2003-03-02 15:09:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(226732, 12988, 1019, '<td valign="top">Good composition and colour</td>', 'Good composition and colour', '2003-03-02 15:10:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(226733, 12980, 1019, '<td valign="top">Wonderful texture and contrast</td>', 'Wonderful texture and contrast', '2003-03-02 15:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(226734, 13068, 368, '<td valign="top">ooh i like this ... simple image ... straight (no pun intended) to the point ... heheh hmmm maybe it was intended ... i see this image large on a wall in a preschool or pediatricians office</td>', 'ooh i like this ... simple image ... straight (no pun intended) to the point ... heheh hmmm maybe it was intended ... i see this image large on a wall in a preschool or pediatricians office', '2003-03-02 15:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(226736, 13060, 368, '<td valign="top">not quite sure what you are trying to show here .... i dont really like the color choice ... if it was a blue tone and not as strong i can see it used as some kind of technology background, but right now it''s really hard to focus on because of the combo of red and green</td>', 'not quite sure what you are trying to show here .... i dont really like the color choice ... if it was a blue tone and not as strong i can see it used as some kind of technology background, but right now it''s really hard to focus on because of the combo of red and green', '2003-03-02 15:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(226773, 13105, 4007, '<td valign="top">I really like the hazy look and the shadowing on this one.  Nice shot.</td>', 'I really like the hazy look and the shadowing on this one.  Nice shot.', '2003-03-02 16:18:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(226775, 13109, 4007, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure about the crop.  The tight bottom right crop seems unbalenced with the looser top left crop.  And while I know it was intentional, I personally don''t like the focus being drawn to the foreground.. I think I would have prefered the foreground be out of focus and the other end of the pipe be in focus.</td>', 'I''m not sure about the crop.  The tight bottom right crop seems unbalenced with the looser top left crop.  And while I know it was intentional, I personally don''t like the focus being drawn to the foreground.. I think I would have prefered the foreground be out of focus and the other end of the pipe be in focus.', '2003-03-02 16:24:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(226776, 13010, 4007, '<td valign="top">interesting perspective.  I think the somewhat uneven look adds to the shot.</td>', 'interesting perspective.  I think the somewhat uneven look adds to the shot.', '2003-03-02 16:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(226777, 12928, 4007, '<td valign="top">having just the bottom row of buttons out of focus seems distracting to me.  My eyes are drawn to the # key and the 0 just because they don''t flow with the rest of the shot.  Otherwise I like the shot.  I even like that the non-digits buttons are blurred.. just a little more depth of field would help though.</td>', 'having just the bottom row of buttons out of focus seems distracting to me.  My eyes are drawn to the # key and the 0 just because they don''t flow with the rest of the shot.  Otherwise I like the shot.  I even like that the non-digits buttons are blurred.. just a little more depth of field would help though.', '2003-03-02 16:30:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(226779, 12998, 4007, '<td valign="top">Brand name in a stock photo isn''t good.  The shot is ok.  I think the glares on the beans detracts from the shot.  The variety of color is good.</td>', 'Brand name in a stock photo isn''t good.  The shot is ok.  I think the glares on the beans detracts from the shot.  The variety of color is good.', '2003-03-02 16:33:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(226782, 12866, 4007, '<td valign="top">I''d have straightened out the building and let the foreground tree be diagonal.  I like how the snow outlines everything in the shot.  Nice work.</td>', 'I''d have straightened out the building and let the foreground tree be diagonal.  I like how the snow outlines everything in the shot.  Nice work.', '2003-03-02 16:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(226783, 12980, 4007, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure how appealing this would be for stock photography, but it''s an awesome shot so I''ll ignore that fact.  I like the wide variation of textures in this shot.  The framing works well too.  Good luck.</td>', 'I''m not sure how appealing this would be for stock photography, but it''s an awesome shot so I''ll ignore that fact.  I like the wide variation of textures in this shot.  The framing works well too.  Good luck.', '2003-03-02 16:38:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(226784, 13025, 4007, '<td valign="top">Nice simple shot, but those white blotches at the bottom are killers, especially if you want a sellable shot.</td>', 'Nice simple shot, but those white blotches at the bottom are killers, especially if you want a sellable shot.', '2003-03-02 16:41:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(226786, 12976, 4007, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast between the subject of clouds and the rainbows.</td>', 'Nice contrast between the subject of clouds and the rainbows.', '2003-03-02 16:43:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(226790, 12915, 4007, '<td valign="top">Wow.  I love this shot.  The color is great, the subject, placement, crop, and everything are all wonderful.  I hope this one wins.  It''s my only 10 so far.</td>', 'Wow.  I love this shot.  The color is great, the subject, placement, crop, and everything are all wonderful.  I hope this one wins.  It''s my only 10 so far.', '2003-03-02 16:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(226796, 13025, 3102, '<td valign="top">Looks as though your lens had some droplets of water on it?  I''m afraid that takes a bit away from the shot.</td>', 'Looks as though your lens had some droplets of water on it?  I''m afraid that takes a bit away from the shot.', '2003-03-02 17:10:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(226799, 12985, 5728, '<td valign="top">The contrast between the tree and sky is amazing, and you got the image so sharp,  good one! The only thing I find distracting is the crop. I would have liked to have seen the tree fully in at least one direction. You got the tree cropped from the sides and the top, like a hand with no fingers. But it is a good stock photo for sure.</td>', 'The contrast between the tree and sky is amazing, and you got the image so sharp,  good one! The only thing I find distracting is the crop. I would have liked to have seen the tree fully in at least one direction. You got the tree cropped from the sides and the top, like a hand with no fingers. But it is a good stock photo for sure.', '2003-03-02 17:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(226801, 13087, 5728, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition. I can''t see any people anywhere, good one! This looks like an early morning shot right? That sky is amazing, I hope you do well with this.</td>', 'Wonderful composition. I can''t see any people anywhere, good one! This looks like an early morning shot right? That sky is amazing, I hope you do well with this.', '2003-03-02 17:27:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(226828, 12854, 368, '<td valign="top">nice a crisp - great use of the yellow background and DOF</td>', 'nice a crisp - great use of the yellow background and DOF', '2003-03-02 19:24:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(226830, 12985, 368, '<td valign="top">nice color and detail ... great texture</td>', 'nice color and detail ... great texture', '2003-03-02 19:27:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(226846, 12980, 4411, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot, can''t really put my finger on why though. A nice simple shot, good detail &amp; texture. Loads of possibilities for using it as a background for something.<br/>The red paint(?) needs editing out but otherwise a great shot. Well done.</td>', 'I like this a lot, can''t really put my finger on why though. A nice simple shot, good detail & texture. Loads of possibilities for using it as a background for something.The red paint(?) needs editing out but otherwise a great shot. Well done.', '2003-03-02 20:26:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(226848, 12924, 4411, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. Great detail and good composition. Could have done with some sunlight to brighten the colours I think, but still a great job. Well done.</td>', 'Beautiful. Great detail and good composition. Could have done with some sunlight to brighten the colours I think, but still a great job. Well done.', '2003-03-02 20:31:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(226897, 13098, 4411, '<td valign="top">A really good shot from an unusual angle. Great job of burning the background out (nothing that can''t be edited before submitting to a stock agency). Well done.</td>', 'A really good shot from an unusual angle. Great job of burning the background out (nothing that can''t be edited before submitting to a stock agency). Well done.', '2003-03-02 22:01:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(226900, 13043, 4411, '<td valign="top">Really nice shot. Sepia works really well giving it an olde world effect. Excellent detail and great composition. Well done.</td>', 'Really nice shot. Sepia works really well giving it an olde world effect. Excellent detail and great composition. Well done.', '2003-03-02 22:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(226906, 12971, 4411, '<td valign="top">A good shot, nice composition &amp; a great job burning the background out. I was thinking that the brand name would really restrict the possible uses for this shot, but I guess any ski shop that sells that brand could happily use it. Good work, well done.</td>', 'A good shot, nice composition & a great job burning the background out. I was thinking that the brand name would really restrict the possible uses for this shot, but I guess any ski shop that sells that brand could happily use it. Good work, well done.', '2003-03-02 22:05:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(226909, 13087, 4411, '<td valign="top">Wow, a stunning looking city - all the buildings are colour coordinated! Must remember to look where this was shot.<br/>Composition is excellent and I am so jealous of that clear blue sky. Great work, well done.</td>', 'Wow, a stunning looking city - all the buildings are colour coordinated! Must remember to look where this was shot.Composition is excellent and I am so jealous of that clear blue sky. Great work, well done.', '2003-03-02 22:07:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(226913, 12867, 4411, '<td valign="top">Nice. Only suggestion I can make is that a new ball would have been slightly better, although the worn look isn''t at all bad.<br/>Great composition &amp; lighting, and the amount of detail is fantastic. Well done.</td>', 'Nice. Only suggestion I can make is that a new ball would have been slightly better, although the worn look isn''t at all bad.Great composition & lighting, and the amount of detail is fantastic. Well done.', '2003-03-02 22:09:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(226925, 13068, 6900, '<td valign="top">I can''t help but think this will do well.  I wish there was a tiny bit more marker in the picture, though.</td>', 'I can''t help but think this will do well.  I wish there was a tiny bit more marker in the picture, though.', '2003-03-02 22:20:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(226936, 13005, 1280, '<td valign="top">This would work for a stock shot.  Well done.</td>', 'This would work for a stock shot.  Well done.', '2003-03-02 22:51:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(226939, 12987, 1280, '<td valign="top">This is cute.  She looks like such a sweet little lady.  The odd thing is the stripes in her hair.  Is it light and shadow.  Positioning her somewhere else might eliminate that.  The chair goes well though, so keep that.</td>', 'This is cute.  She looks like such a sweet little lady.  The odd thing is the stripes in her hair.  Is it light and shadow.  Positioning her somewhere else might eliminate that.  The chair goes well though, so keep that.', '2003-03-02 22:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(226945, 13045, 1280, '<td valign="top">Good one...well exposed showing good detail in the feathers.  The eye could be a little better exposed though. I like the way the comb is translucent.  Great color!  And you left room for text!  Very ncie.</td>', 'Good one...well exposed showing good detail in the feathers.  The eye could be a little better exposed though. I like the way the comb is translucent.  Great color!  And you left room for text!  Very ncie.', '2003-03-02 22:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(226948, 12940, 554, '<td valign="top">my favorite...can''t wait to see how you did it</td>', 'my favorite...can''t wait to see how you did it', '2003-03-02 22:58:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(226949, 12882, 1280, '<td valign="top">Quite vivid coloring, and interesting perspective. That one bleached out area is unfortunate. Overall nice capture anyway.</td>', 'Quite vivid coloring, and interesting perspective. That one bleached out area is unfortunate. Overall nice capture anyway.', '2003-03-02 22:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
